트는 GitHub Pull Request의 관리를 단순화하기 위한 커뮤니티 주도적인 Python 구현입니다","es":"github-pr es una implementación de pypto impulsada por la comunidad, diseñada para desarrolladores","fr":"github-pr est une implémentation de pypto pilotée par la communauté, conçue pour les développeurs","de":"github-pr ist eine communitygetriebene pypto-Implementierung, entwickelt für Entwickler","pt":"O github-pr é uma implementação pypto baseada na comunidade, projetada para desenvolvedores.","ru":"github-pr - это реализация pypto, управляемая сообществом, предназначенная для разработчиков.","ar":"github-pr هو تنفيذ pypto مدعوم من المجتمع، مصمم لمطوري البرمجيات.","en":"A community-driven pypto implementation "},"definition":{"en":"A community-driven pypto implementation "},"features":{"zh":["社区驱动的Python实现","自动化GitHub Pull Request的管理","支持多种GitHub API","可自定义的工作流","高可扩展性和可维护性"],"ja":["コミュニティ駆動のPython実装","GitHub Pull Requestの管理を自動化","複数のGitHub APIをサポート","カスタマイズ可能なワークフロー","高可拡張性とメンテナンス性"],"ko":["커뮤니티 주도적인 Python 구현","GitHub Pull Request의 관리를 자동화","다수의 GitHub API를 지원","사용자 정의 가능한 워크플로","높은 확장성과 유지보수성"],"es":["Implementación de pypto","Impulsada por la comunidad","Diseñada para desarrolladores","Integración con GitHub","Compatibilidad con Python"],"fr":["Implémentation de pypto","Pilotée par la communauté","Conçue pour les développeurs","Intégration avec GitHub","Compatibilité avec Python"],"de":["pypto-Implementierung","Communitygetrieben","Entwickelt für Entwickler","Integration mit GitHub","Kompatibilität mit Python"],"pt":["Implementação pypto","Comunidade ativa","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Integração com github","Código aberto"],"ru":["Реализация pypto","Активное сообщество","Инструменты разработки","Интеграция с github","Открытый код"],"ar":["تنفيذ pypto","مجتمع نشط","أدوات تطوير","التكامل مع github","كود مفتوح"]},"keywords":{"zh":["GitHub PR AI工具","Python实现","自动化GitHub Pull Request","GitHub API","工作流自动化","如何使用GitHub PR AI工具","GitHub PR AI工具安装指南","GitHub PR AI工具替代品"],"ja":["GitHub PR AIエージェント","Python実装","GitHub Pull Requestの自動化","GitHub API","ワークフローの自動化","GitHub PR AIエージェントの使い方","GitHub PR AIエージェントのインストールガイド","GitHub PR AIエージェントの代替品"],"ko":["GitHub PR AI 에이전트","Python 구현","GitHub Pull Request의 자동화","GitHub API","워크플로의 자동화","GitHub PR AI 에이전트의 사용법","GitHub PR AI 에이전트의 설치 가이드","GitHub PR AI 에이전트의 대안"],"es":["herramientas de AI","implementación de pypto","github-pr","desarrollo de software","integración con GitHub","cómo usar github-pr","alternativas a github-pr"],"fr":["outils IA","implémentation de pypto","github-pr","développement de logiciels","intégration avec GitHub","comment utiliser github-pr","alternatives à github-pr"],"de":["KI-Tools","pypto-Implementierung","github-pr","Software-Entwicklung","Integration mit GitHub","wie man github-pr verwendet","Alternativen zu github-pr"],"pt":["github-pr","pypto","ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento de software","como usar github-pr","o que é pypto","github-pr vs gitlab","instalar github-pr"],"ru":["github-pr","pypto","ИИ агенты","разработка программного обеспечения","как использовать github-pr","что такое pypto","github-pr vs gitlab","установить github-pr"],"ar":["github-pr","pypto","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","كيفية استخدام github-pr","ما هو pypto","github-pr vs gitlab","تثبيت github-pr"]}},"owner":"hw-native-sys","repo":"pypto","repoPath":"hw-native-sys/pypto","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.721Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-pr","description":"Create a GitHub pull request after committing, rebasing, and pushing changes. Use when the user asks to create a PR, submit changes for review, or open a pull request.","bodyPreview":"# PyPTO GitHub Pull Request Workflow\n\n## Workflow Steps\n\n1. **Prepare branch and commit** (if on main or uncommitted changes)\n2. Check for existing PR (exit if found)\n3. Fetch upstream changes\n4. Rebase onto upstream/main\n5. Resolve conflicts if needed\n6. Push to fork with `--force-with-lease`\n7. Create PR using gh CLI\n\n## Step 1: Prepare Branch and Commit\n\n**Check current state:**\n\n```bash\nBRANCH_NAME=$(git branch --show-current)\ngit status --porcelain                              # Check for u","body":"# PyPTO GitHub Pull Request Workflow\n\n## Workflow Steps\n\n1. **Prepare branch and commit** (if on main or uncommitted changes)\n2. Check for existing PR (exit if found)\n3. Fetch upstream changes\n4. Rebase onto upstream/main\n5. Resolve conflicts if needed\n6. Push to fork with `--force-with-lease`\n7. Create PR using gh CLI\n\n## Step 1: Prepare Branch and Commit\n\n**Check current state:**\n\n```bash\nBRANCH_NAME=$(git branch --show-current)\ngit status --porcelain                              # Check for uncommitted changes\ngit fetch upstream 2>/dev/null || git fetch origin  # Fetch latest\nif git rev-parse --verify upstream/main >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n  BASE_REF=upstream/main\nelse\n  BASE_REF=origin/main\nfi\ngit rev-list HEAD --not \"$BASE_REF\" --count         # Commits ahead of base\n```\n\nA branch \"needs a new branch\" when it is effectively on main — either the branch name is `main`/`master`, **or** it has zero commits ahead of upstream/main (e.g., a local branch that was never diverged).\n\n**Decision logic:**\n\n| Needs new branch? | Uncommitted changes? | Action |\n| ----------------- | -------------------- | ------ |\n| Yes | Yes | Create new branch, then commit via `/git-commit` |\n| Yes | No | Error — nothing to PR. Tell user to make changes first |\n| No | Yes | Commit on current branch via `/git-commit` |\n| No | No | Skip — already committed on a feature branch |\n\n**If a new branch is needed:**\n\n1. Auto-generate a branch name with a meaningful prefix (`feat/`, `fix/`, `refactor/`, `chore/`, `docs/`, `test/`) based on the changes — do NOT ask the user\n2. Create and switch to the new branch:\n\n```bash\ngit checkout -b <branch-name>\n```\n\n1. Commit via `/git-commit` skill (mandatory — runs code review, testing, linting)\n\n**If on an existing feature branch with uncommitted changes:**\n\nCommit via `/git-commit` skill before proceeding.\n\n## Step 2: Check for Existing PR\n\n```bash\nBRANCH_NAME=$(git branch --show-current)\ngh pr list --head \"$BRANCH_NAME\" --state open\n```\n\n**If PR exists**: Display with `gh pr view` and exit immediately.\n\n## Step 3: Fetch Upstream\n\n```bash\ngit remote add upstream https://github.com/hw-native-sys/pypto.git  # If needed\ngit fetch upstream\n```\n\n## Step 4: Rebase\n\n```bash\ngit rebase upstream/main  # Or user-specified branch\n```\n\n**On conflicts**:\n\n```bash\ngit status                     # View conflicts\n# Edit files, remove markers\ngit add path/to/resolved/file\ngit rebase --continue\n# If stuck: git rebase --abort\n```\n\n## Step 5: Push\n\n```bash\n# First push\ngit push --set-upstream origin BRANCH_NAME\n\n# After rebase (use --force-with-lease, NOT --force)\ngit push --force-with-lease origin BRANCH_NAME\n```\n\n⚠️ **Use `--force-with-lease`** - safer than `--force`, fails if remote has unexpected changes.\n\n## Step 6: Create PR\n\n**Check gh CLI**:\n\n```bash\ngh auth status\n```\n\n**If gh NOT available**: Report to user and provide manual URL: `https://github.com/hw-native-sys/pypto/compare/main...BRANCH_NAME`\n\n**If gh available**:\n\n```bash\ngh pr create \\\n  --title \"Brief description of changes\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n- Key change 1\n- Key change 2\n\n## Testing\n- [ ] All tests pass\n- [ ] Code review completed\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n\n## Related Issues\nFixes #ISSUE_NUMBER (if applicable)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**PR Title/Body**: Auto-extracted from commit messages since upstream/main.\n\n**Important**:\n\n- ❌ Do NOT add footers like \"🤖 Generated with Claude Code\" or similar branding\n- ✅ Keep PR descriptions professional and focused on technical content only\n\n## Common Issues\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n| ----- | -------- |\n| PR already exists | `gh pr view` then exit |\n| Merge conflicts | Resolve, `git add`, `git rebase --continue` |\n| Push rejected | `git push --force-with-lease` |\n| gh not authenticated | Tell user to run `gh auth login` |\n| Wrong upstream branch | Use `git rebase upstream/BRANCH` |\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Branch prepared (created from main if needed)\n- [ ] Changes committed via `/git-commit` (if uncommitted changes existed)\n- [ ] No existing PR for branch (exit if found)\n- [ ] Fetched upstream and rebased successfully\n- [ ] Conflicts resolved\n- [ ] Pushed with `--force-with-lease`\n- [ ] PR created with clear title/body\n\n## Remember\n\n- Always rebase before creating PR\n- Use `--force-with-lease`, not `--force`\n- Don''t auto-install gh CLI - let user do it\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:51:43.005Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Version Control Agents needing automated GitHub pull request management.","zh":"适用于需要自动化 GitHub 拉取请求管理的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが自動化された GitHub プルリクエスト管理を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"자동화된 GitHub 풀 리퀘스트 관리가 필요한 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Control de Versiones que necesitan una gestión automatizada de solicitudes de extracción de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Contrôle de Version nécessitant une gestion automatisée des demandes d''extraction GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für Version Control Agents, die eine automatisierte GitHub-Pull-Request-Verwaltung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Controle de Versão que precisam de gerenciamento automatizado de solicitações de pull do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, нуждающихся в автоматизированном управлении запросами на вытягивание в GitHub.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة الإصدار الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة طلبات السحب التلقائي على جيثب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to streamline GitHub workflows using the gh CLI, resolving conflicts and pushing updates to forks with --force-with-lease, while ensuring a clean and up-to-date repository by rebasing onto upstream/main.","zh":"通过 gh CLI 使用 gh CLI 解决冲突并将更新推送到分支，确保仓库干净且最新，通过重新分支到上游/主分支来解决冲突。","ja":"エージェントが GitHub ワークフローを自動化し、gh CLI を使用してフォークに更新を強制的にプッシュし、リポジトリを最新の状態に維持することを可能にする。","ko":"에이전트가 GitHub 워크플로를 자동화하고 gh CLI를 사용하여 업데이트를 강제로 푸시하고 리포지토리를 최신 상태로 유지할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los flujos de trabajo de GitHub utilizando el CLI de gh, resolviendo conflictos y actualizando forks con --force-with-lease, asegurando un repositorio limpio y actualizado mediante rebasado en upstream/main.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les flux de travail GitHub en utilisant le CLI gh, en résolvant les conflits et en mettant à jour les forks avec --force-with-lease, tout en garantissant un référentiel propre et à jour en réorganisant sur upstream/main.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, GitHub-Workflows mithilfe des gh-CLI zu optimieren, Konflikte zu lösen und Forks mit --force-with-lease zu aktualisieren, während ein sauberes und aktuelles Repository durch Rebasieren auf upstream/main sichergestellt wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes simplifiquem os fluxos de trabalho do GitHub usando o gh CLI, resolvendo conflitos e enviando atualizações para bifurcações com --force-with-lease, garantindo um repositório limpo e atualizado ao reorganizar em upstream/main.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать рабочие процессы GitHub с помощью gh CLI, решая конфликты и выталкивая обновления в форки с --force-with-lease, обеспечивая чистоту и актуальность репозитория за счет ребейза на upstream/main.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تبسيط سير عمل جيثب باستخدام واجهة سطر الأوامر gh، وحل النزاعات وإرسال التحديثات إلى الفروع مع --force-with-lease، مع ضمان الحفاظ على مستودع نظيف ومحدّث من خلال إعادة الترتيب في upstream/main."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation","Rebasing local branches onto upstream/main","Resolving merge conflicts using git status and porcelain commands"],"zh":["自动化创建拉取请求","重新分支到上游/主分支","使用 git 상태 和_porcelain 命令解析合并冲突"],"ja":["プルリクエストの作成を自動化する","ローカルブランチを上游/メインブランチに再生する","git 状態 と_porcelain コマンドを使用してマージコンフリクトを解決する"],"ko":["자동화된 풀 리퀘스트 생성","로컬 브랜치 재분기 到 업스트림/메인 브랜치","git 상태 및_porcelain 명령을 사용하여 병합 충돌을 해결"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de solicitudes de extracción","Rebasado de ramas locales en upstream/main","Resolución de conflictos de fusión utilizando git status y comandos de porcelana"],"fr":["Automation de la création de demandes d''extraction","Réorganisation de branches locales sur upstream/main","Résolution de conflits de fusion en utilisant git status et des commandes de porcelaine"],"de":["Automatisierung der Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Rebasieren lokaler Zweige auf upstream/main","Auflösung von Merge-Konflikten unter Verwendung von git status und Porzellan-Befehlen"],"pt":["Criação automática de solicitações de pull","Reorganização de branches locais em upstream/main","Resolução de conflitos de mesclagem usando git status e comandos de porcelana"],"ru":["Автоматическое создание запросов на вытягивание","Ребейз локальных веток на upstream/main","Разрешение конфликтов слияния с помощью git status и порцелановых команд"],"ar":["إنشاء طلبات السحب التلقائي","إعادة تنظيم الفروع المحلية في upstream/main","حل نزاعات الدمج باستخدام git status وأوامر البورسلين"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub repository access","Needs gh CLI installed","Limited to Git version control system"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 仓库访问权限","需要 gh CLI 설치","仅限于 Git 版本控制系统"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","gh CLI のインストールが必要","Git 版本管理システムのみ"],"ko":["GitHub 리포지토리 접근 권한 필요","gh CLI 설치 필요","Git 버전 제어 시스템만"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Necesita el CLI de gh instalado","Limitado al sistema de control de versiones Git"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Nécessite le CLI gh installé","Limité au système de contrôle de version Git"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Benötigt den installierten gh-CLI","Begrenzt auf das Git-versionskontrollsystem"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório do GitHub","Necessita do gh CLI instalado","Limitado ao sistema de controle de versão Git"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию GitHub","Требует установленного gh CLI","Ограничен системой контроля версий Git"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع جيثب","يحتاج إلى تثبيت واجهة سطر الأوامر gh","محدود بنظام إدارة الإصدار جيت"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0c2aa6732a895231102b6c7f1a18925388d3f350613b8f2d5c0a32b7fe421acc","qualityScore":28}');
