Node.js para servicios de backend","Uso de la interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI) para la implementación","Compatibilidad con herramientas de inteligencia artificial para la creación de gráficos","Soporte para la personalización de gráficos"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de graphiques avec React","Utilisation de Python pour l''analyse de données","Intégration avec Node.js pour les services de backend","Utilisation de l''interface de ligne de commande (CLI) pour la mise en œuvre","Compatibilité avec des outils d''intelligence artificielle pour la création de graphiques","Prise en charge de la personnalisation de graphiques"],"de":["Implementierung von Charts mit React","Verwendung von Python für die Datenanalyse","Integration mit Node.js für Backend-Services","Verwendung der Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI) für die Implementierung","Kompatibilität mit KI-Tools für die Erstellung von Charts","Unterstützung für die Anpassung von Charts"],"pt":["Implementação de chart em monorepo para SG Cars Trends","Uso de ferramentas para criar chart","Integração com outros serviços de backend","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos com chart"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для Implementação de Chart em Monorepo para SG Cars Trends","Устойчивость к ошибкам и нестабильности","Интеграция с другими сервисами","Разработка приложений с чартами"],"ar":["التحليل البياني في Monorepo لل SG Cars Trends","استخدام أدوات للتحليل البياني","التحليل مع altri servicios de backend","التطوير التطبيقي مع charts"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用chart-implementation","什么是chart-implementation","chart-implementation替代品","chart-implementation vs 其他工具","chart-implementation安装","chart-implementation设置指南","SG Cars Trends后端服务开发","AI智能代理"],"ja":["chart-implementationの使い方","chart-implementationとは","chart-implementationの代替品","chart-implementation vs 他のツール","chart-implementationのインストール","chart-implementationの設定ガイド","SG Cars Trendsバックエンドサービスの開発","AIエージェント"],"ko":["chart-implementation 사용법","chart-implementation이란","chart-implementation 대체품","chart-implementation vs 다른 도구","chart-implementation 설치","chart-implementation 설정 가이드","SG Cars Trends 백엔드 서비스 개발","AI 에이전트"],"es":["cómo implementar gráficos con herramientas de inteligencia artificial","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para gráficos","implementación de gráficos con React","alternativas a D3.js","guía de instalación de Chart.js","configuración de gráficos con Node.js","personalización de gráficos con Python","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para análisis de datos","creación de gráficos con herramientas de inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["comment mettre en œuvre des graphiques avec des outils d''intelligence artificielle","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour graphiques","mise en œuvre de graphiques avec React","alternatives à D3.js","guide d''installation de Chart.js","configuration de graphiques avec Node.js","personnalisation de graphiques avec Python","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour l''analyse de données","création de graphiques avec des outils d''intelligence artificielle"],"de":["wie man Charts mit KI-Tools implementiert","KI-Tools für Charts","Implementierung von Charts mit React","Alternativen zu D3.js","Installationsanleitung für Chart.js","Konfiguration von Charts mit Node.js","Anpassung von Charts mit Python","KI-Tools für Datenanalyse","Erstellung von Charts mit KI-Tools"],"pt":["Implementação de chart em monorepo para SG Cars Trends","Uso de ferramentas para criar chart","Integração com outros serviços de backend","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos com chart","Como usar chart em monorepo","Chart-implementation em monorepo"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для Implementação de Chart em Monorepo para SG Cars Trends","Устойчивость к ошибкам и нестабильности","Интеграция с другими сервисами","Разработка приложений с чартами","ИИ Агенты для Implementação de Chart em Monorepo","ИИ Агенты для Implementação de Chart em Monorepo para SG Cars Trends"],"ar":["التحليل البياني في Monorepo لل SG Cars Trends","استخدام أدوات للتحليل البياني","التحليل مع altri servicios de backend","التطوير التطبيقي مع charts","كيفية استخدام chart في monorepo","التحليل البياني في Monorepo لل SG Cars Trends"]}},"owner":"sgcarstrends","repo":"sgcarstrends","repoPath":"sgcarstrends/sgcarstrends","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.728Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"chart-implementation","description":"Create interactive charts for car registration and COE data visualization using Recharts. Use when adding new chart types, fixing chart bugs, or implementing data visualizations.","bodyPreview":"# Chart Implementation Skill\n\nUses **Recharts** via shadcn/ui `ChartContainer` for data visualization. Always use CSS variables for colors (see `design-language-system` skill).\n\n## Core Pattern\n\nAll charts use `ChartContainer` from `@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart` wrapped in `ChartWidget` from `@web/components/charts/widget`. **Never use raw `ResponsiveContainer` directly.**\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  ChartContainer,\n  ChartTooltip,\n  ChartTooltipContent,\n} from \"@sgcarstrends/ui/compo","body":"# Chart Implementation Skill\n\nUses **Recharts** via shadcn/ui `ChartContainer` for data visualization. Always use CSS variables for colors (see `design-language-system` skill).\n\n## Core Pattern\n\nAll charts use `ChartContainer` from `@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart` wrapped in `ChartWidget` from `@web/components/charts/widget`. **Never use raw `ResponsiveContainer` directly.**\n\n```tsx\n\"use client\";\n\nimport {\n  ChartContainer,\n  ChartTooltip,\n  ChartTooltipContent,\n} from \"@sgcarstrends/ui/components/chart\";\nimport { ChartWidget } from \"@web/components/charts/widget\";\nimport { BarChart, Bar, CartesianGrid, XAxis, YAxis } from \"recharts\";\n\nexport function TopMakesChart({ data }: { data: { make: string; count: number }[] }) {\n  const chartConfig = {\n    count: { label: \"Count\", color: \"var(--chart-1)\" },\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <ChartWidget title=\"Top Makes\" isEmpty={data.length === 0}>\n      <ChartContainer config={chartConfig} className=\"h-[300px] w-full\">\n        <BarChart data={data}>\n          <CartesianGrid vertical={false} strokeDasharray=\"3 3\" className=\"stroke-default-200\" />\n          <XAxis dataKey=\"make\" tickLine={false} axisLine={false} className=\"text-xs\" />\n          <YAxis tickLine={false} axisLine={false} className=\"text-xs\" />\n          <ChartTooltip content={<ChartTooltipContent />} />\n          <Bar dataKey=\"count\" fill=\"var(--chart-1)\" radius={[8, 8, 0, 0]} />\n        </BarChart>\n      </ChartContainer>\n    </ChartWidget>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## ChartContainer\n\n`ChartContainer` wraps Recharts'' `ResponsiveContainer` with theming support. Set dimensions via CSS class on the container:\n\n```tsx\n// ✅ Correct - height via className\n<ChartContainer config={chartConfig} className=\"h-[300px] w-full\">\n  <BarChart data={data}>...</BarChart>\n</ChartContainer>\n\n// ❌ Wrong - raw ResponsiveContainer\n<ResponsiveContainer width=\"100%\" height={400}>\n  <BarChart data={data}>...</BarChart>\n</ResponsiveContainer>\n```\n\n### Width/Height -1 Warning\n\nRecharts `ResponsiveContainer` logs `width(-1) and height(-1)` warnings on first render before `ResizeObserver` fires. Fix by setting `initialDimension` on `ResponsiveContainer` in `packages/ui/src/components/chart.tsx`:\n\n```tsx\n<RechartsPrimitive.ResponsiveContainer initialDimension={{ width: 0, height: 400 }}>\n  {children}\n</RechartsPrimitive.ResponsiveContainer>\n```\n\nReference: [shadcn/ui PR #8486](https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/pull/8486), [recharts #6716](https://github.com/recharts/recharts/issues/6716)\n\n## ChartWidget\n\nWraps charts in a Card with title, subtitle, empty state, and entrance animation:\n\n```tsx\n<ChartWidget\n  title=\"Registration Trends\"\n  subtitle=\"Monthly breakdown\"\n  isEmpty={data.length === 0}\n  emptyMessage=\"No trend data available\"\n>\n  <ChartContainer ...>...</ChartContainer>\n</ChartWidget>\n```\n\n## Chart Config\n\nDefine chart config for theming and legend/tooltip labels:\n\n```tsx\nconst chartConfig = {\n  diesel: { label: \"Diesel\", color: \"var(--chart-1)\" },\n  petrol: { label: \"Petrol\", color: \"var(--chart-2)\" },\n  electric: { label: \"Electric\", color: \"var(--chart-3)\" },\n};\n```\n\n## Performance\n\n### Memoize Data and Config\n\n```typescript\nconst chartConfig = useMemo(() => {\n  return Object.fromEntries(\n    categories.map((category, index) => [\n      category,\n      { label: category, color: `var(--chart-${index + 1})` },\n    ]),\n  );\n}, [categories]);\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **ChartContainer** - Always use `ChartContainer` with `className=\"h-[300px] w-full\"` (never raw `ResponsiveContainer`)\n2. **ChartWidget** - Wrap in `ChartWidget` for consistent card layout and empty states\n3. **CSS Variables** - Use `var(--chart-N)` for colors (1-6 available)\n4. **Axis styling** - Use `tickLine={false} axisLine={false} className=\"text-xs\"` for clean axes\n5. **Grid** - Use `<CartesianGrid vertical={false} strokeDasharray=\"3 3\" className=\"stroke-default-200\" />`\n6. **Tooltips** - Use shadcn `<ChartTooltip content={<ChartTooltipContent />} />`\n7. **Memoize** - Use `useMemo` for chart config and data transformations\n\n## References\n\n- Recharts: Use Context7 for latest docs\n- Design Language System: See `design-language-system` skill for colors\n- Chart component source: `packages/ui/src/components/chart.tsx`\n- Widget component: `apps/web/src/components/charts/widget.tsx`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:58:18.279Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced data visualization capabilities with Recharts and CSS variables.","zh":"非常适合需要使用 Recharts 和 CSS 变量实现高级数据可视化的前端代理。","ja":"Recharts と CSS 変数を使用して高度なデータ可視化機能を必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Recharts와 CSS 변수를 사용하여 고급 데이터 시각화를 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de visualización de datos con Recharts y variables CSS.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin de capacités de visualisation de données avancées avec Recharts et des variables CSS.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte Datenvisualisierungsfunktionen mit Recharts und CSS-Variablen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados com Recharts e variáveis CSS.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы расширенные возможности визуализации данных с помощью Recharts и переменных CSS.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصوير البيانات باستخدام Recharts ومتغيرات CSS."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create interactive charts using Recharts via shadcn/ui ChartContainer, wrapped in ChartWidget from @web/components/charts/widget, with consistent styling through CSS variables from the design-language-system.","zh":"赋予代理创建交互式图表的能力，使用 Recharts 通过 shadcn/ui ChartContainer，封装在 @web/components/charts/widget 的 ChartWidget 中，并通过设计语言系统中的 CSS 变量实现一致的样式。","ja":"エージェントが Recharts を使用してインタラクティブなチャートを作成できるようにします。shadcn/ui ChartContainer を使用して、@web/components/charts/widget の ChartWidget でラップされ、デザイン言語システムの CSS 変数を使用して一貫したスタイリングが行われます。","ko":"에이전트가 Recharts를 사용하여 상호작용형 차트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. shadcn/ui ChartContainer를 사용하여 @web/components/charts/widget의 ChartWidget로 래핑되고, 디자인 언어 시스템의 CSS 변수를 사용하여 일관된 스타일링이 수행됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear gráficos interactivos utilizando Recharts a través de shadcn/ui ChartContainer, envuelto en ChartWidget de @web/components/charts/widget, con un estilo coherente a través de variables CSS del sistema de lenguaje de diseño.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des graphiques interactifs en utilisant Recharts via shadcn/ui ChartContainer, enveloppé dans ChartWidget de @web/components/charts/widget, avec un style cohérent grâce aux variables CSS du système de langage de conception.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, interaktive Diagramme mit Recharts über shadcn/ui ChartContainer zu erstellen, das in ChartWidget von @web/components/charts/widget eingewickelt ist, mit einem konsistenten Stil durch CSS-Variablen des Design-Sprachsystems.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar gráficos interativos usando Recharts via shadcn/ui ChartContainer, encapsulado em ChartWidget de @web/components/charts/widget, com estilização consistente por meio de variáveis CSS do design-language-system.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать интерактивные графики с помощью Recharts через shadcn/ui ChartContainer, завернутый в ChartWidget из @web/components/charts/widget, с последовательным стилем через переменные CSS из design-language-system.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مخططات تفاعلية باستخدام Recharts عبر shadcn/ui ChartContainer، مغلف في ChartWidget من @web/components/charts/widget، مع تنسيق متسق من خلال متغيرات CSS من نظام لغة التصميم."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing responsive chart containers with ChartContainer and ChartWidget","Visualizing data trends with Recharts and CSS variable-based color schemes","Integrating chart tooltips using ChartTooltip and ChartTooltipContent"],"zh":["使用 ChartContainer 和 ChartWidget 实现响应式图表容器","使用 Recharts 和基于 CSS 变量的颜色方案可视化数据趋势","使用 ChartTooltip 和 ChartTooltipContent 集成图表工具提示"],"ja":["ChartContainer と ChartWidget を使用してレスポンシブなチャートコンテナーを実装する","Recharts と CSS 変数ベースの色相を使用してデータトレンドを可視化する","ChartTooltip と ChartTooltipContent を使用してチャートツールチップを統合する"],"ko":["ChartContainer와 ChartWidget을 사용하여 반응형 차트 컨테이너를 구현한다","Recharts와 CSS 변수 기반의 색상 체계를 사용하여 데이터 트렌드를 시각화한다","ChartTooltip과 ChartTooltipContent를 사용하여 차트 툴팁을 통합한다"],"es":["Implementar contenedores de gráficos responsivos con ChartContainer y ChartWidget","Visualizar tendencias de datos con Recharts y esquemas de color basados en variables CSS","Integrar información sobre herramientas de gráficos utilizando ChartTooltip y ChartTooltipContent"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des conteneurs de graphiques responsives avec ChartContainer et ChartWidget","Visualiser les tendances de données avec Recharts et des schémas de couleur basés sur des variables CSS","Intégrer des info-bulles de graphique en utilisant ChartTooltip et ChartTooltipContent"],"de":["Implementierung responsiver Chart-Container mit ChartContainer und ChartWidget","Visualisierung von Datentrends mit Recharts und auf CSS-Variablen basierenden Farbschemata","Integration von Chart-Tools mit ChartTooltip und ChartTooltipContent"],"pt":["Implementar contêineres de gráficos responsivos com ChartContainer e ChartWidget","Visualizar tendências de dados com Recharts e esquemas de cores baseados em variáveis CSS","Integrar dicas de gráficos usando ChartTooltip e ChartTooltipContent"],"ru":["Реализация контейнеров диаграмм с помощью ChartContainer и ChartWidget","Визуализация тенденций данных с помощью Recharts и цветовых схем на основе переменных CSS","Интеграция подсказок диаграмм с помощью ChartTooltip и ChartTooltipContent"],"ar":["تنفيذ حاويات مخططات مستجيبة مع ChartContainer و ChartWidget","تجسيد اتجاهات البيانات باستخدام Recharts وخطط ألوان تعتمد على متغيرات CSS","دمج أدوات المخططات باستخدام ChartTooltip و ChartTooltipContent"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires @sgcarstrends/ui and @web/components dependencies","Must use ChartContainer and ChartWidget, never raw ResponsiveContainer directly"],"zh":["需要 @sgcarstrends/ui 和 @web/components 依赖项","必须使用 ChartContainer 和 ChartWidget，永远不要直接使用原始的 ResponsiveContainer"],"ja":["@sgcarstrends/ui と @web/components 依存関係が必要","ChartContainer と ChartWidget を使用する必要があり、直接 ResponsiveContainer を使用してはなりません"],"ko":["@sgcarstrends/ui와 @web/components 종속성이 필요합니다","ChartContainer와 ChartWidget을 사용해야 하며, 절대로 원시 ResponsiveContainer를 직접 사용해서는 안 됩니다"],"es":["Requiere dependencias @sgcarstrends/ui y @web/components","Debe utilizar ChartContainer y ChartWidget, nunca ResponsiveContainer crudo directamente"],"fr":["Nécessite les dépendances @sgcarstrends/ui et @web/components","Doit utiliser ChartContainer et ChartWidget, jamais ResponsiveContainer brut directement"],"de":["Benötigt @sgcarstrends/ui- und @web/components-Abhängigkeiten","Muss ChartContainer und ChartWidget verwenden, niemals direkt raw ResponsiveContainer"],"pt":["Requer dependências @sgcarstrends/ui e @web/components","Deve usar ChartContainer e ChartWidget, nunca ResponsiveContainer cru diretamente"],"ru":["Требует зависимостей @sgcarstrends/ui и @web/components","Должно использовать ChartContainer и ChartWidget, а не ResponsiveContainer напрямую"],"ar":["يتطلب تبعيات @sgcarstrends/ui و @web/components","يجب استخدام ChartContainer و ChartWidget، وليس الحاوية المستجيبة مباشرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5121bc0769403341e857282988e0b06ed0dde03e1daf3385adc46e46003252f0","qualityScore":28}');
