 KI-Tools","Ist kompatibel mit React und anderen Frameworks","Bietet eine höhere Effizienz bei der Problemlösung"],"pt":["Melhoria da interação com a UI do Mento","Esclarecimento de informações","Integração com ferramentas de IA","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de dados","Desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas"],"ru":["Улучшение взаимодействия с Mento UI","Уточнение информации","Интеграция с инструментами ИИ","Поддержка нескольких форматов данных","Разработка индивидуальных решений"],"ar":["تحسين التفاعل مع واجهة المستخدم في Mento","توضيح المعلومات","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم عدة صيغ للبيانات","تطوير حلول مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","ask-questions-if-underspecified","Mento UIs","如何使用AI智能代理","AI智能代理安装","AI智能代理设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","ask-questions-if-underspecified","Mento UIs","AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのインストール","AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","ask-questions-if-underspecified","Mento UIs","AI 에이전트 사용 방법","AI 에이전트 설치","AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es ask-questions-if-underspecified","alternativas a ask-questions-if-underspecified","ask-questions-if-underspecified vs otros tools","instalación de ask-questions-if-underspecified","guía de configuración de ask-questions-if-underspecified","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","mejora de la interacción en Mento UIs"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce que ask-questions-if-underspecified","alternatives à ask-questions-if-underspecified","ask-questions-if-underspecified vs d''autres outils","installation de ask-questions-if-underspecified","guide de configuration de ask-questions-if-underspecified","outils d''IA pour développeurs","amélioration de l''interaction dans les Mento UIs"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ask-questions-if-underspecified","alternativen zu ask-questions-if-underspecified","ask-questions-if-underspecified vs andere tools","installation von ask-questions-if-underspecified","konfigurationsanleitung für ask-questions-if-underspecified","KI-Tools für Entwickler","verbesserung der interaktion in Mento UIs"],"pt":["como usar ask-questions-if-underspecified","o que é ask-questions-if-underspecified","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","alternativas para ask-questions-if-underspecified","ask-questions-if-underspecified vs outras ferramentas","instalação do ask-questions-if-underspecified","guia de configuração do ask-questions-if-underspecified"],"ru":["как использовать ask-questions-if-underspecified","что такое ask-questions-if-underspecified","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","альтернативы для ask-questions-if-underspecified","ask-questions-if-underspecified vs другие инструменты","установка ask-questions-if-underspecified","руководство по настройке ask-questions-if-underspecified"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ask-questions-if-underspecified","ما هي ask-questions-if-underspecified","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","بديل ل ask-questions-if-underspecified","ask-questions-if-underspecified مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت ask-questions-if-underspecified","دليل إعداد ask-questions-if-underspecified"]}},"owner":"mento-protocol","repo":"frontend-monorepo","repoPath":"mento-protocol/frontend-monorepo","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.797Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ask-questions-if-underspecified","description":"Clarify requirements before implementing. Do not use automatically, only when invoked explicitly.","bodyPreview":"# Ask Questions If Underspecified\n\n## Goal\n\nAsk the minimum set of clarifying questions needed to avoid wrong work; do not start implementing until the must-have questions are answered (or the user explicitly approves proceeding with stated assumptions).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Decide whether the request is underspecified\n\nTreat a request as underspecified if after exploring how to perform the work, some or all of the following are not clear:\n\n- Define the objective (what should change vs stay the","body":"# Ask Questions If Underspecified\n\n## Goal\n\nAsk the minimum set of clarifying questions needed to avoid wrong work; do not start implementing until the must-have questions are answered (or the user explicitly approves proceeding with stated assumptions).\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Decide whether the request is underspecified\n\nTreat a request as underspecified if after exploring how to perform the work, some or all of the following are not clear:\n\n- Define the objective (what should change vs stay the same)\n- Define \"done\" (acceptance criteria, examples, edge cases)\n- Define scope (which files/components/users are in/out)\n- Define constraints (compatibility, performance, style, deps, time)\n- Identify environment (language/runtime versions, OS, build/test runner)\n- Clarify safety/reversibility (data migration, rollout/rollback, risk)\n\nIf multiple plausible interpretations exist, assume it is underspecified.\n\n### 2) Ask must-have questions first (keep it small)\n\nAsk 1-5 questions in the first pass. Prefer questions that eliminate whole branches of work.\n\nMake questions easy to answer:\n\n- Optimize for scannability (short, numbered questions; avoid paragraphs)\n- Offer multiple-choice options when possible\n- Suggest reasonable defaults when appropriate (mark them clearly as the default/recommended choice; bold the recommended choice in the list, or if you present options in a code block, put a bold \"Recommended\" line immediately above the block and also tag defaults inside the block)\n- Include a fast-path response (e.g., reply `defaults` to accept all recommended/default choices)\n- Include a low-friction \"not sure\" option when helpful (e.g., \"Not sure - use default\")\n- Separate \"Need to know\" from \"Nice to know\" if that reduces friction\n- Structure options so the user can respond with compact decisions (e.g., `1b 2a 3c`); restate the chosen options in plain language to confirm\n\n### 3) Pause before acting\n\nUntil must-have answers arrive:\n\n- Do not run commands, edit files, or produce a detailed plan that depends on unknowns\n- Do perform a clearly labeled, low-risk discovery step only if it does not commit you to a direction (e.g., inspect repo structure, read relevant config files)\n\nIf the user explicitly asks you to proceed without answers:\n\n- State your assumptions as a short numbered list\n- Ask for confirmation; proceed only after they confirm or correct them\n\n### 4) Confirm interpretation, then proceed\n\nOnce you have answers, restate the requirements in 1-3 sentences (including key constraints and what success looks like), then start work.\n\n## Question templates\n\n- \"Before I start, I need: (1) ..., (2) ..., (3) .... If you don''t care about (2), I will assume ....\"\n- \"Which of these should it be? A) ... B) ... C) ... (pick one)\"\n- \"What would you consider ''done''? For example: ...\"\n- \"Any constraints I must follow (versions, performance, style, deps)? If none, I will target the existing project defaults.\"\n- Use numbered questions with lettered options and a clear reply format\n\n```text\n1) Scope?\na) Minimal change (default)\nb) Refactor while touching the area\nc) Not sure - use default\n2) Compatibility target?\na) Current project defaults (default)\nb) Also support older versions: <specify>\nc) Not sure - use default\n\nReply with: defaults (or 1a 2a)\n```\n\n## Anti-patterns\n\n- Don''t ask questions you can answer with a quick, low-risk discovery read (e.g., configs, existing patterns, docs).\n- Don''t ask open-ended questions if a tight multiple-choice or yes/no would eliminate ambiguity faster.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:28:36.008Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Conversational Agents needing advanced clarification capabilities to avoid misinterpretation.","zh":"适合需要高级阐明能力的对话式代理，以避免误解。","ja":"誤解を避けるために高度な明確化能力が必要な会話エージェントに最適です。","ko":"오해를 피하기 위해 고급 명료화 기능이 필요한 대화형 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Conversación que necesitan capacidades de aclaración avanzadas para evitar malas interpretaciones.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Conversation ayant besoin de capacités de clarification avancées pour éviter les mauvaises interprétations.","de":"Perfekt für Konversationsagenten, die erweiterte Klarifizierungsfähigkeiten benötigen, um Fehlinterpretationen zu vermeiden.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Conversação que precisam de capacidades avançadas de esclarecimento para evitar mal-entendidos.","ru":"Идеально для Конверсационных Агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности уточнения для избежания неправильного толкования.","ar":"مثالي لعميل المحادثة الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات توضيح متقدمة لتجنب سوء الفهم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate targeted clarifying questions, ensuring accurate understanding of objectives and requirements through protocols like must-have questions and user-approved assumptions, thereby avoiding wrong work.","zh":"赋予代理生成有针对性的阐明问题的能力，确保通过必须的问题和用户批准的假设等协议准确理解目标和需求，从而避免错误的工作。","ja":"エージェントにターゲットを絞った明確化の質問を生成する能力を付与し、必須の質問やユーザー承認の仮定などのプロトコルを通じて、目標や要件を正確に理解することを保証し、誤った作業を避ける。","ko":"에이전트가 대상별 명료화 질문을 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 목표와 요구사항을 정확하게 이해하고 잘못된 작업을 피할 수 있도록 한다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar preguntas de aclaración dirigidas, garantizando una comprensión precisa de los objetivos y requisitos a través de protocolos como preguntas obligatorias y suposiciones aprobadas por el usuario, evitando así un trabajo incorrecto.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des questions de clarification ciblées, assurant une compréhension précise des objectifs et des exigences à travers des protocoles tels que des questions obligatoires et des hypothèses approuvées par l''utilisateur, évitant ainsi un travail incorrect.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, gezielte Klärungsfragen zu generieren, um ein genaues Verständnis von Zielen und Anforderungen sicherzustellen, indem Protokolle wie muss-haben-Fragen und vom Benutzer genehmigte Annahmen verwendet werden, wodurch falsche Arbeiten vermieden werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar perguntas esclarecedoras direcionadas, garantindo a compreensão precisa dos objetivos e requisitos por meio de protocolos como perguntas essenciais e suposições aprovadas pelo usuário, evitando assim o trabalho errado.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать целевые уточняющие вопросы, обеспечивая точное понимание целей и требований через протоколы, такие как обязательные вопросы и предположения, одобренные пользователем, тем самым избегая неправильной работы.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية توليد أسئلة توضيحية محددة، مما يضمن فهمًا دقيقًا للأهداف والمتطلبات من خلال بروتوكولات مثل الأسئلة الضرورية والافتراضات المعتمدة من المستخدم، وبالتالي تجنب العمل الخاطئ."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating requirements gathering","Debugging underspecified user requests","Generating minimum sets of clarifying questions"],"zh":["自动化需求收集","调试不明确的用户请求","生成最小的阐明问题集"],"ja":["要件収集の自動化","明確化されていないユーザー要求のデバッグ","最小の明確化の質問セットの生成"],"ko":["요구사항 수집 자동화","不明确한 사용자 요청 디버깅","최소한의 명료화 질문 세트 생성"],"es":["Automatización de la recopilación de requisitos","Depuración de solicitudes de usuario poco especificadas","Generación de conjuntos mínimos de preguntas de aclaración"],"fr":["Automatisation de la collecte des exigences","Débogage des demandes d''utilisateur peu spécifiées","Génération d''ensembles minimum de questions de clarification"],"de":["Automatisierung der Anforderungserfassung","Fehlersuche bei unvollständig spezifizierten Benutzeranfragen","Generierung von Mindestmengen an Klärungsfragen"],"pt":["Automatização da coleta de requisitos","Depuração de solicitações de usuário subespecificadas","Geração de conjuntos mínimos de perguntas esclarecedoras"],"ru":["Автоматизация сбора требований","Отладка недоспецифицированных запросов пользователей","Генерация минимальных наборов уточняющих вопросов"],"ar":["أتمتة جمع المتطلبات","تصحيح أخطاء الطلبات غير محددة من قبل المستخدم","توليد مجموعات صغرى من الأسئلة التوضيحية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires natural language understanding capabilities","Dependent on user engagement for feedback and approval"],"zh":["需要自然语言理解能力","依赖于用户参与以获取反馈和批准"],"ja":["自然言語理解能力が必要","ユーザー参加に依存してフィードバックと承認を得る"],"ko":["자연어 이해 능력이 필요","사용자 참여에 의존하여 피드백과 승인을 얻음"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de comprensión del lenguaje natural","Dependiente de la participación del usuario para obtener retroalimentación y aprobación"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de compréhension du langage naturel","Dépend de l''engagement de l''utilisateur pour obtenir des commentaires et une approbation"],"de":["Benötigt Fähigkeiten zur Verständigung in natürlicher Sprache","Hängt von der Benutzerbeteiligung für Feedback und Genehmigung ab"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de compreensão de linguagem natural","Depende do envolvimento do usuário para feedback e aprovação"],"ru":["Требует возможностей понимания естественного языка","Зависит от участия пользователя для обратной связи и утверждения"],"ar":["يتطلب khảیات فهم اللغة الطبيعية","يعتمد على مشاركة المستخدم لتعليقاته وموافقته"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"78298cb6125789a79e2ac28332c96905278f4de0560bb8ed0b09ffae70f3e08b","qualityScore":28}');
