ção em Golang com Restrições","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Валидация в Golang с Ограничениями","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: التحقق من صحة جولانج مع القيود","en":"validation-add-constraint"},"description":{"zh":"validation-add-constraint 是一个 Golang 验证框架，基于静态类型和泛型，帮助开发者编写更可靠的代码。","ja":"validation-add-constraint は、静的な型とジェネリックに基づく Golang バリデーションフレームワークで、開発者がより信頼性の高いコードを書くことができます。","ko":"validation-add-constraint는 정적 타입과 제네릭을 기반으로 하는 Golang 검증 프레임워크로서, 개발자가 더 안정적인 코드를 작성하도록 도와줍니다.","es":"El marco de validación Golang es una herramienta de AI basada en tipado estático y genéricos para desarrolladores","fr":"Le framework de validation Golang est un outil d''IA basé sur le typage statique et les génériques pour les développeurs","de":"Das Golang-Validierungsframework ist ein KI-Tool basierend auf statischem Typing und Generics für Entwickler","pt":"A validação em Golang com restrições é uma ferramenta poderosa para desenvolvedores, baseada em tipagem estática e genéricos","ru":"Валидация в Golang с ограничениями - это мощный инструмент для разработчиков, основанный на статической типизации и генериках","ar":"التحقق من صحة جولانج مع القيود هي أداة قوية للمطورين، تستند إلى التصنيف الثابت و الجenerics","en":"Golang validation framework based on static typing and generics"},"definition":{"en":"Golang validation framework based on static typing and generics"},"features":{"zh":["基于静态类型和泛型的验证","提高代码质量和可靠性","支持 Golang 的静态类型检查","提供简单易用的 API","支持自定义验证规则"],"ja":["静的な型とジェネリックに基づくバリデーション","コードの品質と信頼性の向上","Golang の静的な型チェックをサポート","シンプルで使いやすい API を提供","カスタムバリデーションルールをサポート"],"ko":["정적 타입과 제네릭을 기반으로 하는 검증","코드 품질과 안정성의 향상","Golang의 정적 타입 체크를 지원","단순하고 사용하기 쉬운 API를 제공","사용자 정의 검증 규칙을 지원"],"es":["Basado en tipado estático","Soporte para genéricos","Validación de datos en tiempo de compilación","Integración con frameworks de desarrollo Golang","Documentación y soporte para desarrolladores"],"fr":["Basé sur le typage statique","Support pour les génériques","Validation des données au moment de la compilation","Intégration avec les frameworks de développement Golang","Documentation et support pour les développeurs"],"de":["Basierend auf statischem Typing","Unterstützung für Generics","Validierung von Daten zur Kompilierzeit","Integration mit Golang-Entwicklungsframeworks","Dokumentation und Support für Entwickler"],"pt":["Baseado em tipagem estática","Suporte a genéricos","Melhora a segurança do código","Aumenta a eficiência do desenvolvimento","Fácil de usar e integrar"],"ru":["Основан на статической типизации","Поддержка генериков","Повышает безопасность кода","Увеличивает эффективность разработки","Легко использовать и интегрировать"],"ar":["يستند إلى التصنيف الثابت","دعم الجenerics","يحسن أمان الكود","يزيد من كفاءة التطوير","سهل الاستخدام و التكامل"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Golang 验证框架","静态类型和泛型","validation-add-constraint 教程","Golang 开发工具","代码质量检查","如何使用 validation-add-constraint","validation-add-constraint 示例","Golang 静态类型检查"],"ja":["Golang バリデーションフレームワーク","静的な型とジェネリック","validation-add-constraint チュートリアル","Golang 開発ツール","コード品質チェック","validation-add-constraint の使い方","validation-add-constraint サンプル","Golang 静的な型チェック"],"ko":["Golang 검증 프레임워크","정적 타입과 제네릭","validation-add-constraint 튜토리얼","Golang 개발 도구","코드 품질 체크","validation-add-constraint 사용법","validation-add-constraint 예제","Golang 정적 타입 체크"],"es":["herramientas de AI","marco de validación Golang","tipado estático","genéricos","validación de datos","desarrollo Golang","cómo usar Golang","qué es Golang","Golang vs otros lenguajes"],"fr":["outils d''IA","framework de validation Golang","typage statique","génériques","validation des données","développement Golang","comment utiliser Golang","qu''est-ce que Golang","Golang vs autres langages"],"de":["KI-Tools","Golang-Validierungsframework","statisches Typing","Generics","Validierung von Daten","Golang-Entwicklung","wie man Golang verwendet","was ist Golang","Golang vs andere Sprachen"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","validação em golang","restrições em golang","como usar validação em golang","o que é validação em golang","golang vs java","golang alternative","golang install","golang setup guide"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","валидация в golang","ограничения в golang","как использовать валидацию в golang","что такое валидация в golang","golang vs java","гolang альтернатива","гolang установка","гolang руководство по настройке"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التحقق من صحة جولانج","القيود في جولانج","كيفية استخدام التحقق من صحة جولانج","ما هو التحقق من صحة جولانج","جولانج مقابل جافا","جولانج بديل","جولانج تثبيت","جولانج دليل الإعداد"]}},"owner":"muonsoft","repo":"validation","repoPath":"muonsoft/validation","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.816Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"validation-add-constraint","description":"Adds new validation constraints to the Go validation library. Use when adding a new constraint to package it, translations (message, english, russian), optional validate/is helpers, tests in test/, and examples in it/example_test.go or validate/example_test.go.","bodyPreview":"# Adding a New Constraint to the Validation Library\n\nFollow this workflow when adding a new constraint. Mandatory steps: constraint in `it`, message constant, translations (english + russian), tests, examples, godoc. Optional: `validate` and `is` when useful for standalone validation (e.g. string codes, identifiers).\n\n---\n\n## 1. Message and Error (mandatory)\n\n### 1.1 Add message constant\n\nIn **`message/messages.go`** add a new constant (English default text):\n\n```go\nconst (\n\t// ... existing\n\tInv","body":"# Adding a New Constraint to the Validation Library\n\nFollow this workflow when adding a new constraint. Mandatory steps: constraint in `it`, message constant, translations (english + russian), tests, examples, godoc. Optional: `validate` and `is` when useful for standalone validation (e.g. string codes, identifiers).\n\n---\n\n## 1. Message and Error (mandatory)\n\n### 1.1 Add message constant\n\nIn **`message/messages.go`** add a new constant (English default text):\n\n```go\nconst (\n\t// ... existing\n\tInvalidMyFormat = \"This value is not a valid my format.\"\n)\n```\n\n- Use existing style: `InvalidXxx`, `NotXxx`, `TooXxx`, etc.\n- Text is the default (English) template; placeholders like `{{ value }}`, `{{ limit }}` are allowed.\n\n### 1.2 Add validation error\n\nIn **`errors.go`** (root package) add:\n\n```go\nvar (\n\t// ... existing\n\tErrInvalidMyFormat = NewError(\"invalid my format\", message.InvalidMyFormat)\n)\n```\n\n- First argument: stable **code** (backward compatibility).\n- Second argument: **message constant** from `message` package (used for translation key and default text).\n\n---\n\n## 2. Translations (mandatory)\n\nAdd the **same key** (the message constant) in both translation files.\n\n### 2.1 English\n\nIn **`message/translations/english/messages.go`**:\n\n```go\nvar Messages = map[language.Tag]map[string]catalog.Message{\n\tlanguage.English: {\n\t\t// ... existing\n\t\tmessage.InvalidMyFormat: catalog.String(message.InvalidMyFormat),\n\t},\n}\n```\n\n- For simple messages use `catalog.String(message.Const)` or `catalog.String(\"Your English text.\")`.\n- For plurals (e.g. \"N elements\") use `plural.Selectf(1, \"\", plural.One, \"...\", plural.Other, \"...\")`. See [reference.md](reference.md) for plural and Russian forms.\n\n### 2.2 Russian\n\nIn **`message/translations/russian/messages.go`**:\n\n```go\nvar Messages = map[language.Tag]map[string]catalog.Message{\n\tlanguage.Russian: {\n\t\t// ... existing\n\t\tmessage.InvalidMyFormat: catalog.String(\"Значение не является допустимым форматом.\"),\n\t},\n}\n```\n\n- Key is always the **message constant** from `message` package.\n- Value: Russian text; same placeholders as in the message constant (e.g. `{{ value }}`).\n- For plurals use `plural.Selectf(1, \"\", plural.One, \"...\", plural.Few, \"...\", plural.Other, \"...\")` — Russian has Few. See [reference.md](reference.md).\n\n---\n\n## 3. Constraint in package `it` (mandatory)\n\nChoose the right file: `it/string.go`, `it/identifiers.go`, `it/web.go`, `it/comparison.go`, `it/basic.go`, `it/iterable.go`, `it/date_time.go`, `it/choice.go`, `it/barcodes.go`.\n\n### 3.1 Simple string constraint (func(string) bool)\n\nIf the check is a pure `func(string) bool`, use `OfStringBy` and the `is` helper:\n\n```go\n// IsMyFormat validates whether the value is in my format.\n// See [link] for specification.\nfunc IsMyFormat() validation.StringFuncConstraint {\n\treturn validation.OfStringBy(is.MyFormat).\n\t\tWithError(validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat).\n\t\tWithMessage(validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat.Message())\n}\n```\n\n### 3.2 Custom struct constraint\n\nWhen you need options (e.g. versions, formats), define a struct and implement `ValidateString`:\n\n```go\n// MyConstraint validates whether the string value satisfies my format.\n// Use [MyConstraint.Option] to configure.\ntype MyConstraint struct {\n\tisIgnored       bool\n\tgroups          []string\n\toptions         []func(o *validate.MyOptions)\n\terr             error\n\tmessageTemplate string\n\tmessageParameters validation.TemplateParameterList\n}\n\n// IsMy creates the constraint.\nfunc IsMy() MyConstraint {\n\treturn MyConstraint{\n\t\terr:             validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat,\n\t\tmessageTemplate: validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat.Message(),\n\t}\n}\n\n// WithError overrides default error for produced violation.\nfunc (c MyConstraint) WithError(err error) MyConstraint { ... }\n\n// WithMessage sets the violation message template.\nfunc (c MyConstraint) WithMessage(template string, parameters ...validation.TemplateParameter) MyConstraint { ... }\n\n// When / WhenGroups for conditional validation.\nfunc (c MyConstraint) When(condition bool) MyConstraint { ... }\nfunc (c MyConstraint) WhenGroups(groups ...string) MyConstraint { ... }\n\nfunc (c MyConstraint) ValidateString(ctx context.Context, validator *validation.Validator, value *string) error {\n\tif c.isIgnored || validator.IsIgnoredForGroups(c.groups...) || value == nil || *value == \"\" {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\tif is.My(*value, c.options...) {\n\t\treturn nil\n\t}\n\treturn validator.BuildViolation(ctx, c.err, c.messageTemplate).\n\t\tWithParameters(\n\t\t\tc.messageParameters.Prepend(\n\t\t\t\tvalidation.TemplateParameter{Key: \"{{ value }}\", Value: *value},\n\t\t\t)...,\n\t\t).\n\t\tCreate()\n}\n```\n\nTemplate rules:\n\n- **Empty/nil**: Usually skip (return `nil`); use `it.IsNotBlank()` (or similar) to reject empty.\n- **Violation**: Use `validator.BuildViolation(ctx, c.err, c.messageTemplate).WithParameters(...).Create()`. Do not use `CreateViolation` for translatable constraints — use `BuildViolation` so the message is translated.\n- **Godoc**: Document the constraint type and constructor; document options; add `See ...` for specs if applicable.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Tests (mandatory)\n\nIn **`test/constraints_*_cases_test.go`** (create or extend the right file, e.g. `constraints_identifiers_cases_test.go`):\n\n- Define a slice of `ConstraintValidationTestCase`.\n- Use `name`, `isApplicableFor: specificValueTypes(stringType)` (or other type), `stringValue: stringValue(\"...\")`, `constraint: it.IsMyFormat()`, `assert: assertNoError` or `assertHasOneViolation(validation.ErrInvalidMyFormat, message.InvalidMyFormat)`.\n- Cover: valid, invalid, empty/nil (if applicable), options (e.g. WithError/WithMessage), When(false)/When(true).\n\nAdd the slice to **`validateTestCases`** in **`test/constraints_test.go`** via `mergeTestCases(...)` so the shared test runners pick it up.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Examples (mandatory)\n\nIn **`it/example_test.go`** add testable examples:\n\n```go\nfunc ExampleIsMyFormat_valid() {\n\terr := validator.Validate(context.Background(), validation.String(\"valid-value\", it.IsMyFormat()))\n\tfmt.Println(err)\n\t// Output:\n\t// <nil>\n}\n\nfunc ExampleIsMyFormat_invalid() {\n\terr := validator.Validate(context.Background(), validation.String(\"invalid\", it.IsMyFormat()))\n\tfmt.Println(err)\n\t// Output:\n\t// violation: \"This value is not a valid my format.\"\n}\n```\n\nUse `// Output:` so `go test` runs them. Prefer `ExampleXxx_valid` / `ExampleXxx_invalid` naming.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Optional: package `validate`\n\nAdd when the constraint is useful for **standalone validation** (e.g. string codes, identifiers), without the full validator.\n\n- **File**: `validate/identifiers.go` or new file (e.g. `validate/myformat.go`).\n- **Signature**: `func MyFormat(value string) error` (or with options).\n- **Return**: `nil` if valid; otherwise a sentinel error from `validate` package (e.g. `ErrTooShort`, or custom).\n- **Godoc**: Describe when it returns which error.\n- **Tests**: `validate/*_test.go` table or cases.\n- **Examples**: `validate/example_test.go` with `ExampleMyFormat` and `// Output:`.\n\nIf the `it` constraint needs options, define option types and funcs in `validate` (e.g. `validate.MyOptions`, `validate.AllowXxx()`), and use them from `it` and `is`.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Optional: package `is`\n\nAdd when useful for **standalone boolean checks** (e.g. in conditions, or for `OfStringBy`).\n\n- **File**: `is/identifiers.go` or same area as related `validate` logic.\n- **Signature**: `func MyFormat(value string) bool` or `func MyFormat(value string, options ...func(o *validate.MyOptions)) bool`.\n- **Implementation**: Usually `return validate.MyFormat(value, options...) == nil`.\n- **Godoc**: Short description; point to `validate` for options and semantics.\n- **Tests**: `is/*_test.go`.\n- **Examples**: `is/example_test.go` with `ExampleMyFormat` and `// Output:`.\n\n---\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] `message/messages.go`: new constant\n- [ ] `errors.go`: `ErrXxx = NewError(\"code\", message.Xxx)`\n- [ ] `message/translations/english/messages.go`: key = message const, value = English\n- [ ] `message/translations/russian/messages.go`: key = message const, value = Russian\n- [ ] `it/*.go`: constraint (StringFuncConstraint or custom struct), godoc, empty/nil handling, BuildViolation\n- [ ] `test/constraints_*_cases_test.go`: test cases + merge into `validateTestCases`\n- [ ] `it/example_test.go`: ExampleXxx_valid, ExampleXxx_invalid with `// Output:`\n- [ ] Optional: `validate`: function, tests, examples, godoc\n- [ ] Optional: `is`: function, tests, examples, godoc\n- [ ] `go test ./...` and `golangci-lint run`\n\n---\n\n## Additional resources\n\n- Plural forms and Russian translation details: [reference.md](reference.md)\n- Existing patterns: `it/identifiers.go` (UUID/ULID), `it/string.go` (OfStringBy), `test/constraints_identifiers_cases_test.go`, `message/translations/`.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:35:58.167Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Golang Agents requiring advanced validation capabilities with static typing and generics","zh":"适用于需要高级验证功能的Golang Agents，包括静态类型和泛型","ja":"Golangエージェントが高度なバリデーション機能を必要とする場合に最適です。静的型付けとジェネリクスを使用します","ko":"고급 유효성 검사 기능과 정적 타이핑 및 제네릭이 필요한 Golang 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Golang que requieren capacidades de validación avanzadas con tipado estático y genéricos","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Golang nécessitant des capacités de validation avancées avec typage statique et génériques","de":"Ideal für Golang-Agents, die erweiterte Validierungsfunktionen mit statischem Typing und Generics benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Golang que exigem capacidades de validação avançadas com tipagem estática e genéricos","ru":"Идеально для агентов Golang, требующих расширенных возможностей валидации с статической типизацией и泛型ами","ar":"مثالي لعميل Golang الذين يتطلبون قدرات التحقق المتقدمة مع التصنيف الثابت والجENERICS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce custom constraints using a comprehensive validation framework, including message constants, translations, and tests, leveraging Golang''s static typing and generics for robust validation","zh":"赋予代理执行自定义约束的能力，使用包括消息常量、翻译和测试在内的综合验证框架，利用Golang的静态类型和泛型进行强大的验证","ja":"エージェントがメッセージ定数、翻訳、テストを含む包括的なバリデーションフレームワークを使用してカスタム制約を適用できるようにします。Golangの静的型付けとジェネリクスを使用して強力なバリデーションを実現します","ko":"에이전트가 메시지 상수, 翻訳, 테스트를 포함한 포괄적인 유효성 검사 프레임워크를 사용하여 사용자 지정 제약을 적용할 수 있도록 합니다. Golang의 정적 타이핑 및 제네릭스를 사용하여 강력한 유효성 검사를 제공합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar restricciones personalizadas utilizando un marco de validación integral, incluyendo constantes de mensajes, traducciones y pruebas, aprovechando el tipado estático y los genéricos de Golang para una validación robusta","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des contraintes personnalisées en utilisant un cadre de validation complet, incluant des constantes de messages, des traductions et des tests, en exploitant le typage statique et les génériques de Golang pour une validation robuste","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, benutzerdefinierte Einschränkungen mithilfe eines umfassenden Validierungsframeworks zu erzwingen, einschließlich Nachrichtenkonstanten, Übersetzungen und Tests, die das statische Typing und die Generics von Golang für eine robuste Validierung nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor restrições personalizadas usando uma estrutura de validação abrangente, incluindo constantes de mensagem, traduções e testes, aproveitando a tipagem estática e genéricos do Golang para validação robusta","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью устанавливать пользовательские ограничения с помощью всесторонней структуры валидации, включая константы сообщений, переводы и тесты, используя статическую типизацию и обобщения Golang для надежной валидации","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض قيود مخصصة باستخدام إطار التحقق الشامل ، بما في ذلك ثوابت الرسائل والترجمات والاختبارات ، واستخدام التصنيف الثابت والجENERICS من Golang للتحقق الصلب"},"useCases":{"en":["Adding custom validation constraints for specific data types","Creating translations for error messages in multiple languages","Writing tests for validation constraints to ensure correctness"],"zh":["为特定数据类型添加自定义验证约束","为多种语言创建错误消息的翻译","为验证约束编写测试以确保正确性"],"ja":["特定データ型のカスタムバリデーション制約を追加する","複数の言語のエラーメッセージの翻訳を作成する","バリデーション制約のテストを記述して正確性を保証する"],"ko":["특정 데이터 형식에 대한 사용자 지정 유효성 검사 제약을 추가하는 것","다중 언어의 오류 메시지 번역을 생성하는 것","유효성 검사 제약에 대한 테스트를 작성하여 올바름을 보장하는 것"],"es":["Agregar restricciones de validación personalizadas para tipos de datos específicos","Crear traducciones para mensajes de error en varios idiomas","Escribir pruebas para restricciones de validación para garantizar la corrección"],"fr":["Ajouter des contraintes de validation personnalisées pour des types de données spécifiques","Créer des traductions pour les messages d''erreur dans plusieurs langues","Écrire des tests pour les contraintes de validation pour assurer la correction"],"de":["Hinzufügen benutzerdefinierter Validierungsbeschränkungen für bestimmte Datentypen","Erstellen von Übersetzungen für Fehlermeldungen in mehreren Sprachen","Schreiben von Tests für Validierungsbeschränkungen, um die Richtigkeit sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Adicionar restrições de validação personalizadas para tipos de dados específicos","Criar traduções para mensagens de erro em vários idiomas","Escrever testes para restrições de validação para garantir a correção"],"ru":["Добавление пользовательских ограничений валидации для определенных типов данных","Создание переводов для сообщений об ошибках на нескольких языках","Написание тестов для ограничений валидации для обеспечения правильности"],"ar":["إضافة قيود التحقق المخصصة لأنواع البيانات المحددة","إنشاء ترجمات لرسائل الخطأ في عدة لغات","كتابة اختبارات للقيود التحقق للتأكد من الصحة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Golang environment","Limited to static typing and generics","Mandatory steps include adding message constants, translations, and tests"],"zh":["需要Golang环境","仅限静态类型和泛型","必需步骤包括添加消息常量、翻译和测试"],"ja":["Golang環境が必要","静的型付けとジェネリクスのみ","メッセージ定数、翻訳、テストを追加することが必須のステップである"],"ko":["Golang 환경이 필요합니다","정적 타이핑 및 제네릭스만 해당됩니다","메시지 상수, 翻訳, 테스트를 추가하는 것이 필수적인 단계입니다"],"es":["Requiere entorno de Golang","Limitado a tipado estático y genéricos","Pasos obligatorios incluyen agregar constantes de mensajes, traducciones y pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Golang","Limité au typage statique et aux génériques","Étapes obligatoires incluent l''ajout de constantes de messages, de traductions et de tests"],"de":["Benötigt eine Golang-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf statisches Typing und Generics","Obligatorische Schritte umfassen das Hinzufügen von Nachrichtenkonstanten, Übersetzungen und Tests"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Golang","Limitado à tipagem estática e genéricos","Etapa obrigatória inclui adicionar constantes de mensagem, traduções e testes"],"ru":["Требуется среда Golang","Ограничен статической типизацией и обобщениями","Обязательные шаги включают добавление констант сообщений, переводов и тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Golang","محدود بالتصنيف الثابت والجENERICS","الخطوات الإلزامية تشمل إضافة ثوابت الرسائل والترجمات والاختبارات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"0cd2af8c955332ff0f819f7d4207f3c9d8f9fae672be216679f6beccfa8dc2f9","qualityScore":28}');
