,"如何使用 submit-issue"],"ja":["submit-issue チュートリアル","AI エージェントとは","gRPC-Web インストール","Axum ハンドラーの使用方法","HTTP と gRPC の違い","submit-issue の代替","submit-issue の使い方"],"ko":["submit-issue 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트란","gRPC-Web 설치","Axum 핸들러 사용법","HTTP와 gRPC의 차이","submit-issue 대안","submit-issue 사용법"],"es":["cómo usar submit-issue","qué es Axum","alternativas a gRPC","guía de instalación de Axum","configuración de submit-issue","submit-issue vs gRPC","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","desarrollo de aplicaciones con Axum"],"fr":["comment utiliser submit-issue","qu''est-ce qu''Axum","alternatives à gRPC","guide d''installation d''Axum","configuration de submit-issue","submit-issue vs gRPC","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","développement d''applications avec Axum"],"de":["wie man submit-issue verwendet","was ist Axum","Alternativen zu gRPC","Installationsanleitung für Axum","Konfiguration von submit-issue","submit-issue vs gRPC","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Anwendungsentwicklung mit Axum"],"pt":["como usar submit-issue","o que é submit-issue","alternativas para submit-issue","submit-issue vs gRPC","instalar submit-issue","guia de configuração do submit-issue"],"ru":["как использовать submit-issue","что такое submit-issue","альтернативы submit-issue","submit-issue vs gRPC","установить submit-issue","руководство по настройке submit-issue"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام submit-issue","ما هو submit-issue","بديل ل submit-issue","submit-issue مقابل gRPC","تثبيت submit-issue","دليل إعداد submit-issue"]}},"owner":"washanhanzi","repo":"connectrpc-axum","repoPath":"washanhanzi/connectrpc-axum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.926Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"submit-issue","description":"Handle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for connectrpc-axum. This skill should be used when users ask questions about the library, request new features, or report bugs. It first attempts to answer using project documentation, verifies bugs with integration tests, and submits GitHub issues when needed.","bodyPreview":"# Submit Issue\n\nHandle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n\nDetermine the request type:\n- **Question**: User wants to understand how something works\n- **Feature Request**: User wants new functionality\n- **Bug Report**: User believes something is broken\n\n### 2. For Questions - Answer First\n\nBefore suggesting an issue submission, attempt to answer using project documentation:\n\n1. Read `docs/guide/index.md` f","body":"# Submit Issue\n\nHandle user questions, feature requests, and bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n\nDetermine the request type:\n- **Question**: User wants to understand how something works\n- **Feature Request**: User wants new functionality\n- **Bug Report**: User believes something is broken\n\n### 2. For Questions - Answer First\n\nBefore suggesting an issue submission, attempt to answer using project documentation:\n\n1. Read `docs/guide/index.md` for getting started and features overview\n2. Read `docs/guide/architecture.md` for internal design and module structure\n3. Check other guides in `docs/guide/` for specific topics (configuration, compression, timeouts, etc.)\n4. Reference the connect-go-reference skill for protocol details\n5. Search the codebase for implementation specifics\n\nIf the question can be answered from documentation, provide the answer and ask if more clarification is needed.\n\n### 3. For Bug Reports - Verify First\n\nBefore submitting a bug report:\n\n1. **Reproduce the issue** - Ask user for reproduction steps if not provided\n2. **Run integration tests** - Use the `/test` skill command\n3. **Check connect-go behavior** - Use connect-go-reference skill to verify expected protocol behavior\n4. **Document findings** - Note whether tests pass/fail and any discrepancies\n\nOnly proceed to issue submission if the bug is verified or plausible.\n\n### 4. Submit to GitHub\n\nWhen issue submission is appropriate, use the `gh` CLI:\n\n```bash\n# For bug reports\ngh issue create \\\n  --repo \"frankgreco/connectrpc-axum\" \\\n  --title \"Bug: <concise description>\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Description\n<what''s broken>\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n1. <step>\n2. <step>\n\n## Expected Behavior\n<what should happen>\n\n## Actual Behavior\n<what happens instead>\n\n## Environment\n- connectrpc-axum version: <version>\n- Rust version: <version>\n\n## Additional Context\n<test results, connect-go comparison, etc.>\nEOF\n)\"\n\n# For feature requests\ngh issue create \\\n  --repo \"frankgreco/connectrpc-axum\" \\\n  --title \"Feature: <concise description>\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Description\n<what you want>\n\n## Use Case\n<why you need it>\n\n## Proposed Solution\n<how it might work>\n\n## Alternatives Considered\n<other approaches>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### 5. Label Issues Appropriately\n\nAdd labels based on issue type:\n- `bug` - For verified bugs\n- `enhancement` - For feature requests\n- `question` - For questions that need discussion\n- `documentation` - For docs improvements\n\n```bash\ngh issue edit <number> --add-label \"bug\"\n```\n\n## Reference Skills\n\n- **connect-go-reference**: Use to verify protocol behavior against official Go implementation\n- **test**: Use to run integration tests and verify bugs\n\n## Documentation References\n\nWhen answering questions, check these docs in order:\n\n1. `docs/guide/index.md` - Getting started, features, quick start\n2. `docs/guide/architecture.md` - Internal design, module structure, request flow\n3. `docs/guide/configuration.md` - Service and handler configuration\n4. `docs/guide/examples.md` - Code examples and usage patterns\n5. Other topic-specific guides in `docs/guide/` (compression, timeouts, tonic integration, etc.)\n6. Codebase search for implementation details\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:05:55.361Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Support Agents needing to handle user inquiries and issue tracking via gRPC and HTTP protocols.","zh":"非常适合需要通过gRPC和HTTP协议处理用户询问和问题跟踪的支持代理。","ja":"gRPCおよびHTTPプロトコルを介してユーザーの問い合わせや問題追跡を処理する必要があるサポートエージェントに最適です。","ko":"gRPC 및 HTTP 프로토콜을 통해 사용자의 문의 및 문제 추적을 처리해야 하는 지원 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Soporte que necesitan manejar consultas de usuarios y seguimiento de problemas a través de los protocolos gRPC y HTTP.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Support ayant besoin de gérer les demandes des utilisateurs et le suivi des problèmes via les protocoles gRPC et HTTP.","de":"Perfekt für Supportagenten, die Benutzeranfragen und Fehlerverfolgung über die Protokolle gRPC und HTTP bearbeiten müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Suporte que precisam lidar com consultas de usuário e rastreamento de problemas via protocolos gRPC e HTTP.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Поддержки, которым необходимо обрабатывать запросы пользователей и отслеживать проблемы через протоколы gRPC и HTTP.","ar":"مثالي لوسائط الدعم الذين يحتاجون إلى التعامل مع استفسارات المستخدمين وتتبع المشكلات عبر بروتوكولات gRPC و HTTP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to efficiently manage user requests by determining the request type and providing answers using project documentation, such as reading from ''docs/guide/index.md'' files, and handling feature requests and bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project.","zh":"赋予代理高效管理用户请求的能力，通过确定请求类型并使用项目文档（如从''docs/guide/index.md''文件中读取）提供答案，并处理connectrpc-axum项目的功能请求和错误报告。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーからのリクエストを効率的に管理できるようにすることで、リクエストの種類を決定し、プロジェクトのドキュメント（たとえば、''docs/guide/index.md''ファイルから読み取る）を使用して回答を提供し、connectrpc-axumプロジェクトの機能リクエストやバグレポートを処理します。","ko":"요청 유형을 결정하고 프로젝트 문서（예： ''docs/guide/index.md'' 파일에서 읽기）를 사용하여 답변을 제공하고 connectrpc-axum 프로젝트의 기능 요청 및 버그 보고서를 처리함으로써 에이전트가 사용자 요청을 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar eficientemente las solicitudes de los usuarios determinando el tipo de solicitud y proporcionando respuestas utilizando la documentación del proyecto, como leer archivos ''docs/guide/index.md'', y manejar solicitudes de características y informes de errores para el proyecto connectrpc-axum.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer efficacement les demandes des utilisateurs en déterminant le type de demande et en fournissant des réponses en utilisant la documentation du projet, comme la lecture de fichiers ''docs/guide/index.md'', et en gérant les demandes de fonctionnalités et les rapports de bogue pour le projet connectrpc-axum.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Benutzeranfragen effizient zu bearbeiten, indem sie den Anfragetyp bestimmen und Antworten mithilfe der Projektdokumentation bereitstellen, wie z.B. das Lesen von Dateien ''docs/guide/index.md'', und die Bearbeitung von Funktionsanfragen und Fehlerberichten für das connectrpc-axum-Projekt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar eficientemente os pedidos dos usuários, determinando o tipo de pedido e fornecendo respostas usando a documentação do projeto, como ler arquivos ''docs/guide/index.md'', e lidar com solicitações de recursos e relatórios de bugs para o projeto connectrpc-axum.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять запросами пользователей, определяя тип запроса и предоставляя ответы с использованием документации проекта, например, считывая файлы ''docs/guide/index.md'', и обрабатывая запросы функций и отчеты об ошибках для проекта connectrpc-axum.","ar":"يمكن الوسطاء من إدارة الطلبات المستخدم بنجاعة من خلال تحديد نوع الطلب وتقديم إجابات باستخدام مستندات المشروع، مثل قراءة ملفات ''docs/guide/index.md''، ومعالجة طلبات الميزات وتقارير الأخطاء للمشروع connectrpc-axum."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue submission workflows","Generating responses to user questions","Debugging bug reports for the connectrpc-axum project"],"zh":["自动化问题提交工作流程","生成对用户问题的响应","调试connectrpc-axum项目的错误报告"],"ja":["問題提出ワークフローの自動化","ユーザーからの質問に対する回答の生成","connectrpc-axumプロジェクトのバグレポートのデバッグ"],"ko":["문제 제출 워크플로우 자동화","사용자 질문에 대한 응답 생성","connectrpc-axum 프로젝트의 버그 보고서 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de flujos de trabajo de presentación de problemas","Generación de respuestas a preguntas de los usuarios","Depuración de informes de errores para el proyecto connectrpc-axum"],"fr":["Automatisation des flux de travail de soumission de problèmes","Génération de réponses aux questions des utilisateurs","Débogage des rapports de bogue pour le projet connectrpc-axum"],"de":["Automatisierung von Arbeitsabläufen zur Problemmeldung","Erzeugung von Antworten auf Benutzerfragen","Fehlerbehebung von Fehlerberichten für das connectrpc-axum-Projekt"],"pt":["Automatizar fluxos de trabalho de envio de problemas","Gerar respostas para perguntas do usuário","Depurar relatórios de bugs para o projeto connectrpc-axum"],"ru":["Автоматизировать рабочие процессы отправки проблем","Генерировать ответы на вопросы пользователей","Отладить отчеты об ошибках для проекта connectrpc-axum"],"ar":["أتمتة سير عمل تقديم المشكلات","توليد استجابات لأسئلة المستخدم","تصحيح أخطاء تقارير الأخطاء للمشروع connectrpc-axum"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to project documentation","Limited to handling questions, feature requests, and bug reports"],"zh":["需要访问项目文档","仅限处理问题、功能请求和错误报告"],"ja":["プロジェクトのドキュメントへのアクセスが必要","質問、機能リクエスト、バグレポートの処理のみ"],"ko":["프로젝트 문서에 액세스해야 함","질문, 기능 요청 및 버그 보고서 처리만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la documentación del proyecto","Limitado a la gestión de preguntas, solicitudes de características y informes de errores"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la documentation du projet","Limité à la gestion des questions, des demandes de fonctionnalités et des rapports de bogue"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Projektdokumentation","Begrenzt auf die Bearbeitung von Fragen, Funktionsanfragen und Fehlerberichten"],"pt":["Requer acesso à documentação do projeto","Limitado ao tratamento de perguntas, solicitações de recursos e relatórios de bugs"],"ru":["Требует доступа к документации проекта","Ограничен обработкой вопросов, запросов функций и отчетов об ошибках"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستندات المشروع","محدود بمعالجة الأسئلة وطلبات الميزات وتقارير الأخطاء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"81e9feab83656646a307a23e414edaac90105c448ef7a0364432999fd9307dbc","qualityScore":28}');
