И Агенты для создания тем с помощью Stitches.js","ar":"إنشاء مواضيع مع أدوات الإي أджنت للري액ت","en":"create-theme"},"description":{"zh":"create-theme是React Server Components的零运行时Stitches.js替代方案，帮助开发者提高效率","ja":"create-themeはReact Server ComponentsのゼロランタイムStitches.js置換であり、開発者の生産性を向上させます","ko":"create-theme은 리액트 서버 컴포넌트의 제로 런타임 스티치스js 대체이며 개발자의 생산성을 향상시킵니다","es":"Create-theme es una herramienta de AI que reemplaza Stitches.js en React Server Components, ofreciendo cero tiempo de ejecución","fr":"Create-theme est un outil IA qui remplace Stitches.js dans les composants serveur React, offrant un temps d''exécution nul","de":"Create-theme ist ein KI-Tool, das Stitches.js in React-Server-Komponenten ersetzt und null Laufzeit bietet","pt":"O create-theme é uma substituição zero-runtime do Stitches.js para React Server Components, permitindo a criação de temas personalizados.","ru":"Create-theme - это заменитель Stitches.js с нулевым временем выполнения для React Server Components, позволяющий создавать пользовательские темы.","ar":"إنشاء-مواضيع هو بديل ستيتشز.جس بدون وقت تشغيل لري액ت سرفر كمبوننتس، مما يسمح بإنشاء مواضيع مخصصة.","en":"Zero-runtime Stitches.js replacement for React Server Components"},"definition":{"en":"Zero-runtime Stitches.js replacement for React Server Components"},"features":{"zh":["零运行时的Stitches.js替代","适用于React Server Components","提高开发效率","简化代码结构","支持多种主题样式"],"ja":["ゼロランタイムのStitches.js置換","React Server Componentsに適応","開発者の生産性を向上","コード構造の簡素化","複数のテーマスタイルをサポート"],"ko":["제로 런타임의 스티치스js 대체","리액트 서버 컴포넌트에 적응","개발자의 생산성을 향상","코드 구조의 단순화","다수의 테마 스타일 지원"],"es":["Reemplazo de Stitches.js en React Server Components","Cero tiempo de ejecución","Compatibilidad con React","Fácil integración","Mejora del rendimiento"],"fr":["Remplacement de Stitches.js dans les composants serveur React","Temps d''exécution nul","Compatibilité avec React","Intégration facile","Amélioration des performances"],"de":["Ersetzen von Stitches.js in React-Server-Komponenten","Null Laufzeit","Kompatibilität mit React","Einfache Integration","Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["Substituição zero-runtime do Stitches.js","Criação de temas personalizados para React Server Components","Integração com React Server Components","Suporte a Stitches.js","Fácil de usar e configurar"],"ru":["Заменитель Stitches.js с нулевым временем выполнения","Создание пользовательских тем для React Server Components","Интеграция с React Server Components","Поддержка Stitches.js","Легко использовать и настраивать"],"ar":["بديل ستيتشز.جس بدون وقت تشغيل","إنشاء مواضيع مخصصة لري액ت سرفر كمبوننتس","التكامل مع ري액ت سرفر كمبوننتس","دعم ستيتشز.جس","سهل الاستخدام والتكوين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["create-theme","Stitches.js替代","React Server Components","零运行时","开发效率提高","如何使用create-theme","create-theme与Stitches.js比较","create-theme安装指南"],"ja":["create-theme","Stitches.js置換","React Server Components","ゼロランタイム","開発者の生産性を向上","create-themeの使い方","create-themeとStitches.jsの比較","create-themeのインストールガイド"],"ko":["create-theme","스티치스js 대체","리액트 서버 컴포넌트","제로 런타임","개발자의 생산성을 향상","create-theme 사용법","create-theme과 스티치스js 비교","create-theme 설치 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","create-theme","Stitches.js","React Server Components","cero tiempo de ejecución","how to use create-theme","what is create-theme","create-theme vs Stitches.js"],"fr":["outils IA","create-theme","Stitches.js","composants serveur React","temps d''exécution nul","comment utiliser create-theme","qu''est-ce que create-theme","create-theme vs Stitches.js"],"de":["KI-Tools","create-theme","Stitches.js","React-Server-Komponenten","null Laufzeit","wie man create-theme verwendet","was ist create-theme","create-theme vs Stitches.js"],"pt":["como usar create-theme","o que é create-theme","create-theme vs Stitches.js","instalar create-theme","guia de configuração do create-theme","ferramentas de IA Agents para React","criar temas personalizados para React","Stitches.js para React Server Components"],"ru":["как использовать create-theme","что такое create-theme","create-theme vs Stitches.js","установить create-theme","руководство по настройке create-theme","инструменты ИИ Агентов для React","создать пользовательские темы для React","Stitches.js для React Server Components"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام إنشاء-مواضيع","ما هو إنشاء-مواضيع","إنشاء-مواضيع مقابل ستيتشز.جس","تثبيت إنشاء-مواضيع","دليل إعداد إنشاء-مواضيع","أدوات الإي أджنت لري액ت","إنشاء مواضيع مخصصة لري액ت","ستيتشز.جس لري액ت سرفر كمبوننتس"]}},"owner":"artmsilva","repo":"stitches-rsc","repoPath":"artmsilva/stitches-rsc","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-01-28T00:26:57Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-theme","description":"This skill should be used when the user asks to create a theme, set up theme tokens, configure design tokens, add colors/spacing/typography, build a theme config, or wants help structuring a Stitches RSC theme configuration.","bodyPreview":"# Create Stitches RSC Theme\n\nGuide creation of properly structured and typed theme configurations for Stitches RSC.\n\n## Theme Structure Overview\n\nA Stitches theme consists of design tokens organized by scale:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createStitches } from ''@stitches-rsc/react'';\n\nconst { styled, css, theme, createTheme } = createStitches({\n  theme: {\n    colors: { /* color tokens */ },\n    space: { /* spacing tokens */ },\n    fontSizes: { /* typography scale */ },\n    fonts: { /* font families */","body":"# Create Stitches RSC Theme\n\nGuide creation of properly structured and typed theme configurations for Stitches RSC.\n\n## Theme Structure Overview\n\nA Stitches theme consists of design tokens organized by scale:\n\n```typescript\nimport { createStitches } from ''@stitches-rsc/react'';\n\nconst { styled, css, theme, createTheme } = createStitches({\n  theme: {\n    colors: { /* color tokens */ },\n    space: { /* spacing tokens */ },\n    fontSizes: { /* typography scale */ },\n    fonts: { /* font families */ },\n    fontWeights: { /* font weights */ },\n    lineHeights: { /* line heights */ },\n    letterSpacings: { /* letter spacing */ },\n    sizes: { /* width/height tokens */ },\n    borderWidths: { /* border widths */ },\n    borderStyles: { /* border styles */ },\n    radii: { /* border radius */ },\n    shadows: { /* box shadows */ },\n    zIndices: { /* z-index scale */ },\n    transitions: { /* transition values */ },\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Creating a Theme Step-by-Step\n\n### Step 1: Define Color Palette\n\nStart with semantic color tokens:\n\n```typescript\nconst theme = {\n  colors: {\n    // Brand colors\n    primary: ''#0070f3'',\n    primaryLight: ''#3291ff'',\n    primaryDark: ''#0051a8'',\n\n    // Semantic colors\n    success: ''#0070f3'',\n    warning: ''#f5a623'',\n    error: ''#e00'',\n    info: ''#0070f3'',\n\n    // Neutrals\n    background: ''#ffffff'',\n    foreground: ''#000000'',\n    border: ''#eaeaea'',\n\n    // Text\n    text: ''#171717'',\n    textMuted: ''#666666'',\n    textInverse: ''#ffffff'',\n\n    // Interactive states\n    hover: ''rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)'',\n    active: ''rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1)'',\n    focus: ''rgba(0, 112, 243, 0.4)'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Step 2: Define Spacing Scale\n\nUse a consistent spacing scale (4px base recommended):\n\n```typescript\nconst theme = {\n  space: {\n    0: ''0'',\n    1: ''4px'',\n    2: ''8px'',\n    3: ''12px'',\n    4: ''16px'',\n    5: ''20px'',\n    6: ''24px'',\n    7: ''28px'',\n    8: ''32px'',\n    9: ''36px'',\n    10: ''40px'',\n    12: ''48px'',\n    14: ''56px'',\n    16: ''64px'',\n    20: ''80px'',\n    24: ''96px'',\n    // Semantic aliases\n    xs: ''4px'',\n    sm: ''8px'',\n    md: ''16px'',\n    lg: ''24px'',\n    xl: ''32px'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Step 3: Define Typography\n\n```typescript\nconst theme = {\n  fonts: {\n    sans: ''Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif'',\n    serif: ''Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", serif'',\n    mono: ''Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", monospace'',\n  },\n\n  fontSizes: {\n    xs: ''0.75rem'',    // 12px\n    sm: ''0.875rem'',   // 14px\n    base: ''1rem'',     // 16px\n    lg: ''1.125rem'',   // 18px\n    xl: ''1.25rem'',    // 20px\n    ''2xl'': ''1.5rem'',  // 24px\n    ''3xl'': ''1.875rem'',// 30px\n    ''4xl'': ''2.25rem'', // 36px\n    ''5xl'': ''3rem'',    // 48px\n  },\n\n  fontWeights: {\n    thin: ''100'',\n    light: ''300'',\n    normal: ''400'',\n    medium: ''500'',\n    semibold: ''600'',\n    bold: ''700'',\n    extrabold: ''800'',\n  },\n\n  lineHeights: {\n    none: ''1'',\n    tight: ''1.25'',\n    snug: ''1.375'',\n    normal: ''1.5'',\n    relaxed: ''1.625'',\n    loose: ''2'',\n  },\n\n  letterSpacings: {\n    tighter: ''-0.05em'',\n    tight: ''-0.025em'',\n    normal: ''0'',\n    wide: ''0.025em'',\n    wider: ''0.05em'',\n    widest: ''0.1em'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n### Step 4: Define Visual Properties\n\n```typescript\nconst theme = {\n  radii: {\n    none: ''0'',\n    sm: ''2px'',\n    base: ''4px'',\n    md: ''6px'',\n    lg: ''8px'',\n    xl: ''12px'',\n    ''2xl'': ''16px'',\n    full: ''9999px'',\n  },\n\n  shadows: {\n    none: ''none'',\n    sm: ''0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)'',\n    base: ''0 1px 3px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 1px 2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)'',\n    md: ''0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 2px 4px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)'',\n    lg: ''0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)'',\n    xl: ''0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 10px 10px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04)'',\n    inner: ''inset 0 2px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06)'',\n  },\n\n  borderWidths: {\n    0: ''0'',\n    1: ''1px'',\n    2: ''2px'',\n    4: ''4px'',\n    8: ''8px'',\n  },\n\n  zIndices: {\n    hide: ''-1'',\n    auto: ''auto'',\n    base: ''0'',\n    docked: ''10'',\n    dropdown: ''1000'',\n    sticky: ''1100'',\n    banner: ''1200'',\n    overlay: ''1300'',\n    modal: ''1400'',\n    popover: ''1500'',\n    toast: ''1700'',\n    tooltip: ''1800'',\n  },\n\n  transitions: {\n    none: ''none'',\n    fast: ''150ms ease'',\n    base: ''200ms ease'',\n    slow: ''300ms ease'',\n    slower: ''400ms ease'',\n  },\n};\n```\n\n## Using Theme Tokens\n\nReference tokens with `$scale$token` syntax:\n\n```typescript\nconst Button = styled(''button'', {\n  backgroundColor: ''$colors$primary'',\n  padding: ''$space$2 $space$4'',\n  fontSize: ''$fontSizes$base'',\n  fontFamily: ''$fonts$sans'',\n  borderRadius: ''$radii$md'',\n  boxShadow: ''$shadows$sm'',\n  transition: ''all $transitions$fast'',\n\n  ''&:hover'': {\n    backgroundColor: ''$colors$primaryDark'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\nShorthand for same-name scale (using themeMap):\n\n```typescript\nconst Button = styled(''button'', {\n  // These are equivalent due to defaultThemeMap\n  color: ''$primary'',           // maps to colors.primary\n  padding: ''$2'',               // maps to space.2\n  fontSize: ''$base'',           // maps to fontSizes.base\n});\n```\n\n## Creating Theme Variants\n\nCreate alternate themes with `createTheme`:\n\n```typescript\nconst darkTheme = createTheme(''dark'', {\n  colors: {\n    background: ''#0a0a0a'',\n    foreground: ''#ffffff'',\n    text: ''#ededed'',\n    textMuted: ''#a1a1a1'',\n    border: ''#333333'',\n    primary: ''#3291ff'',\n    hover: ''rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)'',\n  },\n});\n\n// Apply theme with className\n<div className={darkTheme}>\n  <App />\n</div>\n```\n\n## Complete Example\n\n```typescript\n// stitches.config.ts\nimport { createStitches } from ''@stitches-rsc/react'';\n\nexport const {\n  styled,\n  css,\n  globalCss,\n  keyframes,\n  theme,\n  createTheme,\n  getCssText,\n} = createStitches({\n  prefix: ''app'',\n\n  theme: {\n    colors: {\n      primary: ''#0070f3'',\n      primaryLight: ''#3291ff'',\n      primaryDark: ''#0051a8'',\n      secondary: ''#7928ca'',\n      success: ''#17c964'',\n      warning: ''#f5a623'',\n      error: ''#f21361'',\n      background: ''#ffffff'',\n      foreground: ''#000000'',\n      text: ''#171717'',\n      textMuted: ''#666666'',\n      border: ''#eaeaea'',\n    },\n    space: {\n      1: ''4px'', 2: ''8px'', 3: ''12px'', 4: ''16px'',\n      5: ''20px'', 6: ''24px'', 8: ''32px'', 10: ''40px'',\n    },\n    fontSizes: {\n      xs: ''0.75rem'', sm: ''0.875rem'', base: ''1rem'',\n      lg: ''1.125rem'', xl: ''1.25rem'', ''2xl'': ''1.5rem'',\n    },\n    fonts: {\n      sans: ''Inter, -apple-system, sans-serif'',\n      mono: ''Menlo, monospace'',\n    },\n    fontWeights: { normal: ''400'', medium: ''500'', bold: ''700'' },\n    lineHeights: { tight: ''1.25'', normal: ''1.5'', relaxed: ''1.75'' },\n    radii: { sm: ''4px'', md: ''8px'', lg: ''12px'', full: ''9999px'' },\n    shadows: {\n      sm: ''0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.05)'',\n      md: ''0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1)'',\n    },\n    zIndices: { modal: ''1000'', tooltip: ''1500'' },\n    transitions: { fast: ''150ms ease'', base: ''200ms ease'' },\n  },\n\n  media: {\n    sm: ''(min-width: 640px)'',\n    md: ''(min-width: 768px)'',\n    lg: ''(min-width: 1024px)'',\n    xl: ''(min-width: 1280px)'',\n  },\n\n  utils: {\n    mx: (value: string) => ({ marginLeft: value, marginRight: value }),\n    my: (value: string) => ({ marginTop: value, marginBottom: value }),\n    px: (value: string) => ({ paddingLeft: value, paddingRight: value }),\n    py: (value: string) => ({ paddingTop: value, paddingBottom: value }),\n    size: (value: string) => ({ width: value, height: value }),\n  },\n});\n\nexport const darkTheme = createTheme(''dark'', {\n  colors: {\n    background: ''#0a0a0a'',\n    foreground: ''#ffffff'',\n    text: ''#ededed'',\n    textMuted: ''#a1a1a1'',\n    border: ''#333333'',\n  },\n});\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\nSee `references/theme-scales.md` for the complete list of theme scales and their CSS property mappings.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T04:01:02.374Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing structured theme configurations for React Server Components","zh":"非常适合需要为 React Server Components 配置结构化主题的前端代理","ja":"React Server Components に構造化されたテーマ設定が必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適","ko":"React Server Components에 구조화된 테마 구성을 필요로 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan configuraciones de temas estructuradas para Componentes de Servidor de React","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de configurations de thème structurées pour les Composants de Serveur React","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die strukturierte Theme-Konfigurationen für React-Server-Komponenten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de configurações de tema estruturadas para React Server Components","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходимы структурированные конфигурации тем для React Server Components","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذين يحتاجون إلى تكوينات موضوعية منظمة لملحقات الخادم React"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate properly structured and typed theme configurations for Stitches RSC, utilizing design tokens organized by scale, including colors, space, fontSizes, and fonts, and leveraging libraries like @stitches-rsc/react","zh":"赋予代理生成适当结构化和类型化的主题配置，利用 Stitches RSC，组织规模的设计令牌，包括颜色，空间，字体大小和字体，并利用类似 @stitches-rsc/react 的库","ja":"Stitches RSC を使用して、スケールによって整理されたデザイン トークン（色、スペース、フォントサイズ、フォントなど）を活用し、@stitches-rsc/react などのライブラリを利用して、適切に構造化され、型付けされたテーマ設定をエージェントが生成できるようにする","ko":"스케일로 조직된 디자인 토큰(색상, 공간, 글꼴 크기, 글꼴 등)을 사용하여 적절하게 구조화되고 유형화된 테마 구성을 에이전트가 생성할 수 있도록 하고, @stitches-rsc/react와 같은 라이브러리를 활용하여 Stitches RSC를 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar configuraciones de temas adecuadamente estructuradas y tipadas para Stitches RSC, utilizando tokens de diseño organizados por escala, incluyendo colores, espacio, tamaños de fuente y fuentes, y aprovechando bibliotecas como @stitches-rsc/react","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des configurations de thème correctement structurées et typées pour Stitches RSC, en utilisant des jetons de conception organisés par échelle, notamment des couleurs, des espaces, des tailles de police et des polices, et en exploitant des bibliothèques comme @stitches-rsc/react","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ordnungsgemäß strukturierte und typisierte Theme-Konfigurationen für Stitches RSC zu generieren, indem Design-Tokens nach Skala organisiert werden, einschließlich Farben, Abständen, Schriftgrößen und Schriftarten, und Bibliotheken wie @stitches-rsc/react nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar configurações de tema adequadamente estruturadas e tipadas para Stitches RSC, utilizando tokens de design organizados por escala, incluindo cores, espaço, fontSizes e fontes, e aproveitando bibliotecas como @stitches-rsc/react","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать правильно структурированные и типизированные конфигурации тем для Stitches RSC, используя токены дизайна, организованные по масштабу, включая цвета, пространство, fontSizes и шрифты, и использует библиотеки như @stitches-rsc/react","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توليد تكوينات موضوعية منظمة ومدروسة لملحقات Stitches RSC، باستخدام رموز التصميم المنظمة حسب المقاييس، بما في ذلك الألوان والمسافة وحجوم الخطوط والأحرف، والاستفادة من المكتبات مثل @stitches-rsc/react"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating customizable theme configurations for React applications","Generating scalable typography systems with fontSizes and fonts","Defining consistent color palettes and spacing tokens for design cohesion"],"zh":["为 React 应用程序创建可自定义的主题配置","使用字体大小和字体生成可扩展的字体系统","定义一致的颜色调色板和间距令牌以实现设计凝聚力"],"ja":["React アプリケーションのカスタマイズ可能なテーマ設定を作成する","フォントサイズとフォントを使用してスケーラブルなタイポグラフィシステムを生成する","デザインの凝集力を実現するために一貫した色のパレットとスペース トークンを定義する"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 정의 가능한 테마 구성을 생성","글꼴 크기와 글꼴을 사용하여 확장 가능한 타이포그래피 시스템을 생성","디자인의 일관성을 달성하기 위해 일관된 색상 팔레트와 간격 토큰을 정의"],"es":["Crear configuraciones de temas personalizables para aplicaciones React","Generar sistemas de tipografía escalables con tamaños de fuente y fuentes","Definir paletas de colores y tokens de espaciado coherentes para la cohesión del diseño"],"fr":["Créer des configurations de thème personnalisables pour les applications React","Générer des systèmes de typographie escalables avec des tailles de police et des polices","Définir des palettes de couleurs et des jetons d''espacement cohérents pour la cohésion de la conception"],"de":["Erstellen von anpassbaren Theme-Konfigurationen für React-Anwendungen","Generieren von skalierbaren Schriftsystemen mit Schriftgrößen und Schriftarten","Definieren von konsistenten Farbpaletten und Abstandstoken für Design-Kohärenz"],"pt":["Criar configurações de tema personalizáveis para aplicações React","Gerar sistemas tipográficos escaláveis com fontSizes e fontes","Definir paletas de cores e tokens de espaçamento consistentes para coesão de design"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых конфигураций тем для приложений React","Генерация масштабируемых типографических систем с fontSizes и шрифтами","Определение последовательных цветовых палитр и токенов пространства для сплоченности дизайна"],"ar":["إنشاء تكوينات موضوعية قابلة للتعديل لتطبيقات React","توليد أنظمة طباعية قابلة للتوسيع باستخدام fontSizes والأحرف","تحديد لوحات ألوان وتوكنات مسافة متسقة لاتساق التصميم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires @stitches-rsc/react library","Specific to React Server Components","Limited to TypeScript-based projects"],"zh":["需要 @stitches-rsc/react 库","特定于 React Server Components","仅限于基于 TypeScript 的项目"],"ja":["@stitches-rsc/react ライブラリを必要とする","React Server Components に特有のもの","TypeScript ベースのプロジェクトのみに限定される"],"ko":["@stitches-rsc/react 라이브러리가 필요","React Server Components에 특정","TypeScript 기반 프로젝트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere la biblioteca @stitches-rsc/react","Específico para Componentes de Servidor de React","Limitado a proyectos basados en TypeScript"],"fr":["Nécessite la bibliothèque @stitches-rsc/react","Spécifique aux Composants de Serveur React","Limité aux projets basés sur TypeScript"],"de":["Benötigt die Bibliothek @stitches-rsc/react","Spezifisch für React-Server-Komponenten","Begrenzt auf TypeScript-basierte Projekte"],"pt":["Requer a biblioteca @stitches-rsc/react","Específico para React Server Components","Limitado a projetos baseados em TypeScript"],"ru":["Требует библиотеки @stitches-rsc/react","Специфичен для React Server Components","Ограничен проектами на основе TypeScript"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة @stitches-rsc/react","محدد لملحقات الخادم React","محدود بمشاريع قاعدة TypeScript"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7ddf5072c22e565797d1f96017f0d65d6bb6eadaa06d370769eed71c8a4cb666","qualityScore":28}');
