on pour les développeurs","outils d''IA pour les musiciens","développement d''instruments de musique innovants"],"de":["wie man KI-Tools für Musik verwendet","was ist ein polychorales orthonotes Instrument","Alternativen zu traditionellen Musikinstrumenten","polychorales orthonotes Instrument vs akustische Instrumente","Installation von polychoralen orthonoten Instrumenten","Konfigurationshandbuch für Entwickler","KI-Tools für Musiker","Entwicklung von innovativen Musikinstrumenten"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para música","como tocar Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","o que é Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument alternative","instalar Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","guia de configuração do Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","técnicas de processamento de áudio","bibliotecas de música eletrônica"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для музыки","как играть на Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","что такое Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument альтернатива","установить Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","руководство по настройке Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","техники обработки аудио","библиотеки электронной музыки"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للموسيقى","كيف تشغيل Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","ما هو Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument بديل","تثبيت Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","دليل إعداد Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","تقنيات معالجة الصوت","مكتبات الموسيقى الإلكترونية"]}},"owner":"Domusgpt","repo":"Orthonotone","repoPath":"Domusgpt/Orthonotone","stars":1,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2025-11-01T16:35:11Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Performing Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument","description":"Guides agents through launching, playing, sculpting, and capturing performances with the Orthonotone polychoral instrument MVP. Use when generating music, soundscapes, or live demos from this repository.","bodyPreview":"# Performing Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument\n\n## Contents\n- [Stage setup](#stage-setup)\n- [Performance quickstart](#performance-quickstart)\n- [Control surface map](#control-surface-map)\n- [Gestural choreography](#gestural-choreography)\n- [Scene design and snapshots](#scene-design-and-snapshots)\n- [Tempo and groove engine](#tempo-and-groove-engine)\n- [Recording and sharing takes](#recording-and-sharing-takes)\n- [Troubleshooting cues](#troubleshooting-cues)\n- [Reference atlas](#reference-atlas)","body":"# Performing Orthonotone Polychoral Instrument\n\n## Contents\n- [Stage setup](#stage-setup)\n- [Performance quickstart](#performance-quickstart)\n- [Control surface map](#control-surface-map)\n- [Gestural choreography](#gestural-choreography)\n- [Scene design and snapshots](#scene-design-and-snapshots)\n- [Tempo and groove engine](#tempo-and-groove-engine)\n- [Recording and sharing takes](#recording-and-sharing-takes)\n- [Troubleshooting cues](#troubleshooting-cues)\n- [Reference atlas](#reference-atlas)\n\n## Stage setup\n1. **Serve the project** – run any static server from the repo root (`npx http-server .` is sufficient) and open `polychoral-instrument-mvp.html` in a Chromium-based browser for best WebAudio timing.\n2. **Prime Playwright harness (optional)** – `npm install` once, then `npm run check` to ensure the QA hooks remain healthy before and after your session.\n3. **Warm the audio graph** – click **Enable Audio** in either the toolbar or System section of the Controls panel. Browsers insist on a user gesture before sound.\n4. **Set your monitoring level** – adjust **Master Volume** immediately; presets and snapshots respect the level currently set.\n\n## Performance quickstart\n- **Canvas focus** – keep the canvas in view (toggle Focus Mode if panels crowd the stage). The hypercube visualization reacts to the same modulation that drives the synth.\n- **Baseline scene** – start from **Neutral Lattice** or **Prismatic Bloom** in *Quick Scene* to align with the sound you want. Custom tweaks always begin from the current selection.\n- **Check system status** – expand the **Live State Vectors** panel for meters showing axis energy, edge resonance, and face harmonic bloom. Use these readouts to balance the mix while improvising.\n- **Keep audio alive** – if silence returns after inactivity, tap **Enable Audio** again; the button mirrors the AudioContext state.\n\n## Control surface map\n### State Space\n- **Quick Scene selector**: instant morph targets (Neutral, Drift, Bloom, Pulse).\n- **Snapshots**: name and store mixes for instant recall mid-set.\n- **Dimension / Morph / Grid / Fidelity** sliders: reshape the rendered hyper lattice and corresponding harmonic density.\n\n### Timbre Architecture\n- **Line Thickness, Shell Width, Tetra Density**: sculpt the visual-acoustic shell; thicker values emphasize lower resonances.\n- **Color Shift & Glitch Intensity**: paint spectral hue and sprinkle jittered overtones.\n\n### Rotation Velocities\n- Six sliders (XY…ZW) drive base angular speed in radians/sec. Pair them with gestures for evolving drones versus rhythmic pulses.\n\n### System Suite\n- **Master Volume** controls output gain post-fader.\n- **Enable Audio** toggles the synth graph.\n- **Symmetry Snap** recenters rotation for crystalline chords.\n- **Reset State** returns sliders to defaults while leaving audio on.\n- **Freeze Rotation** halts motion for sustained pads.\n- **MIDI Bridge** connects controllers, enabling external modulation.\n- **Tempo Sync** buttons follow external MIDI clock or rephase the internal clock.\n\n## Gestural choreography\n- **Pointer drags**: default drags modulate XY/YZ/XZ; hold **Shift** for XW/YW, **Alt** for XZ/ZW, **Ctrl / ⌘** for fine isoclinic blends.\n- **Touchscreens**: second finger emulates Shift, third finger unlocks Alt; no hardware keyboard required.\n- **Motion input (beta)**: enable via Gesture panel for accelerometer blending; calibrate neutral tilt before performing.\n- **Focus Mode & Hide Panels**: reclaim screen real estate mid-performance without losing panel state.\n\n## Scene design and snapshots\n1. **Choose or sculpt a starting scene** via Quick Scene.\n2. **Dial lattice parameters** (Dimension/Morph/Grid/Fidelity) to set harmonic density.\n3. **Shape timbre** with Shell/Line/Tetra and Color/Glitch controls.\n4. **Balance rotation speeds** so Status panel meters pulse in complementary patterns (e.g., pair XY with XZ for shimmering fifths).\n5. **Store the state**: enter a descriptive name and click **Save Snapshot**; it appears in the snapshot list for one-click recall.\n6. **Annotate experiments** – log notable parameter sets in `audio-upgrade-turn2-core-dsp.md` or related plan docs so future performers can reproduce them.\n\n## Tempo and groove engine\n- **Clock Division & Rhythm Pattern** choose internal sequencer grids (Quarter, Eighth, Triplet, Sixteenth; Drive Pulse, Syncopated Lift, Euclidean Five, Ambient Bloom, Custom Sculpt).\n- **Groove Swing** introduces humanized delay; values above 0.3 create loping polyrhythms.\n- **Pattern Sculptor** appears when *Custom Sculpt* is selected—paint per-step intensities, use **Euclidise** for evenly spaced hits, **Humanise** for slight randomness, or **Clear** to reset.\n- **MIDI Clock Follow** syncs modulation to external gear; monitor **Tempo Sync** and **Clock Phase** in the Status panel to verify lock.\n\n## Recording and sharing takes\n1. **Screen capture** – use system-level screen/audio recorder (e.g., QuickTime, OBS) to capture both visuals and sound; ensure desktop audio is routed from the browser.\n2. **Snapshot setlists** – before recording, queue snapshots in performance order for rapid transitions.\n3. **Document presets** – after recording, export slider values by copying the QA report (Status → QA Diagnostics → Copy Report) to archive performance settings.\n4. **Share context** – attach relevant plan doc links or commit hashes when distributing audio/video so collaborators can align with the build you used.\n\n## Troubleshooting cues\n- **No sound after enabling**: confirm Master Volume > 0 and the Status panel shows AudioContext \"Running\". Reload the page if the context gets stuck in \"Suspended\".\n- **Gestures feel unresponsive**: check if **Freeze Rotation** is active, or if axis sliders are pegged at zero. Recenter with **Reset State**.\n- **Panel clutter**: toggle **Hide Panels** then reopen only what you need; Focus Mode hides panels but keeps toggles docked.\n- **MIDI not detected**: ensure browser permissions allow MIDI, press **Connect MIDI** again, and verify device appears in the dropdown.\n\n## Reference atlas\n- **Instrument surface**: [`polychoral-instrument-mvp.html`](../../polychoral-instrument-mvp.html) – main performance canvas, panels, and synth wiring.\n- **Render & audio theory**: [`hypercube_core_webgl_system.md`](../../hypercube_core_webgl_system.md), [`audio-synthesis-master-plan.md`](../../audio-synthesis-master-plan.md), [`audio-upgrade-turn2-core-dsp.md`](../../audio-upgrade-turn2-core-dsp.md).\n- **Roadmaps**: [`mvp-roadmap.md`](../../mvp-roadmap.md), [`development-expansion-plan.md`](../../development-expansion-plan.md), [`interface-responsiveness-plan.md`](../../interface-responsiveness-plan.md).\n- **QA harness**: [`check-instrument.js`](../../check-instrument.js) for Playwright-driven regression playback.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-26T08:44:58.902Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Music Generation Agents requiring advanced orchestration and polychoral capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级管弦乐和复音合唱功能的音乐生成代理。","ja":"高度な管弦楽とポリコーラル機能を必要とする音楽生成エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 오케스트레이션 및 폴리코럴 기능이 필요한 음악 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Generación de Música que requieren orquestación avanzada y capacidad policoral.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Génération de Musique nécessitant une orchestration avancée et des capacités polychorales.","de":"Ideal für Musik-Generierungsagenten, die eine erweiterte Orchestrierung und polychorale Fähigkeiten erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Música que requerem orquestração avançada e capacidades policorais.","ru":"Идеально для агентов генерации музыки, требующих продвинутой оркестровки и поликоральных возможностей.","ar":"المثالية لعميل توليد الموسيقى الذي يتطلب التأليف الموسيقي المتقدم والقدرات البوليكورالية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create complex musical compositions using tempo and groove engines, while leveraging control surface maps and gestural choreography to produce unique orthonotone polychoral instrument performances, all while utilizing scene design and snapshot features.","zh":"赋予代理创建复杂音乐作品的能力，使用节奏和groove引擎，同时利用控制面板映射和手势编舞来产生独特的等音高复音合唱乐器表演，全程使用场景设计和快照功能。","ja":"テンポとグルーヴエンジンを使用して複雑な音楽作品を作成するエージェントに力を与え、コントロールサーフェイスマップとジェスチャーコレオグラフィーを利用して独自の等音高ポリコーラル楽器パフォーマンスを生成し、シーン設計とスナップショット機能を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 템포와 그루브 엔진을 사용하여 복잡한 음악 작품을 생성할 수 있게 해주며, 제어 표면 맵과 제스처 안무를 활용하여 고유의 등음고 폴리코럴 악기 연주를 생성하고, 장면 설계 및 스냅샷 기능을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear composiciones musicales complejas utilizando motores de tempo y groove, mientras aprovechan mapas de superficies de control y coreografía gestual para producir rendiciones únicas de instrumentos policorales orthonotones, todo mientras utiliza características de diseño de escena y instantáneas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des compositions musicales complexes en utilisant des moteurs de tempo et de groove, tout en exploitant des cartes de surfaces de contrôle et une chorégraphie gestuelle pour produire des performances uniques d''instruments polychoraux orthonotones, le tout en utilisant des fonctionnalités de conception de scène et de captures d''écran.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, komplexe musikalische Kompositionen zu erstellen, indem sie Tempo- und Groove-Engines verwenden, während sie Steuerflächenkarten und gestische Choreographie nutzen, um einzigartige Darbietungen von orthonotonen polychoralen Instrumenten zu produzieren, und zwar unter Verwendung von Szenen-Design- und Schnappschussfunktionen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar composições musicais complexas usando motores de tempo e groove, aproveitando mapas de superfícies de controle e coreografia gestual para produzir performances únicas de instrumentos policorais orotonos, tudo isso utilizando recursos de design de cena e recursos de captura.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать сложные музыкальные композиции с помощью двигателей темпа и грува, используя карты управления поверхностью и жестовую хореографию для производства уникальных ортонотных поликоральных инструментальных выступлений, все это при использовании функций сценарного дизайна и моментальных снимков.","ar":"يمكن الوكيل من إنشاء تركيبات موسيقية معقدة باستخدام محركات الإيقاع والانسيابية، مع الاستفادة من خرائط السطح التحكمي والكوريغرافيا التعبيرية لإنتاج أداء فريد للأدوات البوليكورالية الأوروتونية، وكل ذلك باستخدام ميزات تصميم المشهد وميزات اللقطة."},"useCases":{"en":["Orchestrating polychoral instrument performances with precise tempo control","Generating musical compositions that incorporate gestural choreography","Recording and sharing takes of orthonotone polychoral instrument performances"],"zh":["使用精确的节奏控制来管弦乐复音合唱乐器表演","生成包含手势编舞的音乐作品","记录和分享等音高复音合唱乐器表演的版本"],"ja":["正確なテンポ制御を使用してポリコーラル楽器パフォーマンスをオーケストレーションする","ジェスチャーコレオグラフィーを含む音楽作品を生成する","等音高ポリコーラル楽器パフォーマンスのテイクを録音して共有する"],"ko":["정확한 템포 제어를 사용하여 폴리코럴 악기 연주를 오케스트레이션하는 것","제스처 안무를 포함하는 음악 작품을 생성하는 것","등음고 폴리코럴 악기 연주를 녹음하고 공유하는 것"],"es":["Orquestar rendiciones de instrumentos policorales con control de tempo preciso","Generar composiciones musicales que incorporen coreografía gestual","Grabar y compartir tomas de rendiciones de instrumentos policorales orthonotones"],"fr":["Orchestrer des performances d''instruments polychoraux avec un contrôle de tempo précis","Générer des compositions musicales qui intègrent une chorégraphie gestuelle","Enregistrer et partager des prises de performances d''instruments polychoraux orthonotones"],"de":["Orchestrieren von Darbietungen polychoraler Instrumente mit präziser Tempokontrolle","Erstellen von musikalischen Kompositionen, die gestische Choreographie einbeziehen","Aufnehmen und teilen von Aufnahmen von Darbietungen orthonotoner polychoraler Instrumente"],"pt":["Orquestração de performances de instrumentos policorais com controle de tempo preciso","Geração de composições musicais que incorporam coreografia gestual","Gravação e compartilhamento de takes de performances de instrumentos policorais orotonos"],"ru":["Оркестровка выступлений поликоральных инструментов с точным контролем темпа","Генерация музыкальных композиций, включающих жестовую хореографию","Запись и обмен дублями ортонотных поликоральных инструментальных выступлений"],"ar":["التأليف الموسيقي لأداء الأدوات البوليكورالية بدقة في التحكم بالإيقاع","توليد التركيبات الموسيقية التي تتضمن الكوريغرافيا التعبيرية","تسجيل ومشاركة الأداء للأدوات البوليكورالية الأوروتونية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of music theory and orthonotone polychoral instrument specifics","Dependent on agent''s ability to interpret and generate musical compositions","Limited to orthonotone polychoral instrument performances"],"zh":["需要音乐理论和等音高复音合唱乐器的具体知识","依赖于代理解释和生成音乐作品的能力","仅限于等音高复音合唱乐器表演"],"ja":["音楽理論と等音高ポリコーラル楽器の具体的な知識が必要","エージェントが音楽作品を解釈して生成する能力に依存する","等音高ポリコーラル楽器パフォーマンスのみに限定される"],"ko":["음악 이론 및 등음고 폴리코럴 악기 세부 사항에 대한 지식이 필요","에이전트가 음악 작품을 해석하고 생성하는 능력에 의존","등음고 폴리코럴 악기 연주에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de teoría musical y especificaciones de instrumentos policorales orthonotones","Depende de la capacidad del agente para interpretar y generar composiciones musicales","Limitado a rendiciones de instrumentos policorales orthonotones"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la théorie musicale et des spécificités des instruments polychoraux orthonotones","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à interpréter et à générer des compositions musicales","Limité aux performances d''instruments polychoraux orthonotones"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Musiktheorie und Spezifika orthonotoner polychoraler Instrumente","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, musikalische Kompositionen zu interpretieren und zu generieren","Begrenzt auf Darbietungen orthonotoner polychoraler Instrumente"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de teoria musical e especificidades de instrumentos policorais orotonos","Dependente da capacidade do agente de interpretar e gerar composições musicais","Limitado a performances de instrumentos policorais orotonos"],"ru":["Требует знания музыкальной теории и спецификаций ортонотных поликоральных инструментов","Зависит от способности агента интерпретировать и генерировать музыкальные композиции","Ограничен ортонотными поликоральными инструментальными выступлениями"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة النظرية الموسيقية وال细یات الخاصة بالأدوات البوليكورالية الأوروتونية","يعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على تفسير و توليد التركيبات الموسيقية","محدود بأداء الأدوات البوليكورالية الأوروتونية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ecc7c962eaf132d3de9b99b1e20f60571e81243b92578c9408a63b8eb24bc949","qualityScore":27}');
