améliorer l''efficacité de l''équipe","Définition de terminé personnalisable","Analyse du flux de travail","Intégration avec des outils d''IA","Rapports et statistiques détaillés"],"de":["Kanban-Simulator für die Verbesserung der Team-Effizienz","Anpassbare Definition of Done","Analyse des Arbeitsflusses","Integration mit KI-Tools","Detaillierte Berichte und Statistiken"],"pt":["Simulador Kanban para entender o conceito de definição de pronto","Melhoria da eficiência do fluxo de trabalho","Definição de critérios para considerar uma tarefa concluída","Análise do impacto da definição de pronto no fluxo de trabalho","Otimização do processo de trabalho com base nos resultados do simulador"],"ru":["Симулятор Kanban для понимания концепции определения готовности","Повышение эффективности рабочего процесса","Определение критериев для рассмотрения задачи как завершенной","Анализ влияния определения готовности на рабочий процесс","Оптимизация процесса работы на основе результатов симулятора"],"ar":["محاكي كانبان لفهم مفهوم التعريف بالإنجاز","تحسين كفاءة تدفق العمل","تحديد معايير لاعتبار مهمة مكتملة","تحليل تأثير التعريف بالإنجاز على تدفق العمل","تحسين عملية العمل بناءً على نتائج المحاكي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能工具","Definition-of-Done","Kanban模拟器","敏捷开发","项目管理","如何使用Definition-of-Done","Kanban模拟器教程","AI智能工具安装","Definition-of-Done标准化流程"],"ja":["AIエージェント","定義された完了条件","Kanbanシミュレーター","アジャイル開発","プロジェクト管理","定義された完了条件の使い方","Kanbanシミュレーターのチュートリアル","AIエージェントのインストール","定義された完了条件の標準化プロセス"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","정의된 완료 조건","Kanban 시뮬레이터","애자일 개발","프로젝트 관리","정의된 완료 조건의 사용 방법","Kanban 시뮬레이터 튜토리얼","AI 에이전트 설치","정의된 완료 조건의 표준화 과정"],"es":["herramientas de AI","definición de listo","simulador Kanban","mejora de la eficiencia","gestión de proyectos","desarrollo de software","integración con herramientas de AI","informes y estadísticas","alternativas a Trello"],"fr":["outils d''IA","définition de terminé","simulateur Kanban","amélioration de l''efficacité","gestion de projets","développement de logiciels","intégration avec des outils d''IA","rapports et statistiques","alternatives à Trello"],"de":["KI-Tools","Definition of Done","Kanban-Simulator","Verbesserung der Effizienz","Projektmanagement","Software-Entwicklung","Integration mit KI-Tools","Berichte und Statistiken","Alternativen zu Trello"],"pt":["definição de pronto","simulador Kanban","ferramentas de IA","melhoria da eficiência","fluxo de trabalho","otimização do processo","como usar definição de pronto","o que é definição de pronto"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","определение готовности","симулятор Kanban","повышение эффективности","рабочий процесс","оптимизация процесса","как использовать определение готовности","что такое определение готовности"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تعريف الإنجاز","محاكي كانبان","تحسين كفاءة","تدفق العمل","تحسين عملية","كيفية استخدام التعريف بالإنجاز","ما هو التعريف بالإنجاز"]}},"owner":"agnaldo4j","repo":"kanban_vision_api_iex","repoPath":"agnaldo4j/kanban_vision_api_iex","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T14:49:04Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"definition-of-done","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Definition of Done — Platform Downstream\n\n> **Golden Rule**: If any checkbox below is not checked, it is not done.\n> Quality, security, and predictability for B2B/B2C come from fully meeting this DoD.\n> If something prevented compliance, identify it and fix it so the next delivery is compliant.\n\n---\n\n## How to use this skill\n\nWhen asked to finish, close, or mark a task as done:\n\n1. Go through each section below.\n2. For each item, confirm it was done or explicitly state why it is N/A.\n3. If any","body":"# Definition of Done — Platform Downstream\n\n> **Golden Rule**: If any checkbox below is not checked, it is not done.\n> Quality, security, and predictability for B2B/B2C come from fully meeting this DoD.\n> If something prevented compliance, identify it and fix it so the next delivery is compliant.\n\n---\n\n## How to use this skill\n\nWhen asked to finish, close, or mark a task as done:\n\n1. Go through each section below.\n2. For each item, confirm it was done or explicitly state why it is N/A.\n3. If any item is missing, implement it or flag it before closing.\n4. Never silently skip a section.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Contract, Traceability and Origin\n\n- [ ] Item entered through official channels with origin and service class defined:\n  `Feature/Outcome` | `Bug/Incident` | `Risk/Compliance` | `Tech Debt` | `Discovery/Experiment`\n- [ ] Problem or hypothesis is clear, with target metric/SLO and success criteria defined.\n- [ ] End-to-end traceability confirmed: `ticket ↔ branch/commits/PR ↔ build ↔ deploy ↔ business event/feature flag`\n\n---\n\n## 2. Technical Quality and Tests\n\n- [ ] **Unit tests** written: fast, deterministic, given–when–then, covering success and error paths.\n- [ ] **Integration/contract tests** written for every boundary (DB, APIs, queues) — OpenAPI/AsyncAPI/CDC updated.\n- [ ] **Regression test** added if this is a bug fix (test that would have caught the bug).\n- [ ] Code is simple, readable, and reviewed. Complexity and hotspots are under control.\n\n---\n\n## 3. Versioning and Backward Compatibility\n\n- [ ] Additive changes kept in the same version. Breaking changes only in a major version with migration path.\n- [ ] OpenAPI/AsyncAPI and changelog updated. Deprecated fields marked with a defined sunset window.\n- [ ] Gateway/routing by version and flags ready for safe transition.\n\n---\n\n## 4. Security and Compliance\n\n- [ ] Security scans completed (SCA / SAST / Secrets) — manually or via CI. Secrets rotated, minimum access principle applied.\n- [ ] Test data is reproducible and free of sensitive PII.\n- [ ] Incident response runbook updated if applicable.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Enablement and CI/CD\n\n- [ ] Local environment runs with a single command and is in parity with CI/staging.\n- [ ] CI pipeline green: build, tests, contracts, security. **No flaky tests allowed.**\n- [ ] Feature flags / Dark Launch / Branch by Abstraction applied when the delivery is phased or incomplete.\n\n---\n\n## 6. Observability and Alerts\n\n- [ ] Metrics, logs, and traces instrumented (golden signals: latency, traffic, errors, saturation).\n- [ ] Dashboards published per domain/version/feature.\n- [ ] Alerts configured: high signal, low noise — triggered by user impact or SLO breach.\n- [ ] Each alert points to a runbook with clear actions and rollback steps.\n\n---\n\n## 7. Performance, Reliability and Risk\n\n- [ ] Functional and performance limits defined. Circuit breakers, rate limiting, and timeouts in place.\n- [ ] Risks mapped and mitigated (Plan A/B, canary/blue-green when applicable).\n- [ ] High-risk items do not go to production without proportional mitigation.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Safe Deploy and Rollback\n\n- [ ] Release strategy defined (canary / blue-green / gradual) — separate from deployment.\n- [ ] Rollback plan tested and reversible. Health checks are reliable.\n\n---\n\n## 9. Documentation and Communication\n\n- [ ] README / operational how-to updated. Decisions recorded (RFC when needed).\n- [ ] Final communication posted in the official channel with summary, links (PR, docs, dashboards) and next steps.\n\n---\n\n## 10. Bug-Specific Criteria (OPON — escalated bugs)\n\n*Apply only to items flagged as OPON (bugs escalated from Online Operations).*\n\n- [ ] Classified and prioritized by impact (SLO / revenue / risk).\n- [ ] Fix deployed to production within **15 calendar days** from triage acceptance.\n- [ ] Post-deploy observability of the case confirmed and lightweight root-cause analysis completed.\n- [ ] SLA violation metric updated.\n\n---\n\n## 11. Post-Deploy and Closure\n\n- [ ] Production verification done: dashboards and alerts show no anomalies.\n- [ ] Telemetry confirms expected outcome (business event fired, metric moved as expected).\n- [ ] Flow is stable: item is not aging in any stage, no avoidable debt left for the next person.\n- [ ] **All criteria above met → Done.**\n\n---\n\n## Quick reference — common failure modes\n\n| Skipped item | Risk |\n|---|---|\n| No unit tests | Regression in next change, harder to refactor |\n| No integration test for DB/API boundary | Silent contract break in production |\n| No feature flag for incomplete feature | Unfinished work exposed to users |\n| No observability | Blind in production, high MTTR |\n| No rollback plan | Cannot recover fast from bad deploy |\n| Breaking change without versioning | Downstream services break silently |\n| Bug closed without regression test | Same bug ships again |\n| OPON bug over 15 days | SLA violation, escalation required |"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T09:34:11.260Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Task Management Agents needing rigorous quality control and compliance verification.","zh":"适用于需要严格质量控制和合规性验证的任务管理代理。","ja":"タスク管理エージェントが厳格な品質管理とコンプライアンスの検証を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"과제 관리 에이전트가 엄격한 품질 관리와 규정 준수 확인을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Gestión de Tareas que necesitan un control de calidad y verificación de cumplimiento riguroso.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Gestion de Tâches nécessitant un contrôle qualité et une vérification de conformité rigoureux.","de":"Perfekt für Task-Management-Agents, die eine strenge Qualitätskontrolle und Compliance-Verifizierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Tarefas que necessitam de controle de qualidade rigoroso e verificação de conformidade.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления задачами, требующих строгого контроля качества и верификации соответствия.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء إدارة المهام الذين يحتاجون إلى مراقبة جودة قوية ومراجعة مطابقة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a strict Definition of Done, ensuring quality, security, and predictability in B2B/B2C deliveries through meticulous checkbox validation and compliance tracking using Kanban simulators.","zh":"赋予代理人执行严格的定义完成标准，确保B2B/B2C交付中的质量、安全性和可预测性，通过使用看板模拟器进行彻底的复选框验证和合规性跟踪。","ja":"エージェントが厳格な完了の定義を実施することを可能にし、B2B/B2Cの納品において、品質、セキュリティ、予測可能性を確保することで、カンバンシミュレーターを使用した入念なチェックボックスの検証とコンプライアンスの追跡を行う。","ko":"에이전트가 엄격한 완료 정의를 강제하여 B2B/B2C 인도에서 품질, 보안 및 예측 가능성을 보장하는 데力を 부여하고, 칸반 시뮬레이터를 사용하여 철저한 체크박스 확인 및 규정 준수 추적을 수행합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar una estricta Definición de Hecho, garantizando la calidad, la seguridad y la previsibilidad en las entregas B2B/B2C a través de una validación de casillas meticulosa y un seguimiento de cumplimiento utilizando simuladores Kanban.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une définition stricte de Terminé, garantissant la qualité, la sécurité et la prévisibilité dans les livraisons B2B/B2C grâce à une validation de cases à cocher méticuleuse et un suivi de conformité en utilisant des simulateurs Kanban.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine strenge Definition von Fertig zu erzwingen, und gewährleistet so Qualität, Sicherheit und Vorhersehbarkeit in B2B/B2C-Lieferungen durch eine sorgfältige Checkbox-Validierung und Compliance-Verfolgung unter Verwendung von Kanban-Simulatoren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor uma definição estrita de Conclusão, garantindo qualidade, segurança e previsibilidade nas entregas B2B/B2C por meio de validação minuciosa de caixas de seleção e acompanhamento de conformidade usando simuladores Kanban.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью навязать строгое определение готовности, гарантируя качество, безопасность и предсказуемость в поставках B2B/B2C посредством тщательной валидации флажков и отслеживания соответствия с использованием имитаторов Kanban.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض تعريف صارم للانتهاء، مما يضمن الجودة والأمان والتنبؤ بالتسليمات التجارية إلى التجارية والتجارية إلى الاستهلاك من خلال التحقق المeticulous من مربع التحقق وتعقب المطابقة باستخدام محاكي Kanban."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating task completion against predefined criteria","Enforcing quality gates in agile workflows","Identifying and addressing compliance bottlenecks"],"zh":["验证任务完成情况与预定义标准的匹配","在敏捷工作流中强制执行质量门","识别和解决合规性瓶颈"],"ja":["事前定義された基準に対するタスク完了の検証","アジャイルワークフローでの品質ゲートの実施","コンプライアンスのボトルネックの特定と対処"],"ko":["사전 정의된 기준에 대한 과제 완료 확인","敏捷 워크플로에서 품질 게이트 적용","규정 준수 병목 현象 식별 및 해결"],"es":["Validar la finalización de tareas contra criterios predefinidos","Aplicar puertas de calidad en flujos de trabajo ágiles","Identificar y abordar cuellos de botella de cumplimiento"],"fr":["Valider la fin des tâches contre des critères prédéfinis","Appliquer des portes de qualité dans les flux de travail agiles","Identifier et traiter les goulets d''étranglement de conformité"],"de":["Überprüfen des Abschlusses von Aufgaben gegen vordefinierte Kriterien","Durchsetzen von Qualitätsprüfungen in agilen Workflows","Identifizieren und Ansprechen von Compliance-Engpässen"],"pt":["Validar a conclusão da tarefa contra critérios predefinidos","Impor portas de qualidade em fluxos de trabalho ágeis","Identificar e abordar gargalos de conformidade"],"ru":["Проверка завершения задачи на соответствие предварительно определенным критериям","Внедрение ворот качества в гибких рабочих процессах","Определение и решение проблем с соответствием"],"ar":["التحقق من إكمال المهمة مقابل المعايير المحددة مسبقا","فرض بوابات الجودة في سير العمل المرن","تحديد وإصلاح مشاكل المطابقة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires explicit definition of done criteria","Dependent on agent''s ability to interact with Kanban simulators or similar project management tools"],"zh":["需要明确的完成标准定义","依赖于代理人与看板模拟器或类似项目管理工具交互的能力"],"ja":["完了基準の明確な定義が必要","カンバンシミュレーターまたは同等のプロジェクト管理ツールとのエージェントの相互作用能力に依存"],"ko":["완료 기준의 명확한 정의가 필요","칸반 시뮬레이터 또는 유사한 프로젝트 관리 도구와의 에이전트 상호 작용 능력에 의존"],"es":["Requiere una definición explícita de los criterios de hecho","Depende de la capacidad del agente para interactuar con simuladores Kanban o herramientas de gestión de proyectos similares"],"fr":["Nécessite une définition explicite des critères de Terminé","Dépend de la capacité de l''agent à interagir avec des simulateurs Kanban ou des outils de gestion de projet similaires"],"de":["Benötigt eine explizite Definition der Kriterien für Fertig","Hängt von der Fähigkeit des Agents ab, mit Kanban-Simulatoren oder ähnlichen Projektmanagement-Tools zu interagieren"],"pt":["Exige definição explícita de critérios de conclusão","Depende da capacidade do agente de interagir com simuladores Kanban ou ferramentas de gerenciamento de projetos semelhantes"],"ru":["Требует явного определения критериев готовности","Зависит от способности агента взаимодействовать с имитаторами Kanban или аналогичными инструментами управления проектами"],"ar":["يتطلب تعريفًا صريحًا لمعايير الانتهاء","يعتمد على قدرة الوكيل على التفاعل مع محاكي Kanban أو أدوات إدارة المشاريع المماثلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"5002afec616ac0a08df319d5900f0115f1956ed8ebaabf5a96fc08988e43ffd7","qualityScore":27}');
