o Vue.js para interface do usuário","Suporte a desenvolvimento de aplicações móveis","Otimização para SEO e desempenho"],"ru":["Разработка масштабируемых веб-приложений","Интеграция с фреймворком Laravel","Использование Vue.js для пользовательского интерфейса","Поддержка разработки мобильных приложений","Оптимизация для SEO и производительности"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الويب القابلة للتوسيع","التكامل مع إطار لارافيل","استخدام فيو.جس لواجهة المستخدم","دعم تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة","تحسين الأداء والتحسين لتحسين محركات البحث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Inertia Vue开发模板","Laravel应用开发","AI智能开发工具","Vue.js开发","如何使用Inertia Vue","Inertia Vue与其他开发工具的比较","Inertia Vue安装指南","Inertia Vue开发教程"],"ja":["Inertia Vue開発テンプレート","Laravelアプリ開発","AIエージェント","Vue.js開発","Inertia Vueの使い方","Inertia Vueと他の開発ツールの比較","Inertia Vueのインストールガイド","Inertia Vue開発チュートリアル"],"ko":["Inertia Vue 개발 템플릿","Laravel 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트","Vue.js 개발","Inertia Vue 사용 방법","Inertia Vue와 다른 개발 도구의 비교","Inertia Vue 설치 가이드","Inertia Vue 개발 튜토리얼"],"es":["desarrollo de AI Agent","herramientas de desarrollo de AI Agent","Inertia-Vue","Laravel","Vue","cómo usar Inertia-Vue","qué es Inertia-Vue","Inertia-Vue vs Vue","instalación de Inertia-Vue"],"fr":["développement d''Agent IA","outils de développement d''Agent IA","Inertia-Vue","Laravel","Vue","comment utiliser Inertia-Vue","quoi est Inertia-Vue","Inertia-Vue vs Vue","installation d''Inertia-Vue"],"de":["Entwicklung von KI-Agenten","Entwicklungstools für KI-Agenten","Inertia-Vue","Laravel","Vue","wie man Inertia-Vue verwendet","was ist Inertia-Vue","Inertia-Vue vs Vue","Installation von Inertia-Vue"],"pt":["inertia vue","desenvolvimento laravel","vue js","aplicações web escaláveis","laravel template","como usar inertia vue","inertia vue vs vue js","instalar inertia vue"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","инерция вью","разработка ларавел","vue js","масштабируемые веб-приложения","шаблон ларавел","как использовать инерцию вью","инерция вью vs вью js","установка инерции вью"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","انيرتيا فيو","تطوير لارافيل","فيو.جس","تطبيقات الويب القابلة للتوسيع","قالب لارافيل","كيفية استخدام انيرتيا فيو","انيرتيا فيو مقابل فيو.جس","تثبيت انيرتيا فيو"]}},"owner":"coollabsio","repo":"laravel-template","repoPath":"coollabsio/laravel-template","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.838Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"inertia-vue-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Inertia Vue Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Creating or modifying Vue page components for Inertia\n- Working with forms in Vue (using `<Form>` or `useForm`)\n- Implementing client-side navigation with `<Link>` or `router`\n- Using v2 features: deferred props, prefetching, or polling\n- Building Vue-specific features with the Inertia protocol\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Inertia v2 Vue patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Page Components","body":"# Inertia Vue Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Creating or modifying Vue page components for Inertia\n- Working with forms in Vue (using `<Form>` or `useForm`)\n- Implementing client-side navigation with `<Link>` or `router`\n- Using v2 features: deferred props, prefetching, or polling\n- Building Vue-specific features with the Inertia protocol\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Inertia v2 Vue patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Page Components Location\n\nVue page components should be placed in the `resources/js/pages` directory.\n\n### Page Component Structure\n\nImportant: Vue components must have a single root element.\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Basic Vue Page Component\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\ndefineProps({\n    users: Array\n})\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <div>\n        <h1>Users</h1>\n        <ul>\n            <li v-for=\"user in users\" :key=\"user.id\">\n                {{ user.name }}\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Client-Side Navigation\n\n### Basic Link Component\n\nUse `<Link>` for client-side navigation instead of traditional `<a>` tags:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Inertia Vue Navigation\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { Link } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <div>\n        <Link href=\"/\">Home</Link>\n        <Link href=\"/users\">Users</Link>\n        <Link :href=\"`/users/${user.id}`\">View User</Link>\n    </div>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Link with Method\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Link with POST Method\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { Link } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <Link href=\"/logout\" method=\"post\" as=\"button\">\n        Logout\n    </Link>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Prefetching\n\nPrefetch pages to improve perceived performance:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Prefetch on Hover\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { Link } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <Link href=\"/users\" prefetch>\n        Users\n    </Link>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Programmatic Navigation\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Router Visit\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { router } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n\nfunction handleClick() {\n    router.visit(''/users'')\n}\n\n// Or with options\nfunction createUser() {\n    router.visit(''/users'', {\n        method: ''post'',\n        data: { name: ''John'' },\n        onSuccess: () => console.log(''Done''),\n    })\n}\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <Link href=\"/users\">Users</Link>\n    <Link href=\"/logout\" method=\"post\" as=\"button\">Logout</Link>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Form Handling\n\n### Form Component (Recommended)\n\nThe recommended way to build forms is with the `<Form>` component:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form Component Example\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <Form action=\"/users\" method=\"post\" #default=\"{ errors, processing, wasSuccessful }\">\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" />\n        <div v-if=\"errors.name\">{{ errors.name }}</div>\n\n        <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" />\n        <div v-if=\"errors.email\">{{ errors.email }}</div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"processing\">\n            {{ processing ? ''Creating...'' : ''Create User'' }}\n        </button>\n\n        <div v-if=\"wasSuccessful\">User created!</div>\n    </Form>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Form Component With All Props\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form Component Full Example\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <Form\n        action=\"/users\"\n        method=\"post\"\n        #default=\"{\n            errors,\n            hasErrors,\n            processing,\n            progress,\n            wasSuccessful,\n            recentlySuccessful,\n            setError,\n            clearErrors,\n            resetAndClearErrors,\n            defaults,\n            isDirty,\n            reset,\n            submit\n        }\"\n    >\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" :value=\"defaults.name\" />\n        <div v-if=\"errors.name\">{{ errors.name }}</div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"processing\">\n            {{ processing ? ''Saving...'' : ''Save'' }}\n        </button>\n\n        <progress v-if=\"progress\" :value=\"progress.percentage\" max=\"100\">\n            {{ progress.percentage }}%\n        </progress>\n\n        <div v-if=\"wasSuccessful\">Saved!</div>\n    </Form>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Form Component Reset Props\n\nThe `<Form>` component supports automatic resetting:\n\n- `resetOnError` - Reset form data when the request fails\n- `resetOnSuccess` - Reset form data when the request succeeds\n- `setDefaultsOnSuccess` - Update default values on success\n\nUse the `search-docs` tool with a query of `form component resetting` for detailed guidance.\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Form with Reset Props\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { Form } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <Form\n        action=\"/users\"\n        method=\"post\"\n        reset-on-success\n        set-defaults-on-success\n        #default=\"{ errors, processing, wasSuccessful }\"\n    >\n        <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" />\n        <div v-if=\"errors.name\">{{ errors.name }}</div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"processing\">\n            Submit\n        </button>\n    </Form>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\nForms can also be built using the `useForm` composable for more programmatic control. Use the `search-docs` tool with a query of `useForm helper` for guidance.\n\n### `useForm` Composable\n\nFor more programmatic control or to follow existing conventions, use the `useForm` composable:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"useForm Composable Example\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { useForm } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n\nconst form = useForm({\n    name: '''',\n    email: '''',\n    password: '''',\n})\n\nfunction submit() {\n    form.post(''/users'', {\n        onSuccess: () => form.reset(''password''),\n    })\n}\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <form @submit.prevent=\"submit\">\n        <input type=\"text\" v-model=\"form.name\" />\n        <div v-if=\"form.errors.name\">{{ form.errors.name }}</div>\n\n        <input type=\"email\" v-model=\"form.email\" />\n        <div v-if=\"form.errors.email\">{{ form.errors.email }}</div>\n\n        <input type=\"password\" v-model=\"form.password\" />\n        <div v-if=\"form.errors.password\">{{ form.errors.password }}</div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" :disabled=\"form.processing\">\n            Create User\n        </button>\n    </form>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Inertia v2 Features\n\n### Deferred Props\n\nUse deferred props to load data after initial page render:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Deferred Props with Empty State\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\ndefineProps({\n    users: Array\n})\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <div>\n        <h1>Users</h1>\n        <div v-if=\"!users\" class=\"animate-pulse\">\n            <div class=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-3/4 mb-2\"></div>\n            <div class=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded w-1/2\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <ul v-else>\n            <li v-for=\"user in users\" :key=\"user.id\">\n                {{ user.name }}\n            </li>\n        </ul>\n    </div>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Polling\n\nAutomatically refresh data at intervals:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Polling Example\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { router } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\nimport { onMounted, onUnmounted } from ''vue''\n\ndefineProps({\n    stats: Object\n})\n\nlet interval\n\nonMounted(() => {\n    interval = setInterval(() => {\n        router.reload({ only: [''stats''] })\n    }, 5000) // Poll every 5 seconds\n})\n\nonUnmounted(() => {\n    clearInterval(interval)\n})\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <div>\n        <h1>Dashboard</h1>\n        <div>Active Users: {{ stats.activeUsers }}</div>\n    </div>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### WhenVisible (Infinite Scroll)\n\nLoad more data when user scrolls to a specific element:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Infinite Scroll with WhenVisible\" lang=\"vue\">\n\n<script setup>\nimport { WhenVisible } from ''@inertiajs/vue3''\n\ndefineProps({\n    users: Object\n})\n</script>\n\n<template>\n    <div>\n        <div v-for=\"user in users.data\" :key=\"user.id\">\n            {{ user.name }}\n        </div>\n\n        <WhenVisible\n            v-if=\"users.next_page_url\"\n            data=\"users\"\n            :params=\"{ page: users.current_page + 1 }\"\n        >\n            <template #fallback>\n                <div>Loading more...</div>\n            </template>\n        </WhenVisible>\n    </div>\n</template>\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Server-Side Patterns\n\nServer-side patterns (Inertia::render, props, middleware) are covered in inertia-laravel guidelines.\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using traditional `<a>` links instead of Inertia''s `<Link>` component (breaks SPA behavior)\n- Forgetting that Vue components must have a single root element\n- Forgetting to add loading states (skeleton screens) when using deferred props\n- Not handling the `undefined` state of deferred props before data loads\n- Using `<form>` without preventing default submission (use `<Form>` component or `@submit.prevent`)\n- Forgetting to check if `<Form>` component is available in your Inertia version"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:46:20.195Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing seamless integration of Vue page components with Inertia protocol","zh":"非常适合需要将 Vue 页面组件与 Inertia 协议无缝集成的全栈 Agent","ja":"Vue ページコンポーネントと Inertia プロトコルのシームレスな統合を必要とするフルスタック Agent に最適です","ko":"Vue 페이지 컴포넌트와 Inertia 프로토콜의 원활한 통합이 필요한 풀스택 Agent에게 완벽합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full Stack que necesitan una integración sin problemas de componentes de página Vue con el protocolo Inertia","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin d''une intégration transparente de composants de page Vue avec le protocole Inertia","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agenten, die eine nahtlose Integration von Vue-Seitenkomponenten mit dem Inertia-Protokoll benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de integração perfeita de componentes de página Vue com o protocolo Inertia","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full Stack, которым требуется бесшовная интеграция компонентов страниц Vue с протоколом Inertia","ar":"مثالي لعميل الويب الكامل الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج مثالي لمكونات صفحة Vue مع بروتوكول Inertia"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build robust client-side navigation with Inertia''s `<Link>` or `router`, and leverage v2 features like deferred props, prefetching, or polling, all while utilizing Vue-specific features and the Inertia protocol for efficient data management","zh":"使 Agent 能够使用 Inertia 的 `<Link>` 或 `router` 构建强大的客户端导航，并利用 v2 功能（如延迟属性、预取或轮询），同时利用 Vue 特有功能和 Inertia 协议进行高效的数据管理","ja":"Agent が Inertia の `<Link>` または `router` を使用して堅牢なクライアントサイドナビゲーションを構築し、遅延プロパティ、プリフェッチ、ポーリングなどの v2 機能を活用することを可能にします。さらに、Vue 固有の機能と Inertia プロトコルを利用した効率的なデータ管理も同時に行えます","ko":"Agent가 Inertia의 `<Link>` 또는 `router`를 사용하여 강력한 클라이언트 측 네비게이션을 구축하고, 지연된 props, 프리페치 또는 폴링과 같은 v2 기능을 활용할 수 있도록 지원합니다. 또한 Vue 특정 기능과 Inertia 프로토콜을 사용하여 효율적인 데이터 관리를 수행할 수 있습니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear una navegación del lado del cliente robusta con `<Link>` o `router` de Inertia, y aprovechar características de v2 como propiedades diferidas, precarga o sondeo, todo mientras se utilizan características específicas de Vue y el protocolo Inertia para una gestión de datos eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer une navigation côté client robuste avec `<Link>` ou `router` d''Inertia, et de tirer parti des fonctionnalités de v2 comme les propriétés différées, le préchargement ou l''interrogation, le tout en utilisant des fonctionnalités spécifiques à Vue et le protocole Inertia pour une gestion de données efficace","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine robuste Client-seitige Navigation mit Inertia''s `<Link>` oder `router` zu erstellen und v2-Features wie verschobene Eigenschaften, Vorabladung oder Abfragen zu nutzen, während sie Vue-spezifische Funktionen und das Inertia-Protokoll für eine effiziente Datenverwaltung verwenden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir navegação de lado do cliente robusta com o `<Link>` ou `router` do Inertia, e aproveitar recursos do v2 como props adiadas, pré-busca ou polling, tudo isso enquanto utiliza recursos específicos do Vue e o protocolo Inertia para gerenciamento de dados eficiente","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать прочную навигацию на стороне клиента с помощью `<Link>` или `router` Inertia, и использовать функции v2, такие как отложенные свойства, предварительная загрузка или опрос, все это при использовании функций, специфичных для Vue, и протокола Inertia для эффективного управления данными","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من بناء导航 côté العميل قوي مع `<Link>` أو `router` من Inertia، واستخدام ميزات v2 مثل الخصائص المؤجلة، والبحث المسبق أو التصويت، وكل ذلك مع استخدام ميزات محددة ل Vue وبروتوكول Inertia للإدارة الفعالة للبيانات"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating or modifying Vue page components for Inertia","Implementing client-side navigation with `<Link>` or `router`","Building Vue-specific features with the Inertia protocol and utilizing v2 features","Working with forms in Vue using `<Form>` or `useForm`"],"zh":["为 Inertia 创建或修改 Vue 页面组件","使用 `<Link>` 或 `router` 实现客户端导航","利用 Inertia 协议和 v2 功能构建 Vue 特有功能","在 Vue 中使用 `<Form>` 或 `useForm` 处理表单"],"ja":["Inertia 用の Vue ページコンポーネントの作成または変更","`<Link>` または `router` を使用したクライアントサイドナビゲーションの実装","Inertia プロトコルと v2 機能を利用した Vue 固有機能の構築","`<Form>` または `useForm` を使用した Vue でのフォーム操作"],"ko":["Inertia용 Vue 페이지 컴포넌트 생성 또는 수정","`<Link>` 또는 `router`를 사용한 클라이언트 측 네비게이션 구현","Inertia 프로토콜과 v2 기능을 활용한 Vue 특정 기능 구축","`<Form>` 또는 `useForm`을 사용하여 Vue에서 폼 작업하기"],"es":["Crear o modificar componentes de página Vue para Inertia","Implementar la navegación del lado del cliente con `<Link>` o `router`","Construir características específicas de Vue con el protocolo Inertia y utilizar características de v2","Trabajar con formularios en Vue utilizando `<Form>` o `useForm`"],"fr":["Créer ou modifier des composants de page Vue pour Inertia","Mettre en œuvre la navigation côté client avec `<Link>` ou `router`","Construire des fonctionnalités spécifiques à Vue avec le protocole Inertia et utiliser des fonctionnalités de v2","Travailler avec des formulaires dans Vue en utilisant `<Form>` ou `useForm`"],"de":["Erstellen oder Modifizieren von Vue-Seitenkomponenten für Inertia","Implementieren der Client-seitigen Navigation mit `<Link>` oder `router`","Erstellen von Vue-spezifischen Funktionen mit dem Inertia-Protokoll und Nutzen von v2-Features","Arbeiten mit Formularen in Vue mit `<Form>` oder `useForm`"],"pt":["Criar ou modificar componentes de página Vue para Inertia","Implementar navegação de lado do cliente com `<Link>` ou `router`","Construir recursos específicos do Vue com o protocolo Inertia e utilizar recursos do v2","Trabalhar com formulários no Vue usando `<Form>` ou `useForm`"],"ru":["Создание или изменение компонентов страницы Vue для Inertia","Реализация навигации на стороне клиента с помощью `<Link>` или `router`","Построение функций, специфичных для Vue, с протоколом Inertia и использование функций v2","Работа с формами в Vue с помощью `<Form>` или `useForm`"],"ar":["إنشاء أو تعديل مكونات صفحة Vue لبروتوكول Inertia","تنفيذ التوجيه على جانب العميل باستخدام `<Link>` أو `router`","بناء ميزات محددة ل Vue مع بروتوكول Inertia واستخدام ميزات v2","العمل مع النماذج في Vue باستخدام `<Form>` أو `useForm`"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Inertia v2 and Vue setup","Limited to Vue page components and Inertia protocol"],"zh":["需要 Inertia v2 和 Vue 设置","仅限于 Vue 页面组件和 Inertia 协议"],"ja":["Inertia v2 と Vue の設定が必要","Vue ページコンポーネントと Inertia プロトコルに限定される"],"ko":["Inertia v2 및 Vue 설정 필요","Vue 페이지 컴포넌트 및 Inertia 프로토콜로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere Inertia v2 y configuración de Vue","Limitado a componentes de página Vue y protocolo Inertia"],"fr":["Nécessite Inertia v2 et configuration de Vue","Limité aux composants de page Vue et protocole Inertia"],"de":["Erfordert Inertia v2 und Vue-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf Vue-Seitenkomponenten und Inertia-Protokoll"],"pt":["Requer Inertia v2 e configuração do Vue","Limitado a componentes de página Vue e protocolo Inertia"],"ru":["Требуется Inertia v2 и настройка Vue","Ограничен компонентами страницы Vue и протоколом Inertia"],"ar":["يتطلب Inertia v2 وضبط Vue","محدود بمكونات صفحة Vue وبروتوكول Inertia"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"78cee50a9b19af2cf597253231710b7e3fe1f43403455f968b1324e268655314","qualityScore":27}');
