기화 서비스","심플한 읽기 경험"],"es":["Diseño minimalista con Bulma","Construido con Laravel y VueJs","Lectura y sincronización de feeds web","Compatibilidad con feeds RSS","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva"],"fr":["Conception minimaliste avec Bulma","Basé sur Laravel et VueJs","Lecture et synchronisation de flux web","Compatibilité avec les flux RSS","Interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Minimalistisches Design mit Bulma","Entwickelt mit Laravel und VueJs","Lesen und Synchronisieren von Web-Feeds","Kompatibilität mit RSS-Feeds","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento com Laravel","Interface do usuário com VueJs","Recursos de sincronização","Leitor de feed web minimalista","Compatibilidade com Bulma"],"ru":["Разработка на Laravel","Интерфейс пользователя на VueJs","Функции синхронизации","Минималистичный веб-ридер ленты","Совместимость с Bulma"],"ar":["التطوير مع Laravel","واجهة المستخدم مع VueJs","ميزات التزامن","قارئ ويب إعلامي منخفض","التوافق مع Bulma"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","Livewire开发","Laravel","VueJs","自托管网页订阅阅读器","同步服务","Bulma","Minimal","如何使用Livewire开发","Livewire开发教程"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Livewire開発","Laravel","VueJs","セルフホスト型Webフィードリーダー","同期サービス","Bulma","Minimal","Livewire開発の使い方","Livewire開発チュートリアル"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Livewire 개발","Laravel","VueJs","셀프 호스팅 웹 피드 리더","동기화 서비스","Bulma","Minimal","Livewire 개발 사용법","Livewire 개발 튜토리얼"],"es":["desarrollo de livewire","herramienta de lectura de feed web","laravel y vuejs","rss reader","como usar livewire","alternativas a livewire","instalación de livewire"],"fr":["développement livewire","outils de lecture de flux web","laravel et vuejs","lecteur de flux rss","comment utiliser livewire","alternatives à livewire","installation de livewire"],"de":["livewire-entwicklung","web-feed-reader","laravel und vuejs","rss-reader","wie man livewire verwendet","alternativen zu livewire","installation von livewire"],"pt":["como usar livewire","o que é livewire","alternativas para livewire","livewire vs outros leitores de feed","instalar livewire","guia de configuração do livewire","desenvolvimento de aplicativos web com livewire","livewire e laravel","livewire e vuejs"],"ru":["как использовать livewire","что такое livewire","альтернативы для livewire","livewire vs другие читатели ленты","установить livewire","руководство по настройке livewire","разработка веб-приложений с livewire","livewire и laravel","livewire и vuejs"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام livewire","ما هو livewire","بديلات ل livewire","livewire مقابل قراء أخرى","تثبيت livewire","دليل إعداد livewire","تطوير تطبيقات الويب مع livewire","livewire و laravel","livewire و vuejs"]}},"owner":"aboustayyef","repo":"InfraRead","repoPath":"aboustayyef/InfraRead","stars":52,"forks":6,"updatedAt":"2026-02-17T11:16:52Z","topics":["bulma","laravel","minimal","rss-reader","unread","vuejs","webapp"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"livewire-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Livewire Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new Livewire components\n- Modifying existing component state or behavior\n- Debugging reactivity or lifecycle issues\n- Writing Livewire component tests\n- Adding Alpine.js interactivity to components\n- Working with wire: directives\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Livewire 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Components\n\nUse the `php artisan make:livewire [Posts\\CreatePost]` Artis","body":"# Livewire Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n- Creating new Livewire components\n- Modifying existing component state or behavior\n- Debugging reactivity or lifecycle issues\n- Writing Livewire component tests\n- Adding Alpine.js interactivity to components\n- Working with wire: directives\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Livewire 3 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n### Creating Components\n\nUse the `php artisan make:livewire [Posts\\CreatePost]` Artisan command to create new components.\n\n### Fundamental Concepts\n\n- State should live on the server, with the UI reflecting it.\n- All Livewire requests hit the Laravel backend; they''re like regular HTTP requests. Always validate form data and run authorization checks in Livewire actions.\n\n## Livewire 3 Specifics\n\n### Key Changes From Livewire 2\n\nThese things changed in Livewire 3, but may not have been updated in this application. Verify this application''s setup to ensure you follow existing conventions.\n- Use `wire:model.live` for real-time updates, `wire:model` is now deferred by default.\n- Components now use the `App\\Livewire` namespace (not `App\\Http\\Livewire`).\n- Use `$this->dispatch()` to dispatch events (not `emit` or `dispatchBrowserEvent`).\n- Use the `components.layouts.app` view as the typical layout path (not `layouts.app`).\n\n### New Directives\n\n- `wire:show`, `wire:transition`, `wire:cloak`, `wire:offline`, `wire:target` are available for use.\n\n### Alpine Integration\n\n- Alpine is now included with Livewire; don''t manually include Alpine.js.\n- Plugins included with Alpine: persist, intersect, collapse, and focus.\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### Component Structure\n\n- Livewire components require a single root element.\n- Use `wire:loading` and `wire:dirty` for delightful loading states.\n\n### Using Keys in Loops\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Wire Key in Loops\" lang=\"blade\">\n\n@foreach ($items as $item)\n    <div wire:key=\"item-{{ $item->id }}\">\n        {{ $item->name }}\n    </div>\n@endforeach\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Lifecycle Hooks\n\nPrefer lifecycle hooks like `mount()`, `updatedFoo()` for initialization and reactive side effects:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Lifecycle Hook Examples\" lang=\"php\">\n\npublic function mount(User $user) { $this->user = $user; }\npublic function updatedSearch() { $this->resetPage(); }\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## JavaScript Hooks\n\nYou can listen for `livewire:init` to hook into Livewire initialization:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Livewire Init Hook Example\" lang=\"js\">\n\ndocument.addEventListener(''livewire:init'', function () {\n    Livewire.hook(''request'', ({ fail }) => {\n        if (fail && fail.status === 419) {\n            alert(''Your session expired'');\n        }\n    });\n\n    Livewire.hook(''message.failed'', (message, component) => {\n        console.error(message);\n    });\n});\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Testing\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Example Livewire Component Test\" lang=\"php\">\n\nLivewire::test(Counter::class)\n    ->assertSet(''count'', 0)\n    ->call(''increment'')\n    ->assertSet(''count'', 1)\n    ->assertSee(1)\n    ->assertStatus(200);\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Testing Livewire Component Exists on Page\" lang=\"php\">\n\n$this->get(''/posts/create'')\n    ->assertSeeLivewire(CreatePost::class);\n\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Forgetting `wire:key` in loops causes unexpected behavior when items change\n- Using `wire:model` expecting real-time updates (use `wire:model.live` instead in v3)\n- Not validating/authorizing in Livewire actions (treat them like HTTP requests)\n- Including Alpine.js separately when it''s already bundled with Livewire 3"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-28T12:48:05.122Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full-Stack Agents needing advanced Laravel and VueJs development capabilities for building dynamic web applications","zh":"适合需要高级Laravel和VueJs开发能力的全栈代理，用于构建动态Web应用程序","ja":"LaravelとVueJsの高度な開発機能を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに適しています。動的なWebアプリケーションを構築するために","ko":"고급 Laravel 및 VueJs 개발 기능이 필요한 풀스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 동적 웹 애플리케이션을 구축하는 데 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Full-Stack que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo avanzadas de Laravel y VueJs para construir aplicaciones web dinámicas","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full-Stack nécessitant des capacités de développement avancées Laravel et VueJs pour la création d''applications web dynamiques","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die erweiterte Laravel- und VueJs-Entwicklungsfähigkeiten für den Bau dynamischer Webanwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full-Stack que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento Laravel e VueJs para construir aplicações web dinâmicas","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Full-Stack, которым необходимы расширенные возможности разработки Laravel и VueJs для создания динамических веб-приложений","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء كامل الحزمة الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات متقدمة في تطوير Laravel و VueJs لبناء تطبيقات الويب الديناميكية"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create and manage Livewire components, leveraging Laravel and VueJs for robust and interactive web feed readers and sync services, utilizing wire: directives and Alpine.js interactivity","zh":"赋予代理创建和管理Livewire组件的能力，利用Laravel和VueJs构建强大且交互的Web feed读取器和同步服务，使用wire：指令和Alpine.js交互","ja":"エージェントがLivewireコンポーネントを作成して管理できるようにし、LaravelとVueJsを使用して強力でインタラクティブなWebフィードリーダーと同期サービスを構築します。wire：ディレクティブとAlpine.jsのインタラクティビティを利用","ko":"에이전트가 Livewire 컴포넌트를 생성하고 관리할 수 있도록 하며, Laravel 및 VueJs를 사용하여 강력하고 상호 작용하는 웹 피드 리더 및 동기화 서비스를 구축합니다. wire：지시문 및 Alpine.js 상호 작용을 사용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear y gestionar componentes de Livewire, aprovechando Laravel y VueJs para lectores de feeds web robustos e interactivos y servicios de sincronización, utilizando directivas wire: y la interactividad de Alpine.js","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer et de gérer des composants Livewire, en exploitant Laravel et VueJs pour des lecteurs de flux Web robustes et interactifs et des services de synchronisation, en utilisant des directives wire: et l''interactivité d''Alpine.js","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Livewire-Komponenten zu erstellen und zu verwalten, indem Laravel und VueJs für robuste und interaktive Web-Feed-Reader und Synchronisierungsdienste genutzt werden, unter Verwendung von wire:-Direktiven und Alpine.js-Interaktivität","pt":"Permite que os agentes criem e gerenciem componentes Livewire, aproveitando Laravel e VueJs para leitores de feed de web robustos e interativos e serviços de sincronização, utilizando diretrizes wire: e interatividade Alpine.js","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать и управлять компонентами Livewire, используя Laravel и VueJs для создания прочных и интерактивных веб-каналов и синхронизационных сервисов, используя директивы wire: и интерактивность Alpine.js","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من إنشاء وإدارة مكونات Livewire، مستفيدة من Laravel و VueJs لإنشاء قراء تلقيم الويب القوية والتفاعلية وخدمات التزامن، باستخدام توجيهات wire: والتفاعل Alpine.js"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating new Livewire components with php artisan make:livewire","Debugging reactivity or lifecycle issues in existing components","Writing comprehensive Livewire component tests","Adding Alpine.js interactivity to enhance component functionality","Working with wire: directives for seamless data synchronization"],"zh":["使用php artisan make：livewire创建新的Livewire组件","调试现有组件中的响应性或生命周期问题","编写Livewire组件的综合测试","将Alpine.js交互添加到增强组件功能","使用wire：指令实现无缝数据同步"],"ja":["php artisan make：livewireを使用して新しいLivewireコンポーネントを作成する","既存のコンポーネントの反応性またはライフサイクルの問題をデバッグする","Livewireコンポーネントの包括的なテストを書く","コンポーネントの機能を強化するためにAlpine.jsのインタラクティビティを追加する","wire：ディレクティブを使用してシームレスなデータ同期を実現する"],"ko":["php artisan make：livewire를 사용하여 새로운 Livewire 컴포넌트를 생성","기존 컴포넌트의 반응성 또는 생애주기 문제를 디버깅","Livewire 컴포넌트의 포괄적인 테스트를 작성","컴포넌트의 기능을 강화하기 위해 Alpine.js 상호 작용을 추가","wire：지시문을 사용하여 무중단 데이터 동기화를 구현"],"es":["Crear nuevos componentes de Livewire con php artisan make:livewire","Depurar problemas de reactividad o ciclo de vida en componentes existentes","Escribir pruebas de componentes de Livewire exhaustivas","Agregar interactividad de Alpine.js para mejorar la funcionalidad del componente","Trabajar con directivas wire: para una sincronización de datos sin problemas"],"fr":["Créer de nouveaux composants Livewire avec php artisan make:livewire","Déboguer les problèmes de réactivité ou de cycle de vie dans les composants existants","Rédiger des tests de composants Livewire complets","Ajouter