tum vs autres agents IA","installation de Textum","guide de configuration de Textum","développement de logiciels avec Textum","outils d''agent IA pour développeurs"],"de":["wie man Textum verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","Textum Alternative","Textum vs andere KI-Agents","Installation von Textum","Konfigurationsanleitung für Textum","Softwareentwicklung mit Textum","KI-Agent-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento de software","fluxo de trabalho","controle de processo","textum alternative","textum vs competitors","how to use textum","textum install","textum setup guide"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","разработка программного обеспечения","рабочий процесс","контроль процесса","textum альтернатива","textum vs конкуренты","как использовать textum","textum установка","textum руководство по настройке"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير البرمجيات","عملية العمل","مراقبة العملية","بديل textum","textum مقابل المنافسين","كيفية استخدام textum","تثبيت textum","دليل إعداد textum"]}},"owner":"snakeying","repo":"Textum","repoPath":"snakeying/Textum","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.680Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"textum","description":"Textum PRD→Scaffold→Story workflow for Codex with low-noise outputs and gate checks.","bodyPreview":"# Textum\n\nHard constraints:\n- Low-noise is non-negotiable (avoid attention/context pollution).\n- Multi-window: each stage is self-contained; do not narrate upstream/downstream flow.\n- Output “next step” as a stage name only.\n\nPrereq (runtime):\n- `uv` installed.\n- Run `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts` once (creates `.claude/skills/textum/scripts/.venv`).\n\nSupported stages:\n- PRD Plan → `references/prd-plan.md`\n- PRD Check → `references/prd-check.md`\n- PRD Render → `references/prd-","body":"# Textum\n\nHard constraints:\n- Low-noise is non-negotiable (avoid attention/context pollution).\n- Multi-window: each stage is self-contained; do not narrate upstream/downstream flow.\n- Output “next step” as a stage name only.\n\nPrereq (runtime):\n- `uv` installed.\n- Run `uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts` once (creates `.claude/skills/textum/scripts/.venv`).\n\nSupported stages:\n- PRD Plan → `references/prd-plan.md`\n- PRD Check → `references/prd-check.md`\n- PRD Render → `references/prd-render.md`\n- PRD Slice → `references/prd-slice.md`\n- Scaffold Plan → `references/scaffold-plan.md`\n- Scaffold Render → `references/scaffold.md`\n- Scaffold Check → `references/scaffold-check.md`\n- Split Plan → `references/split-plan.md`\n- Split Generate → `references/split.md`\n- Split Check1 → `references/split-check1.md`\n- Split Check2 → `references/split-check2.md`\n- Split Checkout → `references/split-checkout.md`\n- Story Check → `references/story-check.md`\n- Story Pack → `references/story-pack.md`\n- Story Exec → `references/story.md`\n- Story Full Exec (experimental) → `references/story-full-exec.md`\n\nRouting:\n- CN intent examples:\n  - `PRD Plan`: 需求澄清 / 澄清需求 / PRD 计划\n  - `PRD Render`: 生成PRD / 渲染PRD / 输出PRD\n  - `PRD Check`: 校验PRD / 检查PRD / 门禁\n  - `PRD Slice`: PRD 切片 / 切片 / 低噪切片 / slice\n  - `Scaffold Plan`: 上下文提取 / 全局上下文 / Scaffold 计划\n  - `Scaffold Render`: 生成GLOBAL-CONTEXT / 渲染GLOBAL-CONTEXT / 输出GLOBAL-CONTEXT\n  - `Scaffold Check`: 校验GLOBAL-CONTEXT / 检查GLOBAL-CONTEXT / GC 门禁\n  - `Split Plan`: Story 拆分规划 / Split Plan / 拆分计划\n  - `Split Generate`: 生成Story / Split Generate / 拆分生成\n  - `Split Check1`: Split 校验1 / 拆分校验1 / 结构阈值校验\n  - `Split Check2`: Split 校验2 / 拆分校验2 / 引用一致性校验\n  - `Split Checkout`: Split Checkout / 依赖图 / 导出依赖图\n  - `Story Check`: Story 校验 / Story Check / 单 Story 门禁\n  - `Story Pack`: Story 执行包生成 / Story Pack / 生成执行包\n  - `Story Exec`: Story 执行 / Story Exec / 单 Story 执行\n  - `Story Full Exec`: Story 批量执行 / Story Full Exec / 试验性全执行\n- If intent is unclear, ask the user to pick one: `PRD Plan` / `PRD Check` / `PRD Render` / `PRD Slice` / `Scaffold Plan` / `Scaffold Render` / `Scaffold Check` / `Split Plan` / `Split Generate` / `Split Check1` / `Split Check2` / `Split Checkout` / `Story Check` / `Story Pack` / `Story Exec` / `Story Full Exec`.\n\nAlways:\n- For every `FAIL` item (in diagnostics/replan packs): include `loc/problem/expected/impact/fix`, and `fix` must be a single action.\n- Keep chat output low-noise: prefer paths (`wrote: docs/*`) over pasting long `FAIL` lists.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:31.990Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced controllable content analysis capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级可控内容分析能力的Python分析代理。","ja":"Python分析エージェントが高度な制御可能なコンテンツ分析機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 제어 가능한 콘텐츠 분석 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de análisis de contenido avanzadas y controlables.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Analyse Python nécessitant des capacités d''analyse de contenu avancées et contrôlables.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte steuerbare Inhaltsanalysefunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades de análise de conteúdo avançadas e controláveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, требующих расширенных возможностей контролируемого анализа контента.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليلية بايثون التي تحتاج إلىقدرات تحليل المحتوى المتقدمة والقابلة للتحكم."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate deterministic content analysis workflows using low-noise, multi-window stages, and output validation gates, while leveraging libraries like ''uv'' and protocols like ''sync''.","zh":"赋予代理生成确定性内容分析工作流的能力，使用低噪声、多窗口阶段和输出验证门，同时利用像''uv''这样的库和像''sync''这样的协议。","ja":"エージェントが決定論的なコンテンツ分析ワークフローを生成できるようにし、低ノイズのマルチウィンドウステージと出力検証ゲートを使用する，同时利用像''uv''这样的库和像''sync''这样的协议。","ko":"에이전트가 결정론적인 콘텐츠 분석 워크플로를 생성할 수 있도록 하며, 저노イズ 멀티 윈도우 단계와 출력 검증 게이트를 사용하고, ''uv''와 같은 라이브러리 및 ''sync''와 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar flujos de trabajo de análisis de contenido deterministas utilizando etapas de varias ventanas y de bajo ruido, y puertas de validación de salida, aprovechando bibliotecas como ''uv'' y protocolos como ''sync''.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des flux de travail d''analyse de contenu déterministes en utilisant des étapes multi-fenêtres et faible bruit, et des portes de validation de sortie, en exploitant des bibliothèques comme ''uv'' et des protocoles comme ''sync''.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, deterministische Inhaltsanalyse-Workflows zu generieren, die mehrfenstrige, geringgeräuschige Stufen und Ausgabevalidierungstore verwenden, indem Bibliotheken wie ''uv'' und Protokolle wie ''sync'' genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar fluxos de trabalho de análise de conteúdo determinísticos usando estágios de multi-janela de baixo ruído e portas de validação de saída, aproveitando bibliotecas como ''uv'' e protocolos como ''sync''.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать детерминированные рабочие процессы анализа контента, используя многооконные этапы с низким шумом и выходные ворота проверки, используя библиотеки, такие как ''uv'', и протоколы, такие как ''sync''.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من توليد سلاسل عمل تحليل المحتوى القائمة على الحتمية باستخدام مراحل متعددة النوافذ منخفضة الضوضاء وبوابات التحقق من الإخراج، واستخدام المكتبات مثل ''uv'' وبروتوكولات مثل ''sync''."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PRD plan analysis","Generating PRD check reports","Debugging PRD render issues"],"zh":["自动化PRD计划分析","生成PRD检查报告","调试PRD渲染问题"],"ja":["PRD計画分析の自動化","PRDチェックレポートの生成","PRDレンダリングの問題のデバッグ"],"ko":["PRD 계획 분석 자동화","PRD 검사 보고서 생성","PRD 렌더링 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar el análisis de planes PRD","Generar informes de verificación PRD","Depurar problemas de representación PRD"],"fr":["Automatiser l''analyse des plans PRD","Générer des rapports de vérification PRD","Déboguer les problèmes de rendu PRD"],"de":["Automatisieren der Analyse von PRD-Plänen","Generieren von PRD-Prüfberichten","Beheben von PRD-Darstellungsproblemen"],"pt":["Automatizar análise de plano PRD","Gerar relatórios de verificação PRD","Depurar problemas de renderização PRD"],"ru":["Автоматизация анализа плана PRD","Генерация отчетов проверки PRD","Отладка проблем отображения PRD"],"ar":["توفير تحليل خطة PRD","توليد تقارير فحص PRD","تصحيح أخطاء عرض PRD"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ''uv'' installed","Needs ''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts'' once","Only supports specific stages like PRD Plan, PRD Check, and PRD Render"],"zh":["需要安装''uv''","需要运行''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts''一次","仅支持特定的阶段，如PRD计划、PRD检查和PRD渲染"],"ja":["''uv''のインストールが必要","一度''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts''を実行する必要がある","PRD計画、PRDチェック、PRDレンダリングなどの特定のステージのみをサポート"],"ko":["''uv'' 설치 필요","一度 ''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts'' 실행 필요","PRD 계획, PRD 확인, PRD 렌더링 등 특정 단계만 지원"],"es":["Requiere que ''uv'' esté instalado","Necesita ''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts'' una vez","Solo admite etapas específicas como PRD Plan, PRD Check y PRD Render"],"fr":["Nécessite que ''uv'' soit installé","Nécessite ''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts'' une fois","N''aide que des étapes spécifiques comme PRD Plan, PRD Check et PRD Render"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von ''uv''","Benötigt ''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts'' einmal","Unterstützt nur bestimmte Stufen wie PRD-Plan, PRD-Check und PRD-Render"],"pt":["Requer ''uv'' instalado","Necessita ''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts'' uma vez","Apenas suporta estágios específicos como Plano PRD, Verificação PRD e Renderização PRD"],"ru":["Требует установленного ''uv''","Требует ''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts'' один раз","Поддерживает только определенные этапы, такие как план PRD, проверка PRD и отображение PRD"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ''uv''","يحتاج إلى ''uv sync --project .claude/skills/textum/scripts'' مرة واحدة","يدعم فقط مراحل محددة مثل خطة PRD و فحص PRD و عرض PRD"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1e1313ba41f3bfe5c941222554da5c332a5e447d0f6dc6a51cad94cfee2a1d88","qualityScore":26}');
