real","Alertas basadas en escáner","Integración con xAI","Análisis de cuentas y tenencias","Maximización de ganancias"],"fr":["Gestion de portefeuille et d''options","Données de marché en temps réel","Alertes basées sur les scanneurs","Intégration avec xAI","Analyse de comptes et de positions","Augmentation des profits"],"de":["Portfolio- und Optionsmanagement","Echtzeit-Marktdaten","Scannerbasierte Alerts","Integration mit xAI","Analyse von Konten und Positionen","Gewinnmaximierung"],"pt":["Gestão de portfólio e opções","Alertas em tempo real com xAI","Análise de mercado em tempo real","Maximização de lucros com inteligência artificial"],"ru":["Управление портфелем и опционами","Реальные уведомления с помощью xAI","Анализ рынка в реальном времени","Максимизация прибыли с помощью искусственного интеллекта"],"ar":["إدارة المحفظة والخيارات","تنبيهات في الوقت الفعلي مع xAI","تحليل السوق في الوقت الفعلي","تحقيق أقصى قدر من الأرباح مع الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用xAI","什么是CI失败解决","CI失败解决工具","xAI投资管理","智能投资策略","投资管理软件"],"ja":["xAIの使い方","CI失敗解決とは","CI失敗解決ツール","xAI投資管理","スマートな投資戦略","投資管理ソフトウェア"],"ko":["xAI 사용법","CI 실패 해결이란","CI 실패 해결 도구","xAI 투자 관리","스마트한 투자 전략","투자 관리 소프트웨어"],"es":["herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","gestión de carteras","opciones de inversión","xAI","cómo utilizar herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","qué es la Inteligencia Artificial","alternativas a las herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","instalación de herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial","guía de configuración de herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial"],"fr":["outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","gestion de portefeuille","options d''investissement","xAI","comment utiliser les outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","qu''est-ce que l''Intelligence Artificielle","alternatives aux outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","installation des outils d''Intelligence Artificielle","guide de configuration des outils d''Intelligence Artificielle"],"de":["KI-Tools","Portfolio- und Optionsmanagement","Anlageoptionen","xAI","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist KI","Alternativen zu KI-Tools","Installation von KI-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar ci-failure","o que é ci-failure","ferramentas de ia para gestão de portfólio","ci-failure vs outras ferramentas","guias de instalação do ci-failure","configuração do ci-failure"],"ru":["как использовать ci-failure","что такое ci-failure","инструменты ИИ для управления портфелем","ci-failure vs другие инструменты","руководства по установке ci-failure","настройка ci-failure"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام ci-failure","ما هي ci-failure","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لإدارة المحفظة","ci-failure مقابل أدوات أخرى","دلائل تركيب ci-failure","ضبط ci-failure"]}},"owner":"sperezintexas","repo":"fintech-app","repoPath":"sperezintexas/fintech-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.821Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ci-failure","description":"Diagnose GitHub Actions CI failures and suggest fixes. Use when the user reports CI failed, GitHub job failed, Actions failed, build failed on remote, upload artifact failed, or pastes a failure from the Actions tab.","bodyPreview":"# CI Failure Diagnosis\n\nWhen the user reports a **remote GitHub Actions / CI failure** (or pastes a failure from the Actions tab), apply this skill.\n\n## 1. Load Context First\n\nRead these files **immediately** to understand this repo’s CI:\n\n- **Workflow:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (and `.github/workflows/security.yml` if the failure mentions security)\n- **Pipeline summary:** `docs/ci.md`\n\nUse them to map the failure to a job and step and to apply repo-specific fixes.\n\n## 2. Identify Job and Ste","body":"# CI Failure Diagnosis\n\nWhen the user reports a **remote GitHub Actions / CI failure** (or pastes a failure from the Actions tab), apply this skill.\n\n## 1. Load Context First\n\nRead these files **immediately** to understand this repo’s CI:\n\n- **Workflow:** `.github/workflows/ci.yml` (and `.github/workflows/security.yml` if the failure mentions security)\n- **Pipeline summary:** `docs/ci.md`\n\nUse them to map the failure to a job and step and to apply repo-specific fixes.\n\n## 2. Identify Job and Step\n\nFrom the user’s message or pasted log, determine:\n\n- **Job name** (e.g. Lint, Type Check, Test, Build, Docker Build, Notify Slack)\n- **Step name** (e.g. \"Run ESLint\", \"Build application\", \"Upload build artifacts\")\n\nIf the user only pastes an error line (e.g. \"No files were found with the provided path: .next\"), infer the step from the message and the workflow.\n\n## 3. Map to Fix\n\n| Failure / Log | Job | Step | Action |\n|--------------|-----|------|--------|\n| ESLint error, file:line | Lint | Run ESLint | Fix the reported file/line; run `npm run lint` locally. |\n| Type error, tsc | Type Check | Run TypeScript compiler | Fix the type; run `npx tsc --noEmit` locally. |\n| Test failure, vitest | Test | Run tests | Fix test or app code; run `npm test` locally. |\n| Build error, Next.js, OOM | Build | Build application | Check \"Build application\" logs; confirm `NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=4096` in workflow; fix build error or increase memory. |\n| No files .next, upload artifact | Build | Build application / Upload | Build didn’t produce `.next`; check \"Build application\" step logs. Ensure workflow has List build output, \"Fail if build did not produce .next\", and conditional upload (see docs/ci.md). |\n| Docker build failed | Docker Build | Build Docker image | Check Dockerfile and build-args (MONGODB_URI, MONGODB_DB). |\n| Notify Slack / health | Notify Slack | — | Check Secrets (SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL) and Variables (APP_URL); see docs/ci.md and readme. |\n\n## 4. Respond\n\n1. **Say which job and step failed** (and link to workflow if helpful).\n2. **Give a short cause** (e.g. \"Build didn’t produce `.next`\" or \"ESLint error in `src/foo.ts`\").\n3. **Suggest a concrete fix** (workflow change, code change, or env/secret), using `docs/ci.md` and `.github/workflows/ci.yml` as the source of truth.\n4. If the user pasted only one line, **ask for the full job log** for the failing step if you need it to be precise (e.g. \"Paste the full ''Build application'' step log from the Build job\").\n\n## 5. Optional: Cursor Rule\n\nFor more detail on mapping failures and repo-specific CI, see `.cursor/rules/github-ci.mdc` (it aligns with this skill and docs/ci.md).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:39:31.003Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for DevOps and GitHub Actions Agents requiring advanced CI/CD failure diagnosis and troubleshooting capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级CI/CD故障诊断和故障排除功能的DevOps和GitHub Actions代理。","ja":"DevOpsとGitHub Actionsエージェントが高度なCI/CD障害診断とトラブルシューティング機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 CI/CD 故障 진단 및 문제 해결 기능이 필요한 DevOps 및 GitHub Actions 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps y GitHub Actions que requieren capacidades avanzadas de diagnóstico y resolución de problemas en CI/CD.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents DevOps et GitHub Actions nécessitant des capacités avancées de diagnostic et de résolution de problèmes CI/CD.","de":"Ideal für DevOps- und GitHub Actions-Agenten, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Diagnose und Fehlerbehebung von CI/CD-Fehlern benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes DevOps e GitHub Actions que exigem capacidades avançadas de diagnóstico e solução de problemas de falhas de CI/CD.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps и GitHub Actions, требующих расширенных возможностей диагностики и устранения неисправностей при сбоях в CI/CD.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps و GitHub Actions الذين يتطلبون قدرات متقدمة لتشخيص وأصلاح الأعطال في CI/CD."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and resolve remote GitHub Actions CI failures by loading context from .github/workflows/ci.yml and docs/ci.md, mapping failures to specific jobs and steps, and applying repo-specific fixes using xAI.","zh":"赋予代理分析和解决远程GitHub Actions CI故障的能力，方法是从.github/workflows/ci.yml和docs/ci.md加载上下文，将故障映射到特定作业和步骤，并使用xAI应用仓库特定的修复。","ja":"エージェントがリモートのGitHub Actions CI障害を分析および解決する機能を提供します。.github/workflows/ci.ymlとdocs/ci.mdからコンテキストをロードし、障害を特定のジョブとステップにマッピングし、xAIを使用してリポジトリ固有の修正を適用します。","ko":"에이전트가 원격 GitHub Actions CI 실패를 분석 및 해결 할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. .github/workflows/ci.yml 및 docs/ci.md에서 컨텍스트를 로드하고, 실패를 특정 작업 및 단계에 매핑하고, xAI를 사용하여 리포지토리별 수정을 적용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes analizar y resolver fallos remotos de CI de GitHub Actions cargando contexto desde .github/workflows/ci.yml y docs/ci.md, mapeando los fallos a jobs y steps específicos, y aplicando correcciones específicas del repositorio utilizando xAI.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et de résoudre les échecs CI distants de GitHub Actions en chargeant le contexte depuis .github/workflows/ci.yml et docs/ci.md, en mappant les échecs à des jobs et steps spécifiques, et en appliquant des correctifs spécifiques au dépôt en utilisant xAI.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, remote GitHub Actions CI-Fehler zu analysieren und zu beheben, indem Kontext aus .github/workflows/ci.yml und docs/ci.md geladen wird, Fehler bestimmten Jobs und Steps zugeordnet werden und repositoriumspezifische Korrekturen unter Verwendung von xAI angewendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisarem e resolverem falhas de CI remotos do GitHub Actions, carregando o contexto de .github/workflows/ci.yml e docs/ci.md, mapeando falhas para trabalhos e etapas específicas e aplicando soluções específicas do repositório usando xAI.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать и устранять удаленные сбои в GitHub Actions CI, загружая контекст из .github/workflows/ci.yml и docs/ci.md, сопоставляя сбои с конкретными задачами и шагами и применяя исправления, специфичные для репозитория, с помощью xAI.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحليل وإصلاح الأعطال البعيدة في GitHub Actions CI عن طريق تحميل السياق من .github/workflows/ci.yml و docs/ci.md، وربط الأعطال بأعمال وخطوات محددة، وتطبيق إصلاحات محددة للمستودع باستخدام xAI."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging pipeline failures in GitHub Actions workflows","Analyzing CI/CD failures and identifying root causes","Automating the process of loading context and mapping failures to jobs and steps"],"zh":["调试GitHub Actions工作流中的管道故障","分析CI/CD故障并找出根本原因","自动加载上下文和将故障映射到作业和步骤的过程"],"ja":["GitHub Actionsワークフローでのパイプライン障害のデバッグ","CI/CD障害を分析して根本原因を特定する","コンテキストのロードと障害をジョブとステップにマッピングするプロセスの自動化"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 워크플로우에서 파이프라인 오류를 디버깅하는 것","CI/CD 오류를 분석하고 근본 원인을 식별하는 것","컨텍스트 로드 및 오류를 작업 및 단계에 매핑하는 프로세스 자동화"],"es":["Depuración de fallos de pipeline en workflows de GitHub Actions","Análisis de fallos de CI/CD e identificación de causas raíz","Automatización del proceso de carga de contexto y mapeo de fallos a jobs y steps"],"fr":["Débogage des échecs de pipeline dans les workflows GitHub Actions","Analyse des échecs CI/CD et identification des causes racines","Automatisation du processus de chargement du contexte et de mappage des échecs aux jobs et steps"],"de":["Debugging von Pipeline-Fehlern in GitHub Actions-Workflows","Analyse von CI/CD-Fehlern und Identifizierung von Ursachen","Automatisierung des Prozesses zum Laden von Kontext und zum Zuordnen von Fehlern zu Jobs und Steps"],"pt":["Depuração de falhas de pipeline em fluxos de trabalho do GitHub Actions","Análise de falhas de CI/CD e identificação de causas raiz","Automação do processo de carregamento de contexto e mapeamento de falhas para trabalhos e etapas"],"ru":["Отладка сбоев конвейера в рабочих процессах GitHub Actions","Анализ сбоев в CI/CD и выявление коренных причин","Автоматизация процесса загрузки контекста и сопоставления сбоев с задачами и шагами"],"ar":["تصحيح أعطال أنابيب في سير عمل GitHub Actions","تحليل أعطال CI/CD وتحديد الأسباب الجذرية","أتمتة عملية تحميل السياق وربط الأعطال بأعمال وخطوات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to GitHub Actions workflow files (.github/workflows/ci.yml and .github/workflows/security.yml)","Limited to GitHub Actions CI/CD pipelines","Needs docs/ci.md pipeline summary for effective analysis"],"zh":["需要访问GitHub Actions工作流文件（.github/workflows/ci.yml和.github/workflows/security.yml）","仅限GitHub Actions CI/CD管道","需要docs/ci.md管道摘要以进行有效分析"],"ja":["GitHub Actionsワークフローファイル（.github/workflows/ci.ymlと.github/workflows/security.yml）へのアクセスが必要","GitHub Actions CI/CDパイプラインのみ","有効な分析のためにdocs/ci.mdパイプラインの概要が必要"],"ko":["GitHub Actions 워크플로우 파일(.github/workflows/ci.yml 및 .github/workflows/security.yml) 액세스가 필요함","GitHub Actions CI/CD 파이프라인만 해당함","유효한 분석을 위해 docs/ci.md 파이프라인 요약이 필요함"],"es":["Requiere acceso a los archivos de workflow de GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/ci.yml y .github/workflows/security.yml)","Limitado a pipelines de CI/CD de GitHub Actions","Necesita el resumen de pipeline docs/ci.md para un análisis efectivo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de workflow GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/ci.yml et .github/workflows/security.yml)","Limité aux pipelines CI/CD GitHub Actions","Nécessite le résumé de pipeline docs/ci.md pour une analyse efficace"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf GitHub Actions-Workflow-Dateien (.github/workflows/ci.yml und .github/workflows/security.yml)","Beschränkt auf GitHub Actions CI/CD-Pipelines","Benötigt die Pipeline-Zusammenfassung docs/ci.md für eine effektive Analyse"],"pt":["Exige acesso a arquivos de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/ci.yml e .github/workflows/security.yml)","Limitado a pipelines de CI/CD do GitHub Actions","Necessita de resumo de pipeline em docs/ci.md para análise eficaz"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам рабочих процессов GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/ci.yml и .github/workflows/security.yml)","Ограничен для конвейеров CI/CD GitHub Actions","Требует сводки конвейера в docs/ci.md для эффективного анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات سير عمل GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/ci.yml و .github/workflows/security.yml)","محدود لأنابيب CI/CD من GitHub Actions","يحتاج إلى ملخص الأنابيب في docs/ci.md للتحليل الفعال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4f588cf1db21a836e8b60ff91b6e0b90777d2235da223f1371dbbc7e20012f5a","qualityScore":26}');
