,"Narración en tiempo real","Soporte para escritorio","Desarrollo con Python"],"fr":["Intégration avec Gemini Vision","Compatibilité avec VibeVoice-0.5B","Narration en temps réel","Prise en charge du bureau","Développement avec Python"],"de":["Integration mit Gemini Vision","Kompatibilität mit VibeVoice-0.5B","Erzählung in Echtzeit","Unterstützung für Desktop","Entwicklung mit Python"],"pt":["Integração com Gemini Vision","Suporte a VibeVoice-0.5B","Narração de desktop em tempo real","Desenvolvimento de fluxos de trabalho de ML","Melhoria da produtividade"],"ru":["Интеграция с Gemini Vision","Поддержка VibeVoice-0.5B","Реальное время десктоп-наррации","Разработка рабочих процессов ML","Повышение производительности"],"ar":["دمج رؤية Gemini","دعم VibeVoice-0.5B","نَصّ الشاشة في الوقت الحقيقي","تطوير تدفقات العمل من ML","زيادة الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Python 机器学习","AI智能工具","实时桌面朗读","Google Gemini Vision","Microsoft VibeVoice-0.5B","如何使用Python ML Workflow","Python ML Workflow安装","Python ML Workflow设置指南"],"ja":["Python 機械学習","AIエージェント","リアルタイムデスクトップナレーション","Google Gemini Vision","Microsoft VibeVoice-0.5B","Python ML Workflowの使い方","Python ML Workflowのインストール","Python ML Workflowの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Python 머신러닝","AI 에이전트","실시간 데스크톱 낭독","Google Gemini Vision","Microsoft VibeVoice-0.5B","Python ML Workflow 사용법","Python ML Workflow 설치","Python ML Workflow 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar python-ml-workflow","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a python-ml-workflow","python-ml-workflow vs VibeVoice","instalación de python-ml-workflow","guía de configuración de python-ml-workflow","desarrollo de aplicaciones con python-ml-workflow"],"fr":["comment utiliser python-ml-workflow","qu''est-ce qu''un agent IA","alternatives à python-ml-workflow","python-ml-workflow vs VibeVoice","installation de python-ml-workflow","guide de configuration de python-ml-workflow","développement d''applications avec python-ml-workflow"],"de":["wie man python-ml-workflow verwendet","was ist ein KI-Agent","alternativen zu python-ml-workflow","python-ml-workflow vs VibeVoice","installation von python-ml-workflow","konfigurationsanleitung für python-ml-workflow","entwicklung von anwendungen mit python-ml-workflow"],"pt":["como usar python-ml-workflow","o que é python-ml-workflow","alternativa ao python-ml-workflow","python-ml-workflow vs VibeVoice","instalar python-ml-workflow","guia de configuração do python-ml-workflow","desenvolvimento de ML","fluxos de trabalho de ML"],"ru":["как использовать python-ml-workflow","что такое python-ml-workflow","альтернатива python-ml-workflow","python-ml-workflow vs VibeVoice","установить python-ml-workflow","руководство по настройке python-ml-workflow","разработка ML","рабочие процессы ML"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام python-ml-workflow","ما هو python-ml-workflow","بديل python-ml-workflow","python-ml-workflow مقابل VibeVoice","تثبيت python-ml-workflow","دليل إعداد python-ml-workflow","تطوير ML","تدفقات العمل من ML"]}},"owner":"alfred1137","repo":"ScreenBanter","repoPath":"alfred1137/ScreenBanter","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.914Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"python-ml-workflow","description":"Expert guidelines for Python ML and LLM workflows. Covers code quality, experiment tracking, and data handling. Use when working on AI/ML components or data pipelines.","bodyPreview":"# Python ML/LLM Workflow\n\n## Persona\nAct as a Python Master, ML Engineer, and Data Scientist. Prioritize elegance, efficiency, and clarity.\n\n## Technology Stack\n- **Python**: 3.10+\n- **Management**: uv / Poetry / Rye\n- **Formatting**: Ruff\n- **Testing**: pytest\n- **Type Hinting**: Strict `typing` module usage.\n\n## Coding Guidelines\n- **Pythonic**: Adhere to PEP 8 and the Zen of Python.\n- **Explicit**: Favor explicit code over implicit magic.\n- **Documentation**: Google-style docstrings for ALL p","body":"# Python ML/LLM Workflow\n\n## Persona\nAct as a Python Master, ML Engineer, and Data Scientist. Prioritize elegance, efficiency, and clarity.\n\n## Technology Stack\n- **Python**: 3.10+\n- **Management**: uv / Poetry / Rye\n- **Formatting**: Ruff\n- **Testing**: pytest\n- **Type Hinting**: Strict `typing` module usage.\n\n## Coding Guidelines\n- **Pythonic**: Adhere to PEP 8 and the Zen of Python.\n- **Explicit**: Favor explicit code over implicit magic.\n- **Documentation**: Google-style docstrings for ALL public members.\n- **Testing**: Aim for >90% coverage.\n\n## ML/AI Specifics\n- **Reproducibility**: Use `hydra` or `yaml` for configs. Use `dvc` for data pipelines.\n- **Prompt Engineering**: Version control your prompt templates.\n- **Experiment Tracking**: Log parameters and results (MLflow/TensorBoard).\n- **Model Versioning**: Use git-lfs or cloud storage.\n\n## Performance\n- **Async**: Use `async`/`await` for I/O.\n- **Caching**: Use `functools.lru_cache` or similar.\n- **Monitoring**: Watch resource usage (`psutil`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:02:22.852Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced machine learning workflow capabilities with uv, Poetry, and Rye management","zh":"非常适合需要高级机器学习工作流能力的 Python 分析代理，具有 uv、Poetry 和 Rye 管理功能","ja":"Python 分析エージェントが高度な機械学習ワークフロー機能を必要とする場合に最適です。uv、Poetry、Rye 管理機能を備えています","ko":"고급 기계 학습 워크플로우 기능과 uv, Poetry, Rye 관리 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de flujo de trabajo de aprendizaje automático avanzadas con uv, Poetry y gestión de Rye","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python nécessitant des fonctionnalités de workflow d''apprentissage automatique avancées avec uv, Poetry et gestion de Rye","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte maschinelles Lernen-Workflow-Fähigkeiten mit uv, Poetry und Rye-Verwaltung benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades de fluxo de trabalho de aprendizado de máquina avançadas com uv, Poetry e gerenciamento de Rye","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым необходимы расширенные возможности рабочих процессов машинного обучения с uv, Poetry и управлением Rye","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى قدرات متقدمة لعمليات تدفق التعلم الالي مع uv، Poetry، وإدارة Rye"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop and manage elegant Python ML/LLM workflows using strict typing, pytest testing, and Google-style docstrings, while adhering to PEP 8 and the Zen of Python, leveraging uv, Poetry, and Rye for efficient dependency management","zh":"赋予代理开发和管理优雅的 Python 机器学习/大语言模型工作流的能力，使用严格的类型检查、pytest 测试和 Google 风格的文档字符串，同时遵守 PEP 8 和 Python 之禅，利用 uv、Poetry 和 Rye 进行高效的依赖管理","ja":"エージェントに、厳密な型チェック、pytest テスト、Google スタイルのドキュメンテーション文字列を使用して、優雅な Python 機械学習/大規模言語モデルワークフローを開発および管理する機能を付与します。uv、Poetry、Rye を使用して依存関係を効率的に管理することで、PEP 8 と Python の禅に従います","ko":"pytest 테스트 및 Google 스타일의 문서 문자열을 사용하여 엄격한 타입 검사를 사용하여 우아한 Python 기계 학습/대규모 언어 모델 워크플로를 개발하고 관리할 수 있는 기능을 에이전트에게 부여합니다. uv, Poetry, Rye를 사용하여 효율적인 종속성 관리를 수행하며 PEP 8 및 Python의 제자를 따릅니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a desarrollar y gestionar flujos de trabajo de Python ML/LLM elegantes utilizando tipado estricto, pruebas pytest y cadenas de documentación de estilo Google, mientras se adhiere a PEP 8 y la Zen de Python, aprovechando uv, Poetry y Rye para una gestión de dependencias eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer et de gérer des flux de travail Python ML/LLM élégants en utilisant un typage strict, des tests pytest et des chaînes de documentation de style Google, tout en respectant PEP 8 et la Zen de Python, en exploitant uv, Poetry et Rye pour une gestion de dépendances efficace","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, elegante Python-ML/LLM-Workflows mit strenger Typisierung, pytest-Tests und Google-Stil-Dokumentationszeichenfolgen zu entwickeln und zu verwalten, während sie PEP 8 und die Zen von Python einhalten und uv, Poetry und Rye für eine effiziente Abhängigkeitsverwaltung nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver e gerenciar fluxos de trabalho de ML/LLM Python elegantes usando digitação estrita, teste pytest e docstrings no estilo Google, além de aderir ao PEP 8 e ao Zen de Python, aproveitando uv, Poetry e Rye para gerenciamento eficiente de dependências","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать и управлять элегантными рабочими процессами ML/LLM Python, используя строгую типизацию, тестирование pytest и docstrings в стиле Google, при этом соблюдая PEP 8 и Zen Python, используя uv, Poetry и Rye для эффективного управления зависимостями","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطوير وإدارة تدفقات عمل ML/LLM بايثون أنيقة باستخدام الكتابة الصارمة واختبار pytest وسلاسل وثائق في نمط جوجل، مع الالتزام بPEP 8 وZen of Python، واستخدام uv وPoetry وRye لإدارة التبعيات بكفاءة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating ML model testing with pytest","Generating explicit and well-documented Python code","Debugging complex machine learning workflows with uv and Rye"],"zh":["使用 pytest 自动化机器学习模型测试","生成明确且有详细文档的 Python 代码","使用 uv 和 Rye 调试复杂的机器学习工作流"],"ja":["pytest を使用して機械学習モデルのテストを自動化する","明確で十分なドキュメントのある Python コードを生成する","uv と Rye を使用して複雑な機械学習ワークフローをデバッグする"],"ko":["pytest를 사용하여 기계 학습 모델 테스트를 자동화하는 것","명확하고 충분한 문서가 있는 Python 코드를 생성하는 것","uv 및 Rye를 사용하여 복잡한 기계 학습 워크플로를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de modelos de aprendizaje automático con pytest","Generación de código Python explícito y bien documentado","Depuración de flujos de trabajo de aprendizaje automático complejos con uv y Rye"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de modèles d''apprentissage automatique avec pytest","Génération de code Python explicite et bien documenté","Débogage de flux de travail d''apprentissage automatique complexes avec uv et Rye"],"de":["Automatisierung von ML-Modell-Tests mit pytest","Generierung von explizitem und gut dokumentiertem Python-Code","Fehlerbehebung komplexer maschinelles Lernen-Workflows mit uv und Rye"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de modelos ML com pytest","Gerar código Python explícito e bem documentado","Depurar fluxos de trabalho de aprendizado de máquina complexos com uv e Rye"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование моделей ML с помощью pytest","Генерировать явный и хорошо документированный код Python","Отлаживать сложные рабочие процессы машинного обучения с помощью uv и Rye"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار نماذج ML باستخدام pytest","توليد رمز بايثون صريح ومدون جيدًا","تصحيح أخطاء تدفقات عمل التعلم الالي المعقدة مع uv وRye"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python 3.10+","Strict adherence to PEP 8 and the Zen of Python","Limited to Python ML/LLM workflow development"],"zh":["需要 Python 3.10+","严格遵守 PEP 8 和 Python 之禅","仅限于 Python 机器学习/大语言模型工作流开发"],"ja":["Python 3.10+ が必要","PEP 8 と Python の禅に厳密に従う","Python 機械学習/大規模言語モデルワークフローの開発に限定される"],"ko":["Python 3.10+가 필요합니다","PEP 8 및 Python의 제자를 엄격히 따릅니다","Python 기계 학습/대규모 언어 모델 워크플로 개발에만 제한됩니다"],"es":["Requiere Python 3.10+","Adhesión estricta a PEP 8 y la Zen de Python","Limitado al desarrollo de flujos de trabajo de aprendizaje automático de Python ML/LLM"],"fr":["Nécessite Python 3.10+","Conformité stricte à PEP 8 et la Zen de Python","Limité au développement de flux de travail d''apprentissage automatique Python ML/LLM"],"de":["Benötigt Python 3.10+","Strenges Befolgen von PEP 8 und der Zen von Python","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Python-ML/LLM-Workflows"],"pt":["Exige Python 3.10+","Adesão estrita ao PEP 8 e ao Zen de Python","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de fluxos de trabalho de ML/LLM Python"],"ru":["Требует Python 3.10+","Соблюдение PEP 8 и Zen Python","Ограничен разработкой рабочих процессов ML/LLM Python"],"ar":["يتطلب بايثون 3.10+","الالتزام الصارم بPEP 8 وZen of Python","محدود بتطوير تدفقات عمل ML/LLM بايثون"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"04d31bacc40eec3b61fc70668edfbff44fbf533103501a7fe851bf298ba50864","qualityScore":26}');
