eact, Python и Node.js","Интерфейс командной строки (CLI)"],"ar":["مزامنة سكريبتات الوكلاء","العمليات الأساسية","التكامل مع أدوات الإيجاد الذكي","دعم React, Python و Node.js","واجهة سطر الأوامر (CLI)"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","实现计划","Sync Agent 脚本","基本工作流","自动化开发任务","提高开发效率","优化工作流","AI智能体实战","开发工作流自动化"],"ja":["AIエージェント","実装計画","Sync Agent スクリプト","基本ワークフロー","開発タスクの自動化","開発効率の向上","ワークフローの最適化","AIエージェント実践","開発ワークフローの自動化"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","구현 계획","Sync 에이전트 스크립트","기본 워크플로","개발 작업 자동화","개발 효율성 향상","워크플로 최적화","AI 에이전트 실무","개발 워크플로 자동화"],"es":["herramientas de AI","scripts de agentes","flujos de trabajo básicos","cómo usar herramientas de AI","qué es un agente","guía de instalación de herramientas de AI","alternativas a herramientas de AI"],"fr":["outils d''IA","scripts d''agents","flux de travail de base","comment utiliser des outils d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent","guide d''installation des outils d''IA","alternatives aux outils d''IA"],"de":["KI-Tools","Agenten-Skripte","grundlegende Workflows","wie man KI-Tools verwendet","was ist ein Agent","Installationsanleitung für KI-Tools","Alternativen zu KI-Tools"],"pt":["como usar Ferramentas de AI Agents","o que é implement-plan","Ferramentas de AI Agents alternativas","implement-plan vs outros","instalar implement-plan","guia de configuração do implement-plan","desenvolvimento de agentes com implement-plan"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое реализация плана","ИИ Агенты альтернативы","реализация плана vs другие","установить реализацию плана","руководство по настройке реализации плана","разработка агентов с реализацией плана"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الإيجاد الذكي","ما هي تنفيذ الخطة","أدوات الإيجاد الذكي بديلة","تنفيذ الخطة مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت تنفيذ الخطة","دليل إعداد تنفيذ الخطة","تطوير الوكلاء مع تنفيذ الخطة"]}},"owner":"optimistic-updt","repo":"sync-agents","repoPath":"optimistic-updt/sync-agents","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T03:50:23Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement-plan","description":"Implement technical plans from docs/changes/<plan_path>/plan.md with verification","bodyPreview":"# Implement Plan\n\nYou are tasked with implementing an approved technical plan from `docs/changes/<plan_path>/plan.md`. These plans contain phases with specific changes and success criteria.\n\n## Getting Started\n\nWhen given a plan path:\n\n- Read the plan completely and check for any existing checkmarks (- [x])\n- Read the original ticket and all files mentioned in the plan\n- **Read files fully** - never use limit/offset parameters, you need complete context\n- Think deeply about how the pieces fit to","body":"# Implement Plan\n\nYou are tasked with implementing an approved technical plan from `docs/changes/<plan_path>/plan.md`. These plans contain phases with specific changes and success criteria.\n\n## Getting Started\n\nWhen given a plan path:\n\n- Read the plan completely and check for any existing checkmarks (- [x])\n- Read the original ticket and all files mentioned in the plan\n- **Read files fully** - never use limit/offset parameters, you need complete context\n- Think deeply about how the pieces fit together\n- Create a todo list to track your progress\n- Start implementing if you understand what needs to be done\n\nIf no plan path provided, ask for one.\n\n## Implementation Philosophy\n\nPlans are carefully designed, but reality can be messy. Your job is to:\n\n- Follow the plan''s intent while adapting to what you find\n- Implement each phase fully before moving to the next\n- Verify your work makes sense in the broader codebase context\n- Update checkboxes in the plan as you complete sections\n\nWhen things don''t match the plan exactly, think about why and communicate clearly. The plan is your guide, but your judgment matters too.\n\nIf you encounter a mismatch:\n\n- STOP and think deeply about why the plan can''t be followed\n- Present the issue clearly:\n\n  ```\n  Issue in Phase [N]:\n  Expected: [what the plan says]\n  Found: [actual situation]\n  Why this matters: [explanation]\n\n  How should I proceed?\n  ```\n\n## Verification Approach\n\nAfter implementing a phase:\n\n- Run the success criteria checks (usually `make check` covers everything)\n- Fix any issues before proceeding\n- Update your progress in both the plan and your todos\n- Check off completed items in the plan file itself using Edit\n- **Pause for human verification**: After completing all automated verification for a phase, pause and inform the human that the phase is ready for manual testing. Use this format:\n\n  ```\n  Phase [N] Complete - Ready for Manual Verification\n\n  Automated verification passed:\n  - [List automated checks that passed]\n\n  Please perform the manual verification steps listed in the plan:\n  - [List manual verification items from the plan]\n\n  Let me know when manual testing is complete so I can proceed to Phase [N+1].\n  ```\n\nIf instructed to execute multiple phases consecutively, skip the pause until the last phase. Otherwise, assume you are just doing one phase.\n\ndo not check off items in the manual testing steps until confirmed by the user.\n\n## If You Get Stuck\n\nWhen something isn''t working as expected:\n\n- First, make sure you''ve read and understood all the relevant code\n- Consider if the codebase has evolved since the plan was written\n- Present the mismatch clearly and ask for guidance\n\nUse sub-tasks sparingly - mainly for targeted debugging or exploring unfamiliar territory.\n\n## Resuming Work\n\nIf the plan has existing checkmarks:\n\n- Trust that completed work is done\n- Pick up from the first unchecked item\n- Verify previous work only if something seems off\n\nRemember: You''re implementing a solution, not just checking boxes. Keep the end goal in mind and maintain forward momentum.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:14:39.107Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Technical Agents needing to execute complex project plans from Markdown files.","zh":"非常适合需要从 Markdown 文件执行复杂项目计划的技术代理","ja":"マークダウンファイルから複雑なプロジェクトプランを実行する必要があるテクニカルエージェントに最適","ko":"Markdown 파일에서 복잡한 프로젝트 계획을 실행해야 하는 기술 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Técnicos que necesitan ejecutar planes de proyecto complejos desde archivos Markdown.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents techniques ayant besoin d''exécuter des plans de projet complexes à partir de fichiers Markdown.","de":"Perfekt für technische Agenten, die komplexe Projektpläne aus Markdown-Dateien ausführen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Técnicos que precisam executar planos de projeto complexos a partir de arquivos Markdown.","ru":"Идеально для технических агентов, которым необходимо выполнять сложные планы проекта из файлов Markdown.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الفنيين الذين يحتاجون إلى تشغيل خطط مشروع معقدة من ملفات Markdown."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to read and implement approved technical plans from .md files, checking for existing checkmarks and success criteria, and providing complete context by reading files fully without limit/offset parameters, utilizing phases and specific changes.","zh":"赋予代理读取和实施从 .md 文件中批准的技术计划的能力，检查现有的勾选项和成功标准，并通过完全读取文件而不使用限制/偏移参数来提供完整的上下文，利用阶段和特定的更改","ja":"エージェントが.md ファイルから承認された技術計画を読み込み実施する機能を提供し、既存のチェックマークと成功基準を確認し、制限/オフセット パラメータを使用せずにファイルを完全に読み取ることで完全なコンテキストを提供し、フェーズと特定の変更を利用する","ko":"에이전트가 .md 파일에서 승인된 기술 계획을 읽고 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하며, 기존의 체크표시와 성공 기준을 확인하고, 제한/오프셋 매개변수 없이 파일을 완전히 읽어完整한 컨텍스트를 제공하며, 단계와 특정 변경 사항을 활용","es":"Habilita a los agentes a leer e implementar planes técnicos aprobados desde archivos .md, comprobando la existencia de casillas de verificación y criterios de éxito, y proporcionando un contexto completo leyendo los archivos completamente sin parámetros de límite/desplazamiento, utilizando fases y cambios específicos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de lire et de mettre en œuvre des plans techniques approuvés à partir de fichiers .md, en vérifiant l''existence de cases à cocher et de critères de réussite, et en fournissant un contexte complet en lisant les fichiers en entier sans paramètres de limite/décalage, en utilisant des phases et des changements spécifiques.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, genehmigte technische Pläne aus .md-Dateien zu lesen und umzusetzen, indem es die Existenz von Überprüfungskästchen und Erfolgskriterien überprüft und einen vollständigen Kontext bereitstellt, indem es Dateien vollständig ohne Limit/Offset-Parameter liest, Phasen und spezifische Änderungen nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a ler e implementar planos técnicos aprovados a partir de arquivos .md, verificando a existência de marcas de seleção e critérios de sucesso, e fornecendo contexto completo ao ler arquivos integralmente sem parâmetros de limite/offset, utilizando fases e alterações específicas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью читать и реализовывать утвержденные технические планы из файлов .md, проверяя наличие отметок и критериев успеха, и обеспечивая полный контекст путем чтения файлов полностью без параметров лимита/смещения, используя фазы и конкретные изменения.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية قراءة وتنفيذ خطط فنية معتمدة من ملفات .md، والتحقق من وجود علامات التأكيد ومعايير النجاح، وتوفير سياق كامل من خلال قراءة الملفات بالكامل دون 매개erotors لمحددات الحد/الانزلاق، باستخدام المراحل والتغييرات المحددة."},"useCases":{"en":["Executing multi-phase project plans","Validating success criteria for technical changes","Reading and implementing plans from Markdown files"],"zh":["执行多阶段项目计划","验证技术更改的成功标准","从 Markdown 文件中读取和实施计划"],"ja":["マルチフェーズ プロジェクト プランの実行","技術変更の成功基準の検証","マークダウン ファイルから計画を読み込み実施"],"ko":["다단계 프로젝트 계획 실행","기술 변경의 성공 기준 검증","Markdown 파일에서 계획 읽기 및 구현"],"es":["Ejecutar planes de proyecto de múltiples fases","Validar criterios de éxito para cambios técnicos","Leer e implementar planes desde archivos Markdown"],"fr":["Exécuter des plans de projet à plusieurs phases","Valider les critères de réussite pour les changements techniques","Lire et mettre en œuvre des plans à partir de fichiers Markdown"],"de":["Ausführen von Projektplänen mit mehreren Phasen","Überprüfen von Erfolgskriterien für technische Änderungen","Lesen und Umsetzen von Plänen aus Markdown-Dateien"],"pt":["Executando planos de projeto de múltiplas fases","Validando critérios de sucesso para alterações técnicas","Lendo e implementando planos a partir de arquivos Markdown"],"ru":["Выполняя многофазные планы проекта","Проверяя критерии успеха для технических изменений","Читая и реализуя планы из файлов Markdown"],"ar":["تشغيل خطط مشروع متعددة المراحل","التحقق من معايير النجاح للتغييرات الفنية","قراءة وتنفيذ خطط من ملفات Markdown"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to plan files in .md format","Needs complete file context without limit/offset parameters"],"zh":["需要访问 .md 格式的计划文件","需要没有限制/偏移参数的完整文件上下文"],"ja":[".md 形式の計画ファイルへのアクセスが必要","制限/オフセット パラメータなしの完全なファイル コンテキストが必要"],"ko":[".md 형식의 계획 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","제한/오프셋 매개변수 없이 완전한 파일 컨텍스트가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de planificación en formato .md","Necesita un contexto de archivo completo sin parámetros de límite/desplazamiento"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de planification au format .md","Nécessite un contexte de fichier complet sans paramètres de limite/décalage"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf Planungsdateien im .md-Format","Benötigt einen vollständigen Dateikontext ohne Limit/Offset-Parameter"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de plano no formato .md","Necessita de contexto de arquivo completo sem parâmetros de limite/offset"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам плана в формате .md","Требует полного контекста файла без параметров лимита/смещения"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات الخطة بتنسيق .md","يتطلب سياق ملف كامل دون 매개erotors لمحددات الحد/الانزلاق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"14a8d30d0913596f5b6d0116eef3e2128e46f0fd0a17d566dbf64a64b6b6cf91","qualityScore":25}');
