ia da produtividade","Suporte à colaboração em equipe"],"ru":["Паттерны рабочего процесса Git","Оптимизация разработки программного обеспечения","Активное сообщество","Интеграция с ИИ Агентами","Повышение производительности","Поддержка командной работы"],"ar":["أنماط لتدفق العمل جيت","تحسين تطوير البرمجيات","مجتمع نشط","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الإنتاجية","دعم العمل الجماعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["git-workflow社区模式","AI工具开发","如何使用git-workflow","git-workflow安装","git-workflow教程","git-workflow vs github","git-workflow替代品","git-workflow setup guide"],"ja":["git-workflowコミュニティパターン","AIエージェント開発","git-workflowの使い方","git-workflowインストール","git-workflowチュートリアル","git-workflow vs github","git-workflowの代替","git-workflow設定ガイド"],"ko":["git-workflow 커뮤니티 패턴","AI 에이전트 개발","git-workflow 사용 방법","git-workflow 설치","git-workflow 튜토리얼","git-workflow vs github","git-workflow 대체","git-workflow 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de flujo de trabajo Git","patrones de flujo de trabajo","colaboración en proyectos","productividad de desarrollo","git workflow alternativa","instalación de git","guía de configuración de git"],"fr":["outils de workflow Git","modèles de workflow","collaboration sur des projets","productivité de développement","alternative de workflow Git","installation de git","guide de configuration de git"],"de":["Git-Workflow-Tools","Git-Workflow-Muster","Zusammenarbeit an Projekten","Entwicklungsproduktivität","Git-Workflow-Alternative","Git-Installation","Git-Konfigurationsanleitung"],"pt":["como usar git-workflow","o que é git-workflow","ferramentas de AI para desenvolvimento de software","git-workflow vs github","instalação do git-workflow","guia de configuração do git-workflow","alternativas ao git-workflow","melhores práticas para git-workflow","exemplos de uso do git-workflow"],"ru":["как использовать git-workflow","что такое git-workflow","ИИ Агенты для разработки программного обеспечения","git-workflow vs github","установка git-workflow","руководство по настройке git-workflow","альтернативы git-workflow","лучшие практики для git-workflow","примеры использования git-workflow"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام جيت-ووركفلو","ما هو جيت-ووركفلو","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لتطوير البرمجيات","جيت-ووركفلو vs جيت هب","تثبيت جيت-ووركفلو","دليل إعداد جيت-ووركفلو","بديلات جيت-ووركفلو","أفضل الممارسات لجيت-ووركفلو","أمثلة على استخدام جيت-ووركفلو"]}},"owner":"jkomoros","repo":"community-patterns","repoPath":"jkomoros/community-patterns","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.683Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"git-workflow","description":">","bodyPreview":"# Git Workflow\n\n## Committing Work\n\n```bash\ncd ~/Code/community-patterns\n\ngit add patterns/$GITHUB_USER/pattern.tsx\ngit commit -m \"Add pattern: description\"\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Getting Updates (Already done in Step 1)\n\n```bash\ngit fetch upstream\ngit pull --rebase upstream main\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Sharing Work Upstream (Creating Pull Requests)\n\n**IMPORTANT: Wait for user to tell you to create a PR.** Don''t push or create PRs automatically.\n\n**Before creating any PR, you MUST upd","body":"# Git Workflow\n\n## Committing Work\n\n```bash\ncd ~/Code/community-patterns\n\ngit add patterns/$GITHUB_USER/pattern.tsx\ngit commit -m \"Add pattern: description\"\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Getting Updates (Already done in Step 1)\n\n```bash\ngit fetch upstream\ngit pull --rebase upstream main\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n## Sharing Work Upstream (Creating Pull Requests)\n\n**IMPORTANT: Wait for user to tell you to create a PR.** Don''t push or create PRs automatically.\n\n**Before creating any PR, you MUST update from main and rebase your branch:**\n\n### Step 0: Update and Rebase Before Creating PR\n\n**Use cached repository type from workspace config:**\n\n```bash\n# Read IS_FORK from .claude-workspace (set during Step 2)\nIS_FORK=$(grep \"^is_fork=\" .claude-workspace | cut -d= -f2)\n\n# Determine which remote to use\nif [ \"$IS_FORK\" = \"true\" ]; then\n  echo \"Working on fork - will fetch from upstream\"\n  MAIN_REMOTE=\"upstream\"\nelse\n  echo \"Working on main repo - will fetch from origin\"\n  MAIN_REMOTE=\"origin\"\nfi\n```\n\n**Then fetch latest main and rebase your branch:**\n\n```bash\n# Fetch latest main\ngit fetch $MAIN_REMOTE\n\n# Rebase current branch on top of main\ngit rebase $MAIN_REMOTE/main\n\n# If rebase succeeds, push (force-with-lease if on feature branch)\nif [ \"$(git branch --show-current)\" != \"main\" ]; then\n  git push origin $(git branch --show-current) --force-with-lease\nelse\n  git push origin main\nfi\n```\n\n**If rebase has conflicts:**\n1. Show conflict files: `git status`\n2. Help resolve conflicts\n3. Continue: `git rebase --continue`\n4. Then push\n\n**Why this matters:**\n- Ensures your PR is based on the latest main\n- Avoids merge conflicts during PR review\n- Makes PR review easier\n\n---\n\n### If User Has Their Own Fork (Most Common)\n\nWhen user wants to contribute patterns from their fork to upstream:\n\n**Step 1: Ensure changes are committed and pushed to their fork**\n```bash\ncd ~/Code/community-patterns\ngit status  # Verify all changes are committed\ngit push origin main\n```\n\n**Step 2: Update and rebase (see Step 0 above)**\n\n**Step 3: Create pull request to upstream**\n```bash\ngh pr create \\\n  --repo jkomoros/community-patterns \\\n  --title \"Add: pattern name\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n- Brief description of the pattern\n- Key features\n- Use cases\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Pattern compiles without errors\n- [x] Tested in browser at http://localhost:8000\n- [x] All features working as expected\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n### If Working Directly on jkomoros/community-patterns\n\n**CRITICAL: When working directly on the upstream repository, you MUST use branches and PRs. Direct pushes to main are NOT allowed.**\n\n**Step 1: Create feature branch**\n```bash\ncd ~/Code/community-patterns\ngit checkout -b username/feature-name\n```\n\n**Step 2: Commit and push branch**\n```bash\ngit add patterns/$GITHUB_USER/\ngit commit -m \"Add: pattern name\"\ngit push origin username/feature-name\n```\n\n**Step 3: Update and rebase (see Step 0 above)**\n\n**Step 4: Create pull request**\n```bash\ngh pr create \\\n  --title \"Add: pattern name\" \\\n  --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n## Summary\n- Brief description\n\n## Testing\n- [x] Tested and working\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**Step 5: Merge with rebase (when approved)**\n```bash\ngh pr merge PR_NUMBER --rebase --delete-branch\n```\n\n### Important Notes\n\n- **Always wait for user permission** before creating PRs\n- **All PRs are merged with `--rebase`** (NOT `--squash` or `--merge`)\n- This preserves individual commit history\n- Commit frequently locally, but only create PR when user asks\n- PRs will be reviewed before merging to upstream\n- After merge, everyone gets your patterns automatically on next update\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:25:24.283Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Version Control Agents requiring streamlined Git workflow automation and collaboration.","zh":"非常适合需要流线化 Git 工作流自动化和协作的版本控制代理。","ja":"バージョン管理エージェントが Git ワークフロー自動化とコラボレーションを簡素化する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"Git 워크플로 자동화 및 협업을 간소화해야 하는 버전 제어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Version Control Agents que requieren una automatización de flujo de trabajo de Git y colaboración optimizada.","fr":"Idéal pour les Version Control Agents nécessitant une automatisation de workflow de Git et une collaboration optimisée.","de":"Ideal für Version Control Agents, die eine automatisierte Git-Workflow-Automatisierung und eine optimierte Zusammenarbeit benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Controle de Versão que requerem automação de fluxo de trabalho do Git e colaboração simplificados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов контроля версий, требующих автоматизации рабочего процесса Git и упрощенной совместной работы.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التحكم في الإصدار الذين يتطلبون تلقيم تشغيل Git وتعاون مبسط."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Git repositories efficiently, utilizing protocols like Git fetch and push, and handling pull requests with precision, all while maintaining a clean commit history through rebasing.","zh":"赋予代理管理 Git 仓库的能力，利用 Git fetch 和 push 等协议，精确处理拉取请求，并通过变基保持干净的提交历史。","ja":"エージェントが Git リポジトリを効率的に管理できるようにし、Git fetch や push などのプロトコルを利用してプルリクエストを正確に処理し、リベースを利用してクリーンなコミット履歴を維持します。","ko":"에이전트가 Git 리포지토리를 효율적으로 관리할 수 있도록 하며 Git fetch 및 push와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 풀 요청을 정밀하게 처리하고 리베이스를 통해 깨끗한 커밋 기록을 유지합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para gestionar los repositorios de Git de manera eficiente, utilizando protocolos como Git fetch y push, y manejar las solicitudes de pull con precisión, todo mientras mantiene una historia de commit limpia a través de rebasing.","fr":"Empodera les agents pour gérer les dépôts de Git de manière efficace, en utilisant des protocoles comme Git fetch et push, et en gérant les demandes de pull avec précision, tout en maintenant une histoire de commit propre grâce au rebasing.","de":"Empodera die Agenten, um die Git-Repositorys effizient zu verwalten, indem sie Protokolle wie Git fetch und push verwenden und Pull-Anfragen mit Präzision bearbeiten, alles während sie eine saubere Commit-Historie durch Rebasing aufrechterhalten.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerenciem repositórios Git de forma eficiente, utilizando protocolos como Git fetch e push, e lidem com solicitações de pull com precisão, mantendo um histórico de commits limpo por meio do rebase.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью эффективно управлять репозиториями Git, используя протоколы như Git fetch и push, и обрабатывать запросы на слияние с точностью, поддерживая чистую историю коммитов посредством ребейза.","ar":"يوفر للعميل القدرة على إدارة مستودعات Git بفعالية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Git fetch و push، وت处理 طلبات السحب بدقة، مع الحفاظ على تاريخ إلتزامات نظيف من خلال إعادة البناء."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating commit and push operations for community pattern repositories","Updating local repositories with upstream changes using Git fetch and pull","Creating pull requests for sharing work and collaborating with the community"],"zh":["自动执行社区模式仓库的提交和推送操作","使用 Git fetch 和拉取更新本地仓库以获取上游更改","创建拉取请求以共享工作成果并与社区协作"],"ja":["コミュニティ パターン リポジトリのコミットとプッシュ操作を自動化する","Git fetch と pull を使用して、ローカル リポジトリを上流の変更で更新する","コミュニティと共同作業するために作業成果を共有するプルリクエストを作成する"],"ko":["커뮤니티 패턴 리포지토리의 커밋 및 푸시 작업을 자동화합니다.","Git fetch 및 풀을 사용하여 로컬 리포지토리를 업스트림 변경으로 업데이트합니다.","작업 결과를 공유하고 커뮤니티와 협업하기 위해 풀 요청을 생성합니다."],"es":["Automar las operaciones de commit y push para los repositorios de patrones de comunidad","Actualizar los repositorios locales con cambios de upstream utilizando Git fetch y pull","Crear solicitudes de pull para compartir trabajo y colaborar con la comunidad"],"fr":["Automatiser les opérations de commit et de push pour les dépôts de modèles de communauté","Mettre à jour les dépôts locaux avec les changements de upstream en utilisant Git fetch et pull","Créer des demandes de pull pour partager le travail et collaborer avec la communauté"],"de":["Automatisieren Sie die Commit- und Push-Operationen für die Community-Muster-Repositorys","Aktualisieren Sie die lokalen Repositorys mit den Änderungen von upstream, indem Sie Git fetch und pull verwenden","Erstellen Sie Pull-Anfragen, um Arbeit zu teilen und mit der Community zusammenzuarbeiten"],"pt":["Automatizar operações de commit e push para repositórios de padrões da comunidade","Atualizar repositórios locais com alterações upstream usando Git fetch e pull","Criar solicitações de pull para compartilhar trabalho e colaborar com a comunidade"],"ru":["Автоматизировать операции commit и push для репозиториев шаблонов сообщества","Обновлять локальные репозитории с изменениями upstream с помощью Git fetch и pull","Создавать запросы на слияние для обмена работой и сотрудничества с сообществом"],"ar":["تلقيم عمليات الالتزام والدفع للمستودعات نمط المجتمع","تحديث المستودعات المحلية بالتغيرات principales باستخدام Git fetch و pull","إنشاء طلبات السحب لمشاركة العمل والتعاون مع المجتمع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Git installation and configuration","Needs repository access and permissions","Manual intervention required for creating pull requests"],"zh":["需要 Git 安装和配置","需要仓库访问和权限","创建拉取请求需要手动干预"],"ja":["Git のインストールと設定が必要です","リポジトリへのアクセスと権限が必要です","プルリクエストの作成には手動での介入が必要です"],"ko":["Git 설치 및 구성이 필요합니다.","리포지토리 액세스 및 권한이 필요합니다.","풀 요청을 생성하려면 수동 개입이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere la instalación y configuración de Git","Necesita acceso y permisos de repositorio","Intervención manual requerida para crear solicitudes de pull"],"fr":["Requiert l''installation et la configuration de Git","Nécessite un accès et des permissions de dépôt","Intervention manuelle requise pour créer des demandes de pull"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation und Konfiguration von Git","Benötigt Repository-Zugriff und -Berechtigungen","Manuelle Intervention erforderlich, um Pull-Anfragen zu erstellen"],"pt":["Requer instalação e configuração do Git","Necessita de acesso e permissões de repositório","Intervenção manual necessária para criar solicitações de pull"],"ru":["Требует установки и настройки Git","Требует доступа и разрешений репозитория","Требуется ручное вмешательство для создания запросов на слияние"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت وتكوين Git","يحتاج إلى الوصول والتصريحات للمستودع","يتطلب تدخل يدوي لإنشاء طلبات السحب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"93afdccefe7bfc409a118d9c2f528d039a88cbd699068a15b4beba781eadca1e","qualityScore":25}');
